[{"last_updated":1785656067,"legal":"API Terms of Service: Please link back (with follow, and without nofollow!) to the URL on Remote OK and mention Remote OK as a source, so we get traffic back from your site. If you do not we'll have to suspend API access.\n\nPlease don't use the Remote OK logo without written permission as it's a registered trademark, please DO use our name Remote OK though."},{"slug":"remote-housekeeper-phoenix-senior-living-1135787","id":"1135787","epoch":1785585387,"date":"2026-08-01T11:56:27+00:00","company":"Phoenix Senior Living","company_logo":"","position":"Housekeeper","tags":["ads","sys admin","supervisor","education","senior","non tech"],"description":"Apply<br><br><strong>Description<br><br><\/strong><strong>The Retreat at Canton<\/strong> is seeking a FT Housekeeper to join their team!<br><br><strong>Shift Details<br><br><\/strong><strong>Housekeeper<br><br><\/strong>Tuesday-Saturday<br><br>The Housekeeper is responsible for performing all housekeeping activities such as, but not limited to, dusting, vacuuming, sweeping, mopping, laundry, shampooing carpets, scrubbing bathrooms, cleaning counters, taking out the trash and cleaning windows. Responsibilities also include restocking common area bistro\u00e2\u0080\u0099s and bathrooms, resident rooms and bathrooms with the appropriate paper products and hand soap.<br><br><strong>Principle Duties And Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong>Housekeeping<br><br><ul><li>Follow detailed cleaning worksheet\/ checklist for each room and common area<\/li><li>Responsible for the set-up and mixing of water and detergents, in proper containers to prepare cleaning solutions, according to specifications<\/li><li>Follow procedures for the use of chemical cleaners and power equipment, in order to prevent damage to floors and fixtures<\/li><li>Clean community common area and resident room(s) floors and walls by sweeping, mopping, scrubbing, and \/ or vacuuming<\/li><li>Steam clean or shampoo carpet<\/li><li>Dust furniture, walls, machines and equipment which include moving furniture around<\/li><li>Clean windows, glass partitions, and mirrors, using soapy water or other cleaner, sponges and squeegees<\/li><li>Make adjustments to heating cooling and ventilation system which may include changing filters<\/li><li>Gather and empty trash<\/li><li>Remove debris from outdoor porches, parking lot and dumpster area<\/li><li>Ensure all bathrooms (common area, resident) are stocked with toilet paper, paper towels, Kleenex and liquid and soap<\/li><li>Replace light bulbs throughout the community<\/li><li>Ensure all suites that have 2 residents residing are cleaned twice a week<\/li><li>Notify supervisor, by documenting in the maintenance log and housekeeping checklist, concerning the need for major repairs or additions to the building operating systems<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>#86pgm<br><br><\/strong><strong>Requirements<br><br><\/strong><strong>EDUCATION\/EXPERIENCE\/LICENSURE- CERTIFICATION<br><br><\/strong><strong>Housekeeper<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Education: High School Diploma\/ GED required<\/li><li>One (1) year job related experience<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Skills And Abilities<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Understanding of infection control procedures<\/li><li>Demonstrate the ability to Multi task and Manage Stress<\/li><li>Understands and embraces the assisted living philosophy<\/li><li>Ability to work weekends, evenings and flexible hours, available for our customers at peak service delivery days and times<\/li><li>Possess written and verbal skills for effective communication<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **VERSATILITY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Retreat, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-housekeeper-phoenix-senior-living-1135787","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-housekeeper-phoenix-senior-living-1135787"},{"slug":"remote-unc-livesomewhere-1135777","id":"1135777","epoch":1785579958,"date":"2026-08-01T10:25:58+00:00","company":"LiveSomeWhere","company_logo":"","position":"UNC","tags":["education","non tech"],"description":"Vip section is displayed first, it is only after site navigations such as menus and core links. Interested in advertising? Feel free to email Vip @at LiveSomeWhere.com<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PLEASURABLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Chapel Hill, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-unc-livesomewhere-1135777","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-unc-livesomewhere-1135777"},{"slug":"remote-rochester-livesomewhere-1135779","id":"1135779","epoch":1785579850,"date":"2026-08-01T10:24:10+00:00","company":"LiveSomeWhere","company_logo":"","position":"ROCHESTER","tags":["education","non tech"],"description":"Vip section is displayed first, it is only after site navigations such as menus and core links. Interested in advertising? Feel free to email Vip @at LiveSomeWhere.com<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **COMPASSION** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Rochester, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-rochester-livesomewhere-1135779","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-rochester-livesomewhere-1135779"},{"slug":"remote-elite-social-value-inc-1135776","id":"1135776","epoch":1785578904,"date":"2026-08-01T10:08:24+00:00","company":"Social Value, Inc.","company_logo":"","position":"Elite","tags":["education","non tech"],"description":"<ul><li>Full access to modern training facilities<\/li><li>Use of cardio + weight equipment<\/li><li>Locker room access<\/li><li>Monthly guest pass<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HEARTEN** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Every, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-elite-social-value-inc-1135776","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-elite-social-value-inc-1135776"},{"slug":"remote-basic-social-value-inc-1135775","id":"1135775","epoch":1785578896,"date":"2026-08-01T10:08:16+00:00","company":"Social Value, Inc.","company_logo":"","position":"Basic","tags":["education","non tech"],"description":"<ul><li>Full access to modern training facilities<\/li><li>Use of cardio + weight equipment<\/li><li>Locker room access<\/li><li>Monthly guest pass<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STRIKINGLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Every, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-basic-social-value-inc-1135775","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-basic-social-value-inc-1135775"},{"slug":"remote-y-combinator-aceleradora-de-startups-espanol-sin-fronteras-1135762","id":"1135762","epoch":1785554833,"date":"2026-08-01T03:27:13+00:00","company":"Espa\u00c3\u00b1ol Sin Fronteras","company_logo":"","position":"Y Combinator \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Aceleradora de Startups","tags":["dev","speech","finance","exec","ops","golang","digital nomad"],"description":"Sobre el programa<br><br>Y Combinator es la aceleradora de startups m\u00c3\u00a1s influyente del mundo. Ha lanzado empresas como Airbnb, Dropbox, Stripe, Reddit y Coinbase. YC invierte USD 500,000 en cada startup seleccionada a cambio de 7% de participaci\u00c3\u00b3n. El programa dura 3 meses (en l\u00c3\u00adnea o en San Francisco) e incluye mentor\u00c3\u00ada intensiva, acceso a la red de ex-alumnos YC, y Demo Day frente a los mejores inversores del mundo. Est\u00c3\u00a1 abierto a fundadores de cualquier pa\u00c3\u00ads \u00e2\u0080\u0094 hay varios ex-alumnos latinoamericanos y peruanos. Aplican equipos con un MVP o idea muy clara.<br><br>\u00c3\u0081rea de actuaci\u00c3\u00b3n<br><br>Tecnolog\u00c3\u00adaStartupsIAFintechSaaSSalud Digital<br><br>Elegibilidad y gu\u00c3\u00ada de aplicaci\u00c3\u00b3n<br><br>Equipos fundadores de cualquier pa\u00c3\u00ads con startup en etapa temprana. No hay restricci\u00c3\u00b3n de edad. Se requiere ingl\u00c3\u00a9s fluido y una idea con tracci\u00c3\u00b3n.<br><br>Sobre el proceso<br><br>Visita ycombinator.com\/apply \u00e2\u0086\u0092 Completa la aplicaci\u00c3\u00b3n online \u00e2\u0086\u0092 Si pasan \u00e2\u0086\u0092 Entrevista de 10 minutos \u00e2\u0086\u0092 Decisi\u00c3\u00b3n \u00e2\u0086\u0092 Si entran, comienza el batch.<br><br>Links \u00c3\u00batiles<br><br>Aplica a Y Combinator<br><br>Tags<br><br>#Y Combinator#YC#startup#aceleradora#inversi\u00c3\u00b3n#emprendimiento#San Francisco<br><br>Acceso r\u00c3\u00a1pido<br><br>Ve directo al sitio oficial de la oportunidad.<br><br>Aplicar ahora<br><br>Plazo de inscripci\u00c3\u00b3n<br><br>Dos convocatorias: enero y septiembre<br><br>Localizaci\u00c3\u00b3n<br><br>Presencial \/ Virtual<br><br>Nivel<br><br>Universidad<br><br>Costo<br><br>Con costo<br><br>Idioma<br><br>English<br><br>Ver todas las oportunidades<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LOVABLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Y Ff\u00c3\u00b4r, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-y-combinator-aceleradora-de-startups-espanol-sin-fronteras-1135762","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-y-combinator-aceleradora-de-startups-espanol-sin-fronteras-1135762"},{"slug":"remote-estimator-mtrec-recruitment-1135768","id":"1135768","epoch":1785552281,"date":"2026-08-01T02:44:41+00:00","company":"MTrec Recruitment","company_logo":"","position":"Estimator","tags":["sys admin","exec","finance","scheme","excel","sales","engineer","recruiter"],"description":"<p><strong>MTrecs new career opportunity<\/strong><\/p><p>Our client are specialists in their market sector; they are now looking to recruit an Estimator on a permanent basis.<\/p><p>If you have estimating experience within a machining environment, this role could be ideal for you.<\/p><p><strong>The Job youll do<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><span>The successful applicant will report directly to the Sales Director whilst supporting a busy production team. <\/span><\/li><li><span>Ideally with a background in machining and with experience of calculating time spent on tasks within a machine shop. <\/span><\/li><li><span>Calculate job costs using company ERP system, EFACS.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Utilise sketches and drawings to determine task times in a conventional machine shop.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Source material and subcontract prices.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Interpret detailed repair plans to estimate the costs of service\/repair jobs.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Collate all the above into complete repair quotes and draft quotations to the customer.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Maintain records of calculations in a database.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Utilise same database to improve efficiency.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>About You<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><span>Fully committed to Quality, Cost and Delivery.<\/span><\/li><li><span>An accurate and flexible approach to all matters.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Proficient in Excel and Word with good experience of ERP systems.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ability to work within a small but multi-disciplined team.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Mechanical Engineering background.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>The Rewards and the Benefits<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><span>Salary negotiable dependent on experience.<\/span><\/li><li><span>37 Hours per week: 07:30  16:00 Monday to Friday, 07:30  12:30 Friday.<\/span><\/li><li><span>25 days per year, plus bank holidays.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Cycle to Work Scheme.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Radius Allowance payable based on commute to work miles.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Death in Service Insurance.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Income Protection Insurance.<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **DOUBTLESS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Consett, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-estimator-mtrec-recruitment-1135768","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-estimator-mtrec-recruitment-1135768"},{"slug":"remote-estimator-one-way-1135769","id":"1135769","epoch":1785552213,"date":"2026-08-01T02:43:33+00:00","company":"One Way","company_logo":"","position":"Estimator","tags":["sys admin","exec","finance","scheme","excel","sales","engineer","recruiter","education","ops"],"description":"<span>Estimator required to join leading new build \/ refurbishment contractor based in the Oxford area. The Estimator will be overseeing various new build \/ refurbishment \/ fit out projects with typical values ranging from \u00c2\u00a3100k up to \u00c2\u00a310m. The Estimator will have a solid background in estimating gained with a main contractor or been involved in new build \/ refurbishment \/fit out projects. The Estimator will be responsible for PQQs, Estimating, tender submissions, liaising with and working alongside colleagues from the commercial, planning and operational departments. For the Estimator role our client offers a competitive salary and package, on going training and development.<br><\/span><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **REMUNERATE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Oxford, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-estimator-one-way-1135769","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-estimator-one-way-1135769"},{"slug":"remote-service-locator-bam-uk-amp-ireland-1135771","id":"1135771","epoch":1785552205,"date":"2026-08-01T02:43:25+00:00","company":"BAM UK &amp; Ireland","company_logo":"","position":"Service Locator","tags":["sys admin","exec","finance","scheme","excel","sales","engineer","recruiter","education","ops","customer support","infosec","travel","medical"],"description":"<span><strong>Building a sustainable tomorrow<\/strong><\/span><p>KierBAM are a Joint Venture (JV) partnership between Kier and BAM UK &amp; Ireland - BAM UK &amp; Ireland's infrastructure segment is currently delivering the redevelopment project at a Royal Navy site located in Plymouth and we are seeking an experienced Service Locator.<\/p><p><br>The Service Locator will carry out the physical check and survey of all of the underground services within the area that is being investigated, the Service Locator will have the following responsibilities. You will use various geophysical techniques to locate the service, once they have been found, the services will be marked\/spray painted onto the ground in the appropriate colour, defining the type and depth of the service. You will also maintain the contents of the permits on site, making sure the workforce remains compliant with conditions and processes outlined within the permits.<\/p><p><span>Due to the site being a high-security military naval base, additional security checks will be required  a BPSS level of security clearance is necessary. These checks can take up to 8 weeks to process. Only candidates holding EU, NATO, 5 Eyes, or MISWG member passports and who have been UK residents for the last 5 years can be considered for this role.<\/span><\/p><span><strong>Your team<\/strong><\/span><ul><li>Location: Devonport Dockyard, Plymouth<\/li><li>Contract: Permanent, 42.5 hours a week<\/li><\/ul><span><strong>Making Possible<\/strong><\/span><p>In this role as Service Locator, you will be working in a live MOD facility. Your day-to-day tasks will include:<\/p><ul><li>Authorise Permit to Break Surface<\/li><li>Ensure compliance with and enforcement of the project permit for the Break Ground procedure<\/li><li>Review method statements tailored to specific tasks<\/li><li>Mark all services within the work boundaries to protect colour standards<\/li><li>Provide teams with an overview of the services within their designated work boundaries and discuss methods for working around those affected services.<\/li><li>Implement an 8-point checklist during work gang briefings<\/li><li>Enforce any designated exclusion zones surrounding affected services<\/li><li>Obtain the required signatures for permit approval from the works team and the Project Engineer<\/li><li>Notify the BOSC of any discrepancies in the records<\/li><li>Investigate uncharted services as directed by the BOSC<\/li><li>Inform the BOSC of any services that have been removed from the work area, ensuring the service drawings are updated accordingly<\/li><li>Attach the most current SMD CAD drawing to the permit-to-dig<\/li><li>Ensure that no work gang operates under an expired permit for breaking ground or in an area lacking a permit.<\/li><li>Maintain service markings for the duration of the permit as well as incremental scans as excavations progress<\/li><li>This profile is not exhaustive. From time to time, you may be required by the Company to perform other tasks, which are not included in the above description, but are within your capabilities and, where necessary, training, and full support will be given<\/li><\/ul><span><strong>What do you bring to the role?<\/strong><\/span><p><span>Essential:<\/span><\/p><ul><li>We are seeking a candidate who can handle multiple tasks, show flexibility, and become a key contributor to our team<\/li><li>A CSCS Card is required (this must be obtained before commencing work)<\/li><li>Familiarity with Electromagnetic location and ground penetrating radar is essential<\/li><li>A solid understanding of industry practices and standards related to utility detection, including PAS 128 and TSA, is important<\/li><li>Candidates should have a proficient working knowledge of surveying equipment, such as GPR, CAT, and Genny utility detection tools<\/li><li>The ability to collaborate and communicate effectively within a team and interact with clients on-site is required<\/li><li>Knowledge of HSG-47 and GS-6<\/li><\/ul><p><span>Desirable<\/span><\/p><ul><li>Experience in the Nuclear environment would be considered beneficial<\/li><li>QCF Level 3 or Level 5 certification in utility mapping is preferred<\/li><li>Applicants should possess a minimum of 2-3 years of utility surveying experience<\/li><\/ul><span><strong>Whats in it for you?<\/strong><\/span><ul><li>Competitive salary<\/li><li>A wide range of family-friendly policies<\/li><li>Company car\/car allowance\/travel allowance<\/li><li>8 % matched pension contributions<\/li><li>Private healthcare<\/li><li>Life assurance<\/li><li>26 days holiday<\/li><li>2 wellbeing days<\/li><li>1 volunteering day<\/li><li>Personal and professional development<\/li><\/ul><span><strong>About BAM<\/strong><\/span><p>Building a sustainable tomorrow. Thats our mission and our promise at BAM. Its how we engineer vital infrastructure and construct high-quality buildings as one of the largest construction companies in Europe.<\/p><p>We strive to create an environment where everybody feels welcome and valued. Were on an exciting journey to employ the best talent to join us regardless of social background, race, colour, religion, national or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, disability or other characteristics.<br><\/p><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EASED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Plymouth, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-service-locator-bam-uk-amp-ireland-1135771","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-service-locator-bam-uk-amp-ireland-1135771"},{"slug":"remote-chief-operating-officer-u-s-hunger-1135756","id":"1135756","epoch":1785549249,"date":"2026-08-01T01:54:09+00:00","company":"U.S. Hunger","company_logo":"","position":"Chief Operating Officer","tags":["exec","customer support","marketing","travel","legal","sales","medical","full time","hr","consulting","recruiter","speech","education","microsoft","mobile","excel","design","ops","finance","c","senior","stats","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>Description<br><br><\/strong>The Chief Operating Officer (COO) is the senior operational leader of U.S. Hunger, responsible for translating enterprise strategy into daily execution. This role owns P&amp;L performance across all business lines \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Full Cart, Hunger Projects, and the Data\/Intelligence engine \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring the organization's earned-income model (97%+ of total revenue) operates with precision, accountability, and scalability.<br><br>The COO must bring the instincts of an entrepreneur and the discipline of a corporate operator: connecting dots others miss, asking tough questions that drive clarity, and building the systems that allow talented leaders to perform at their highest level. Operational excellence and mission-aligned impact are not in tension here \u00e2\u0080\u0094 they are the same thing.<br><br><strong>Enterprise Operations &amp; P&amp;L Execution<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Own P&amp;L execution across all business lines \u00e2\u0080\u0094 each engine must meet its margin, revenue, and impact targets.<\/li><li>Establish and drive the operating cadence \u00e2\u0080\u0094 monthly reviews, quarterly business performance reporting, and clear accountability across departments.<\/li><li>Make resource allocation decisions across competing priorities \u00e2\u0080\u0094 deploying people, capital, and attention against the highest-value opportunities.<\/li><li>Present operational performance, capacity, and growth execution to the Board of Directors.<\/li><li>Partner with the CEO on scenario planning, structural growth strategies, and enterprise-wide decision-making.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Program Leadership \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Full Cart &amp; Hunger Projects<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Provide executive oversight of Full Cart and Hunger Projects \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring delivery excellence, measurable outcomes, and scalability.<\/li><li>Partner with program directors to evaluate, evolve, and scale programs in response to partner needs, market opportunities, and operational realities.<\/li><li>Drive integration between program design, data infrastructure, and client-facing delivery \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring mission impact and revenue execution are operationally connected.<\/li><li>Oversee supply chain and logistics operations to ensure consistent, high-quality program delivery at scale.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Revenue Growth &amp; Partner Execution<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Own enterprise revenue execution across health plan partnerships, corporate engagement, and strategic growth opportunities \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring acquisition and retention targets are consistently met.<\/li><li>Drive strategies that deepen existing partner relationships and expand engagement across multiple service lines, maximizing long-term value and organizational sustainability.<\/li><li>Represent U.S. Hunger externally with payors, partners, and stakeholders \u00e2\u0080\u0094 translating operational insight into compelling value propositions that differentiate USH in the market.<\/li><li>Leverage buyer-side CSR experience and existing relationships across the corporate social impact and food access ecosystem to accelerate partner acquisition and deepen engagement.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Cross-Functional Alignment &amp; Executive Leadership<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Partner with the Chief Technology Officer to define business requirements, program design priorities, and operational needs that shape the technology and data roadmap \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring platform delivery enables execution across all business lines.<\/li><li>Manage the VP of Finance &amp; Enterprise KPIs and VP of People &amp; Culture \u00e2\u0080\u0094 two executives who maintain direct visibility to the CEO through their seat at the executive table \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ensuring fiscal discipline, enterprise analytics, and workforce strategy are aligned with operational goals.<\/li><li>Actively contribute to organizational governance, strategy, and enterprise-wide decision-making as the CEO's primary operational counterpart.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Team Leadership &amp; Development<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Build, lead, and develop a high-performing operational leadership team \u00e2\u0080\u0094 setting clear expectations, driving accountability, and coaching leaders who are growing into executive-level roles.<\/li><li>Develop performance metrics and accountability systems that connect individual and team outcomes to enterprise financial and impact objectives.<\/li><li>Promote a culture of rigorous inquiry, collaboration, and continuous improvement \u00e2\u0080\u0094 where leaders are expected to think critically, challenge assumptions, and own their outcomes.<\/li><li>Foster an environment where staff understand both the business drivers of USH's earned-income model and the transformative impact of their work on the communities served.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><em>These essential job functions are not to be construed as a complete statement of all duties performed. Employees will be required to perform other duties as required.<br><br><\/em><strong>Requirements<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>10+ years of progressive leadership in operations, business management, or revenue execution \u00e2\u0080\u0094 with direct P&amp;L ownership.<\/li><li>Experience building, running, or scaling a business \u00e2\u0080\u0094 including sales growth, client retention, and financial performance accountability.<\/li><li>Proven ability to lead and develop directors and VPs \u00e2\u0080\u0094 coaching strong operators into executive-level leaders while holding them accountable to outcomes.<\/li><li>Demonstrated pattern of connecting dots across functions \u00e2\u0080\u0094 seeing how operational, financial, people, and program decisions impact each other.<\/li><li>Experience at the board level \u00e2\u0080\u0094 presenting performance, defending strategy, and engaging C-suite stakeholders directly.<\/li><li>Experience in mission-driven, earned-income environments where market discipline and social impact must coexist.<\/li><li>Strong communication across corporate, nonprofit, healthcare, and community sectors \u00e2\u0080\u0094 direct, polished, and confident.<\/li><li>High emotional intelligence, with the courage to ask tough questions, the polish to challenge constructively, and the vision to see what's possible before it's obvious.<\/li><li> Background check is required for this role<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Essential Physical Skills<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Repetitive finger motion as used in computer use.<\/li><li>Extensive work with computer screens<\/li><li>Everyday requirements of bending, grabbing, holding, and lifting light objects<\/li><li>Work on Hunger Projects requires heavy lifting (up to 50 lbs), moving objects, pushing, and pulling, bending and kneeling<\/li><li>Up to 50% travel time<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EXULTINGLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Longwood, Longwood, Florida, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-chief-operating-officer-u-s-hunger-1135756","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-chief-operating-officer-u-s-hunger-1135756"},{"slug":"remote-safety-advisor-keolis-australia-amp-new-zealand-1135759","id":"1135759","epoch":1785548822,"date":"2026-08-01T01:47:02+00:00","company":"Keolis Australia &amp; New Zealand","company_logo":"","position":"Safety Advisor","tags":["sys admin","recruiter","non tech","design","hr","infosec","teaching","game dev","testing","travel","accounting","finance","video","education","exec","marketing","telecom","legal","sales","medical","full time","part time","digital nomad"],"description":"<p>.<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BECKONS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Adelaide, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-safety-advisor-keolis-australia-amp-new-zealand-1135759","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-safety-advisor-keolis-australia-amp-new-zealand-1135759"},{"slug":"remote-freelance-creative-director-bmwl-1135901","id":"1135901","epoch":1785541115,"date":"2026-07-31T23:38:35+00:00","company":"BMWL","company_logo":"","position":"Freelance Creative Director","tags":["design","amazon","designer","customer support","video","exec","junior","marketing","ecommerce","digital nomad","art direction","consulting","ads","content writing"],"description":"<p><strong>Freelance Creative Director<\/strong><\/p><p><span>BMWL (an Axiom Advisors Group company) \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Remote \/ Contract<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About Us:<\/strong><\/p><p><span>BMWL is a dynamic political consulting and public affairs firm located in the heart of the Bay Area. We specialize in providing strategic communication, advocacy, and campaign management services to a diverse range of clients, including political candidates, advocacy groups, and non-profit organizations. Our team comprises experienced professionals passionate about making a positive impact through effective communication and strategic political consulting.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><span>BMWL is committed to creating a diverse and welcoming workplace and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We encourage all qualified applicants to apply, including people of color, women, LGBTQIA+ individuals, veterans, and persons with disabilities. If you are unsure whether you meet the qualifications for this role but are still interested, we encourage you to apply.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p><span>BMWL is seeking a freelance Creative Director to support branding and media development across our client roster. This is a flexible, project-based engagement ideal for a seasoned creative who thrives working with campaigns, advocacy groups, and public affairs clients.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><span>What You'll Do<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li><span>Develop creative concepts and brand identities for client campaigns, from initial strategy through final execution<\/span><\/li><li><span>Manage media development, including digital ads, video, print collateral, and social content<\/span><\/li><li><span>Draft and manage digital ad copy, either writing it directly or overseeing and QC'ing copy produced by others<\/span><\/li><li><span>Partner with our internal production and account teams to ensure the creative aligns with the campaign strategy and messaging<\/span><\/li><li><span>Present creative concepts to partners and clients, incorporating feedback through revision cycles<\/span><\/li><li><span>Maintain brand consistency across multi-platform deliverables<\/span><\/li><li><span>Stay current on political\/advocacy creative trends and best practices<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><span>What We're Looking For<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li><span>7+ years of creative direction experience, ideally with political, advocacy, or public affairs clients<\/span><\/li><li><span>Strong portfolio spanning brand identity, digital media, and video\/print production<\/span><\/li><li><span>Comfortable working independently and managing multiple client projects simultaneously<\/span><\/li><li><span>Excellent collaborator \u00e2\u0080\u0094 able to take direction from partners while bringing a strong creative point of view<\/span><\/li><li><span>Familiarity with fast-paced campaign timelines and quick-turn deliverables a plus<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><span>Engagement Details<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li><span>Freelance\/contract basis, flexible hours<\/span><\/li><li><span>Remote-friendly, with availability for occasional check-ins with the BMWL\/Axiom team<\/span><\/li><li><span>Rate: $85\u00e2\u0080\u0093$150\/hour (or equivalent day\/project rate), commensurate with experience. Final rate depends on scope, project complexity, and campaign timelines.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span><span class=\"ql-cursor\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><em>To apply, email your resume and availability for a 45-minute meeting to <\/em><em>alisonw@bmwl.net<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **TIMELY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"California, California, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-freelance-creative-director-bmwl-1135901","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-freelance-creative-director-bmwl-1135901"},{"slug":"remote-tequila-market-manager-new-jersey-bandero-tequila-1135754","id":"1135754","epoch":1785537085,"date":"2026-07-31T22:31:25+00:00","company":"Bandero Tequila","company_logo":"","position":"Tequila Market Manager New Jersey","tags":["exec","customer support","marketing","travel","legal","sales","medical","full time"],"description":"Tequila Market Manager \u00e2\u0080\u0093 New Jersey<p><strong>Location:<\/strong> New Jersey<\/p><p><strong>Brand:<\/strong> Bandero Premium Tequila<\/p><p><strong>Employment Type:<\/strong> Full-Time<\/p><p><strong>Compensation:<\/strong> $85,000 Base Salary | Commission | Full Benefits<\/p>About Bandero Premium Tequila<p>Bandero Premium Tequila is a fast-growing premium spirits brand entering an exciting new stage of national expansion. With increasing distribution, major retail opportunities, high-profile events, and strategic partnerships, Bandero is building meaningful momentum across the United States.<\/p><p>The brand is expanding its presence in key markets, developing strong relationships with leading distributors and retailers, and creating memorable consumer experiences through tastings, sponsorships, hospitality programs, and brand activations.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>As Bandero continues to grow its national footprint, New Jersey represents a major opportunity for visibility, influence, and long-term sales growth. We are seeking a driven Market Manager who is excited to help build the market, secure influential placements, and become an important part of the brand\u00e2\u0080\u0099s continued expansion.<\/p><p><br><\/p>Position Overview<p>We are seeking an experienced, connected, and results-driven <strong>New Jersey Market Manager<\/strong> to lead Bandero Premium Tequila\u00e2\u0080\u0099s growth throughout the state.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This is an opportunity to join a growing brand at a pivotal stage and play a direct role in shaping Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s success in one of the country\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most important and competitive wine and spirits markets.<\/p><p>The New Jersey Market Manager will be responsible for increasing sales, supporting distribution teams, securing new on-premise and off-premise placements, and building lasting relationships with key accounts and industry leaders.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>The ideal candidate has strong roots in the New Jersey hospitality and beverage community, existing relationships with buyers and decision-makers, and the entrepreneurial drive to build a premium spirits brand in a competitive market.<\/p><p><br><\/p>Key ResponsibilitiesDistributor Management<ul><li>Work closely with Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s distributor partner to execute sales programs and achieve market goals.<\/li><li>Build strong relationships with distributor leadership, managers, and sales representatives.<\/li><li>Conduct regular distributor meetings, sales presentations, ride-alongs, and account visits.<\/li><li>Motivate and support distributor teams to increase placements, reorders, and overall sales.<\/li><li>Monitor distributor inventory, depletions, execution, and performance against established goals.<\/li><li>Ensure distributor activities remain aligned with Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s sales strategy and premium brand positioning.<\/li><\/ul>Account Management and Sales<ul><li>Leverage existing relationships and build new connections to grow Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s presence throughout New Jersey.<\/li><li>Secure new on-premise and off-premise placements.<\/li><li>Develop relationships with key buyers, beverage directors, restaurant groups, retailers, bars, hotels, lounges, nightclubs, and other influential accounts.<\/li><li>Manage existing accounts and identify opportunities to increase reorders, menu placements, displays, and promotional support.<\/li><li>Create targeted sales plans for priority accounts and high-value opportunities.<\/li><li>Maintain a consistent market presence through regular account visits and follow-up.<\/li><\/ul>Brand Building<ul><li>Serve as a knowledgeable and enthusiastic ambassador for Bandero Premium Tequila.<\/li><li>Host tastings, staff trainings, buyer presentations, events, and activations that reflect Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s premium image.<\/li><li>Educate distributor teams, retail staff, bartenders, servers, and consumers on the Bandero portfolio and brand story.<\/li><li>Identify local partnerships, sponsorships, and events that can increase visibility and consumer engagement.<\/li><li>Ensure Bandero is represented professionally and consistently across all customer and consumer interactions.<\/li><\/ul>Market Development<ul><li>Identify opportunities for expansion throughout New Jersey.<\/li><li>Monitor competitive brands, pricing, promotions, account activity, and market trends.<\/li><li>Provide insight into the New Jersey market landscape, culture, and key industry players.<\/li><li>Help develop localized sales, marketing, promotional, and activation strategies.<\/li><li>Collaborate with company leadership on programs designed to increase distribution and brand awareness.<\/li><\/ul>Reporting and KPIs<ul><li>Track and report on placements, reorders, depletions, sales targets, account activity, and promotional effectiveness.<\/li><li>Maintain an organized pipeline of prospective and active accounts.<\/li><li>Provide regular market updates, sales reports, competitive insights, and opportunity assessments.<\/li><li>Manage market expenses responsibly and submit timely documentation.<\/li><li>Work toward clearly defined sales and distribution goals.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p>Qualifications<ul><li>Proven experience in sales, brand building, market management, or account management in the New Jersey market.<\/li><li>Existing relationships with New Jersey buyers, distributors, retailers, restaurants, bars, hotels, nightlife venues, or hospitality groups are strongly preferred.<\/li><li>An established book of business is a significant plus.<\/li><li>Demonstrated success opening new accounts and growing existing business.<\/li><li>Experience managing, supporting, and motivating distributor partners.<\/li><li>Strong understanding of the New Jersey wine and spirits market, including its culture, key accounts, and industry landscape.<\/li><li>Excellent communication, presentation, negotiation, relationship-management, and organizational skills.<\/li><li>Self-motivated and able to manage a large territory independently.<\/li><li>Comfortable working in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment.<\/li><li>Passionate about premium spirits and building a growing brand from the ground up.<\/li><li>Ability to work flexible hours, including occasional nights and weekends, for events, tastings, and activations.<\/li><li>Ability and willingness to travel throughout New Jersey as required.<\/li><li>Valid driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license, clean driving record, and reliable transportation.<\/li><li>Must meet all legal requirements for representing and promoting an alcoholic beverage brand.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p>What We Offer<ul><li>$85,000 annual base salary.<\/li><li>Commission based on sales performance.<\/li><li>Health, dental, and vision insurance.<\/li><li>Accrued paid time off and sick time.<\/li><li>Paid company holidays.<\/li><li>Reimbursement for approved business and travel expenses.<\/li><li>Dynamic and entrepreneurial work environment.<\/li><li>Opportunity to play a key role in growing Bandero Premium Tequila throughout New Jersey.<\/li><li>Opportunity for advancement as the brand continues to expand nationally.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **RELAXED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"New Jersey, New Jersey, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-tequila-market-manager-new-jersey-bandero-tequila-1135754","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-tequila-market-manager-new-jersey-bandero-tequila-1135754"},{"slug":"remote-human-resources-coordinator-pacific-health-group-1135783","id":"1135783","epoch":1785536993,"date":"2026-07-31T22:29:53+00:00","company":"Pacific Health Group","company_logo":"","position":"Human Resources Coordinator","tags":["hr","sys admin","education","recruiter","coordinator","customer support","marketing","exec","payroll","finance","ops","medical","internship","full time"],"description":"<strong>Job Snapshot<br><br><\/strong>Location: Remote - California (San Diego or Southern California Preferred)<br><br>Employment Type: Full-Time<br><br>Compensation: $28-30 per hour<br><br>Schedule: Full-Time<br><br>Work Environment: Remote<br><br>Reports To: Human Resources Manager<br><br><strong>About Pacific Health Group<br><br><\/strong>At Pacific Health Group, we care deeply about the people and communities we serve. We meet individuals with kindness, respect, and understanding\u00e2\u0080\u0094listening first, honoring each person's journey, and offering support without judgment.<br><br>Through compassionate, person-centered healthcare, behavioral health services, and social supports, we walk alongside people as they work toward healing, stability, and a healthier, more hopeful life.<br><br><strong>Our Core Values<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Speak with integrity\u00e2\u0080\u0094clear, respectful, and honest in every interaction<\/li><li>Embrace innovation, trying new ideas, learning fast, and improving care. <\/li><li>Own our roles, staying accountable for outcomes and documenting accurately<\/li><li>Build genuine connections with members, families, and teammates through empathy and cultural sensitivity<\/li><li>Lead with trust by being consistent, transparent, and following through<\/li><li>Celebrate wins together, recognizing individual and team achievements<\/li><li>Collaborate with purpose, partnering across departments and with community providers to solve problems<\/li><li>Ask for support and offer support, because thriving together is how we serve our members best<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Role Overview &amp; Impact<br><br><\/strong>The Human Resources Coordinator provides administrative and operational support across the Human Resources department. This entry-level position supports onboarding, employee records, HR system transactions, recruitment coordination, employee communications, and general HR department operations.<br><br>The HR Coordinator serves as an initial point of contact for routine employee and applicant questions and ensures that requests are directed to the appropriate HR team member. The successful candidate will be highly organized, service-oriented, comfortable using technology, and committed to maintaining the confidentiality and accuracy of employee information.<br><br><strong>Key Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong><strong>Core Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong><strong>Recruitment &amp; Talent Coordination<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Support candidate communications using approved templates<\/li><li>Track candidate status and documentation in the applicant tracking system<\/li><li>Assist with pre-employment requirements<\/li><li>Maintain accurate recruiting records and candidate files<\/li><li>Support job fairs, community outreach, internship activities, and recruiting events<\/li><li>Provide a professional, timely, and welcoming candidate experience<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Onboarding &amp; Offboarding<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Coordinate pre-employment and onboarding activities after an offer has been accepted<\/li><li>Send new-hire forms, instructions, orientation schedules, and required notices<\/li><li>Track completion of pre-employment requirements, background checks, employment documents, and onboarding tasks<\/li><li>Coordinate the timely completion and retention of Form I-9 documentation in accordance with established procedures<\/li><li>Coordinate with hiring managers, Payroll, Information Technology, Learning and Development, and other departments to support new-hire readiness<\/li><li>Confirm that new employees receive appropriate system access, equipment information, schedules, and introductory materials<\/li><li>Support new-hire orientation logistics and attendance tracking<\/li><li>Follow up on incomplete forms or onboarding requirements<\/li><li>Initiate separation checklists after receiving appropriate authorization<\/li><li>Schedule exit interviews or distribute exit questionnaires<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>HR Compliance &amp; Documentation<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Assist with personnel-file, I-9, benefits, training, and HR data audits<\/li><li>Track required documents, acknowledgments, certifications, and renewal dates<\/li><li>Assist with preparing records for internal and external audits<\/li><li>Follow established HR policies, procedures, record-retention requirements, and confidentiality standards<\/li><li>Escalate incomplete, inconsistent, or potentially noncompliant documentation<\/li><li>Maintain current versions of approved HR forms, templates, notices, and resources<\/li><li>Support the distribution and tracking of required employee notices<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Benefits &amp; Employee Support<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Route plan interpretation and eligibility questions to the HR Generalist or appropriate team member<\/li><li>Support annual Open Enrollment communications, scheduling, and administrative preparation<\/li><li>Assist with routine employee reminders and documentation follow-up<\/li><li>Maintain confidentiality of medical and benefits information<\/li><li>Support benefits and leave audits as requested<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>HR Operations &amp; Administrative Support<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Provide general administrative support for the HR team, including scheduling meetings, tracking training completion, and preparing reports<\/li><li>Assist with HR initiatives such as employee engagement events, training programs, and performance review cycles<\/li><li>Maintain organized HR documentation and assist with reporting needs as requested by leadership<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Success Measures<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Accurate and timely recruitment coordination and onboarding completion<\/li><li>Compliance with California labor laws and HR documentation standards<\/li><li>High responsiveness and professionalism in employee communication<\/li><li>Well-maintained, audit-ready personnel records<\/li><li>Efficient support of HR initiatives and department operations<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Skills That Set You Apart<br><br><\/strong><strong>Required Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>High school diploma or equivalent required<\/li><li>One year of administrative, customer service, office, recruiting, payroll, healthcare, or Human Resources support experience preferred<\/li><li>An associate degree, bachelor's degree, Human Resources coursework, internship, or relevant professional training may substitute for some experience<\/li><li>Entry-level candidates with strong administrative and customer-service capabilities are encouraged to apply<\/li><li>High level of professionalism, discretion, and ability to handle confidential information<\/li><li>Proficiency in Google Workspace (Docs, Sheets, Drive, Slides)<\/li><li>Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively within a remote team<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Benefits<br><br><\/strong><strong>Time Off &amp; Leave<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Paid Time Off<\/li><li>Holidays<\/li><li>Volunteer time<\/li><li>Bereavement<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Health &amp; Wellness<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Medical coverage<\/li><li>FSAs or other wellness benefits<\/li><li>Disability and EAP<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Financial &amp; Professional<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>401(k)<\/li><li>Stipends<\/li><li>Professional development<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Culture &amp; Perks<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Employee discounts<\/li><li>Team events<\/li><li>Growth opportunities<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Equal Opportunity Employer<br><br><\/strong>Pacific Health Group is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are committed to creating an inclusive and equitable workplace where all individuals are treated with dignity and respect. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion or creed, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, breastfeeding, and related medical conditions), gender, gender identity or gender expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, citizenship status, physical or mental disability, medical condition (including cancer and genetic characteristics), age (40 and over), marital status, military or veteran status, genetic information, or status as a victim of domestic violence, assault, or stalking. We value diversity in all forms and encourage individuals from historically underrepresented communities to apply.<br><br><strong>Job Application &amp; Offer Disclaimer<br><br><\/strong>Pacific Health Group is committed to maintaining a transparent, lawful, and secure hiring process in compliance with California labor laws and employment standards. Employment offers are contingent upon meeting role qualifications and successfully completing all required recruitment steps, which may include:<br><br><ul><li>Submission of an internal application<\/li><li>Recruiter pre-screen <\/li><li>Skills assessment if applicable<\/li><li>Final interview with hiring leadership<\/li><li>Formal verbal offer from authorized hiring representatives<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Important Notice: Any communication claiming to represent Pacific Health Group that bypasses this process is not authorized.<br><br><strong>AI &amp; Human Interaction in Recruitment<br><br><\/strong>Pacific Health Group uses AI tools to assist with resume matching based on qualifications, skills, and location. All qualified applications are reviewed by our recruiting and HR team to ensure fair, equitable, and human-centered hiring decisions.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SUCCEEDED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"San Diego, San Diego, California, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-human-resources-coordinator-pacific-health-group-1135783","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-human-resources-coordinator-pacific-health-group-1135783"},{"slug":"remote-tequila-market-manager-new-york-bandero-tequila-1135753","id":"1135753","epoch":1785536752,"date":"2026-07-31T22:25:52+00:00","company":"Bandero Tequila","company_logo":"","position":"Tequila Market Manager New York","tags":["exec","customer support","marketing","travel","legal","sales","medical","full time"],"description":"<strong>Tequila Market Manager - New York<\/strong><p><strong>Location:<\/strong><span> New Jersey<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Brand:<\/strong><span> Bandero Premium Tequila<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Employment Type:<\/strong><span> Full-Time<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Compensation:<\/strong><span> $100,000 Base Salary | Commission | Full Benefits<\/span><\/p><strong>About Bandero Premium Tequila<\/strong><p><span>Bandero Premium Tequila is a fast-growing premium spirits brand entering an exciting new stage of national expansion. With increasing distribution, major retail opportunities, high-profile events, and strategic partnerships, Bandero is building meaningful momentum across the United States.<\/span><\/p><p><span>The brand is expanding its presence in key markets, developing strong relationships with leading distributors and retailers, and creating memorable consumer experiences through tastings, sponsorships, hospitality programs, and brand activations.<\/span><\/p><p><span>As Bandero continues to grow its national footprint, New York represents a major opportunity for visibility, influence, and long-term sales growth. We are seeking a driven Market Manager who is excited to help build the market from the ground up, secure influential placements, and become an important part of the brand\u00e2\u0080\u0099s continued expansion.<\/span><\/p><strong>Position Overview<\/strong><p><span>We are seeking an experienced, connected, and results-driven <\/span><strong>New York Market Manager<\/strong><span> to lead Bandero Premium Tequila\u00e2\u0080\u0099s growth throughout the state.<\/span><\/p><p><span>This is an opportunity to join a growing brand at a pivotal stage and play a direct role in shaping Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s success in one of the most important wine and spirits markets in the country.<\/span><\/p><p><span>The New York Market Manager will be responsible for increasing sales, supporting distribution teams, securing new on-premise and off-premise placements, and building lasting relationships with key accounts and industry leaders.<\/span><\/p><p><span>The ideal candidate has strong roots in the New York hospitality and beverage community, existing relationships with buyers and decision-makers, and the entrepreneurial drive to build a premium spirits brand in a competitive market.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><strong>Distributor Management<\/strong><ul><li><span>Work closely with Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s distributor partner to execute sales programs and achieve market goals.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Build strong relationships with distributor leadership, managers, and sales representatives.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Conduct regular distributor meetings, sales presentations, ride-alongs, and account visits.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Motivate and support distributor teams to increase placements, reorders, and overall sales.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Monitor distributor inventory, depletions, execution, and performance against established goals.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ensure distributor activities remain aligned with Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s sales strategy and premium brand positioning.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>Account Management and Sales<\/strong><ul><li><span>Leverage existing relationships and build new connections to grow Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s presence throughout New York.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Secure new on-premise and off-premise placements.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Develop relationships with key buyers, beverage directors, restaurant groups, retailers, bars, hotels, lounges, nightclubs, and other influential accounts.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Manage existing accounts and identify opportunities to increase reorders, menu placements, displays, and promotional support.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Create targeted sales plans for priority accounts and high-value opportunities.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Maintain a consistent market presence through regular account visits and follow-up.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>Brand Building<\/strong><ul><li><span>Serve as a knowledgeable and enthusiastic ambassador for Bandero Premium Tequila.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Host tastings, staff trainings, buyer presentations, events, and activations that reflect Bandero\u00e2\u0080\u0099s premium image.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Educate distributor teams, retail staff, bartenders, servers, and consumers on the Bandero portfolio and brand story.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Identify local partnerships, sponsorships, and events that can increase visibility and consumer engagement.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ensure Bandero is represented professionally and consistently across all customer and consumer interactions.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>Market Development<\/strong><ul><li><span>Identify opportunities for expansion throughout New York.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Monitor competitive brands, pricing, promotions, account activity, and market trends.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Provide insight into the New York market landscape, culture, and key industry players.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Help develop localized sales, marketing, promotional, and activation strategies.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Collaborate with company leadership on programs designed to increase distribution and brand awareness.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>Reporting and KPIs<\/strong><ul><li><span>Track and report on placements, reorders, depletions, sales targets, account activity, and promotional effectiveness.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Maintain an organized pipeline of prospective and active accounts.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Provide regular market updates, sales reports, competitive insights, and opportunity assessments.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Manage market expenses responsibly and submit timely documentation.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Work toward clearly defined sales and distribution goals.<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><ul><li><span>Proven experience in sales, brand building, market management, or account management in the New York market.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Existing relationships with New York buyers, distributors, retailers, restaurants, bars, hotels, nightlife venues, or hospitality groups strongly preferred.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Established book of business is a significant plus.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Demonstrated success opening new accounts and growing existing business.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Experience managing, supporting, and motivating distributor partners.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Strong understanding of the New York wine and spirits market, including its culture, key accounts, and industry landscape.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Excellent communication, presentation, negotiation, relationship-management, and organizational skills.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Self-motivated and able to manage a large territory independently.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Comfortable working in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Passionate about premium spirits and building a growing brand from the ground up.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ability to work flexible hours, including occasional nights and weekends, for events, tastings, and activations.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ability and willingness to travel throughout New York as required.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Valid driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license, clean driving record, and reliable transportation.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Must meet all legal requirements for representing and promoting an alcoholic beverage brand.<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><strong>What We Offer<\/strong><ul><li><span>Competitive base salary based on experience.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Commission based on sales performance.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Health, dental, and vision insurance.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Accrued paid time off and sick time.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Paid company holidays.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Reimbursement for approved business and travel expenses.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Dynamic and entrepreneurial work environment.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Opportunity for advancement as the brand continues to expand nationally.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **OUTSHINE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"New York City Metropolitan Area","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-tequila-market-manager-new-york-bandero-tequila-1135753","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-tequila-market-manager-new-york-bandero-tequila-1135753"},{"slug":"remote-join-our-team-miraculous-maids-1135748","id":"1135748","epoch":1785526853,"date":"2026-07-31T19:40:53+00:00","company":"Miraculous Maids","company_logo":"","position":"Join Our Team","tags":[],"description":"<ul><li>Calgary<\/li><li>Edmonton<\/li><li>Ottawa<\/li><li>Red Deer<\/li><li>Sherwood Park<\/li><li>St. Albert<\/li><li>Winnipeg<\/li><li>Lethbridge<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **AMUSING** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"St Albert, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-join-our-team-miraculous-maids-1135748","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-join-our-team-miraculous-maids-1135748"},{"slug":"remote-voice-over-artist-bored-panda-1135765","id":"1135765","epoch":1785525860,"date":"2026-07-31T19:24:20+00:00","company":"Bored Panda","company_logo":"","position":"Voice Over Artist","tags":["dev","speech","finance","exec","ops","golang","digital nomad","illustrator","customer support","video","content writing"],"description":"We are one of the leading tech-driven media and entertainment companies, producing uplifting content in 17 languages for audiences of all ages. Known for the award-winning digital publisher boredpanda.com and the Crafty Panda DIY channel, we fight the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s boredom at scale - reaching 160 million site views per month and 62 billion video views per year. Our team consists of around 350 creative professionals from 36 countries, with 2 offices in Vilnius, Lithuania.<br><br>Spike, the global animated series, is searching for talented voice actors to bring its characters to life! Our YouTube channel has reached over 1 billion views, entertaining children worldwide with universal, character-driven stories. We're casting our two lead roles: Spike, an imaginative, curious, and fearless 7-year-old whose creativity turns everyday moments into adventures; and Sparkle, his confident, attention-loving 5\u00c2\u00bd-year-old sister with unmistakable main-character energy. Additionally, we are seeking versatile utility players who can perform multiple recurring characters - from the know-it-all giraffe girl, Poem, and the scared but loyal elephant boy, Muddles, to the bully rhino twins, Storm and Thunder, and the local mad scientist lion, Professor Roar, to name a few. Plus, there are loving parents, friends, foes, and all the colorful citizens that make Spike's world so vibrant.<br><br><strong>What You Will Do:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Bring recurring characters to life with expressive performances that match the show's playful and energetic tone;<\/li><li>Help shape memorable voices and personalities for the faces of a global IP;<\/li><li>Deliver engaging voice performances that support clear storytelling in fast-paced 3\u00e2\u0080\u00935 minute episodes;<\/li><li>Perform dialogue that enhances visual comedy and elevates emotional moments;<\/li><li>Maintain consistent character voices and performances across multiple episodes;<\/li><li>Take direction well, adjusting pacing, emotion, and delivery as needed;<\/li><li>Record clean, broadcast-quality audio from a professional home studio;<\/li><li>Attend directed recording sessions via remote call, if required;<\/li><li>Work efficiently to deliver recordings on schedule as part of Spike's consistent weekly production cadence;<\/li><li>Collaborate with directors and sound supervisors to create polished, world-class voice performances for each episode.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What We Expect:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Professional voice acting experience in animation, games, children's media, dubbing, or similar productions;<\/li><li>Strong character acting skills with distinctive, believable, and consistent voices;<\/li><li>Strong acting instincts and an understanding of how voice performance supports visual storytelling;<\/li><li>Ability to take direction while bringing your own creative ideas to deliver the strongest performance possible;<\/li><li>Clear diction, vocal control, and emotionally authentic performances;<\/li><li>Fluency in English and mastery of American accents;<\/li><li>Spike is worldwide, so an understanding of globally accessible performances that communicate character and emotion across cultures;<\/li><li>Comfort working in a fast-paced, digital-first production environment;<\/li><li>A reliable home recording setup capable of delivering broadcast-quality audio;<\/li><li>Professionalism, responsiveness, and the ability to meet deadlines while collaborating effectively with the creative team.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Compensation<\/strong>: 40-120 eur\/gross per episode.<br><br><strong>Please note that selected candidates <\/strong><strong>will be contacted to audition for their desired roles.<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HEROIC** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Vilnius, Vilnius, Vilniaus, Lithuania","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-voice-over-artist-bored-panda-1135765","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-voice-over-artist-bored-panda-1135765"},{"slug":"remote-hr-generalist-aditi-consulting-1135755","id":"1135755","epoch":1785525817,"date":"2026-07-31T19:23:37+00:00","company":"Aditi Consulting","company_logo":"","position":"HR Generalist","tags":["exec","customer support","marketing","travel","legal","sales","medical","full time","hr","consulting","recruiter","speech","education","microsoft","mobile","excel"],"description":"<br><span><span><strong>Payrate:<\/strong> $26.00- $28.00\/hr.<br>&nbsp;<br><strong>Summary:<br><\/strong>The main function of a human resources generalist is performing administrative functions, such as employee benefits, recruiting and interviewing, along with strategic planning and policy management. A typical human resources generalist is responsible for enhancing company productivity, increasing performance and improving business results.<br>&nbsp;<br><strong>Responsibilities:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><ul><li><span><span>Serve as a link between management and employees by handling questions, interpreting, and administering contracts and helping resolve work-related problems.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Advise managers on organizational policy matters such as equal employment opportunity and sexual harassment.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Plan and conduct new hire orientation.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Support HR manager with gathering necessary documents and paperwork for refereeing disputes and administering disciplinary procedures.<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span><span>&nbsp;<br><strong>Skills:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><ul><li><span><span>Verbal and written communication skills, attention to detail, customer service and interpersonal skills.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Ability to work independently and manage one&rsquo;s time.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Knowledge of legal policies and procedures related to hiring practices (i.e., equal employment opportunity and affirmative action).<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Knowledge of benefit and pay-scale systems.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>Previous experience with computer applications, such as Microsoft Word and Excel.<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span><span>&nbsp;<br><strong>Education\/Experience:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><ul><li><span><span>Bachelor's degree in relevant field or equivalent experience required.<\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span>0-2 years related experience required.<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span><span>&nbsp;<br><strong>Pay Transparency: <\/strong><em>The typical base pay for this role across the U.S. is:\u00e2\u0080\u00af<strong>$26.00 - $28.00\u00e2\u0080\u00af\/hour<\/strong>. Non-exempt positions are eligible for overtime at a rate of 1.5 times the base hourly rate for all hours worked in excess of 40 in a work week, or as required by state or local law. Final offer amounts, within the base pay set forth above, are determined by factors including your relevant skills, education and experience. Full-time employees are eligible to select from different benefits packages. Packages may include medical, dental, and vision benefits, health savings accounts with qualified medical plan enrollment, 10 paid days off, 3 days paid bereavement leave, 401(k) plan participation with employer match, life and disability insurance, commuter benefits, dependent care flexible spending account, accident insurance, critical illness insurance, hospital indemnity insurance, accommodations and reimbursement for work travel, and discretionary performance or recognition bonus. Sick leave and mobile phone reimbursement provided based on state or local law.&nbsp; <br><\/em>&nbsp;<br><strong><em>Consent to Communication and Use of AI Technology:<\/em><\/strong><em> By submitting your application for this position\u00e2\u0080\u00afand providing your email address(es) and\/or phone number(s), you consent to receive text (SMS), email, and\/or voice communication whether automated\u00e2\u0080\u00af(including auto telephone dialing systems or automatic text messaging systems), pre-recorded,\u00e2\u0080\u00afAI-assisted, or individually initiated from Aditi Consulting, our agents, representatives, or affiliates\u00e2\u0080\u00afat the phone number and\/or email address you have provided. These communications may include information about potential opportunities and information. Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency may vary. <br><\/em><em>You represent and warrant that the email address(es) and\/or telephone number(s) you provided to us belong to you and that you are permitted to receive calls, text (SMS) messages, and\/or emails at these contacts.\u00e2\u0080\u00afYou also acknowledge and agree to Aditi Consulting LLC&rsquo;s use of AI technology during the sourcing process, including calls from an AI Voice Recruiter. AI is used solely to gather data and does not replace human-based decision-making in employment decisions.\u00e2\u0080\u00af Calls may be recorded. <br><\/em>&nbsp;<br><em>Consent is not a condition of purchasing any property, goods, or services. You may revoke your consent at any time by replying \u00e2\u0080\u009cSTOP\u00e2\u0080\u009d to messages or by contacting\u00e2\u0080\u00af <\/em><em>privacy@aditiconsulting.com<\/em><em>. <br><\/em><em>For information about our collection, use, and disclosure of applicant's personal information as well as applicants' rights over their personal information, please see our <\/em><em>Privacy Policy<\/em><em> .<br><\/em>&nbsp;<br>#AditiConsulting<br>#26-04761<br><\/span><\/span><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STIRRINGLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Oakland, Oakland, California, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-hr-generalist-aditi-consulting-1135755","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-hr-generalist-aditi-consulting-1135755"},{"slug":"remote-thuc-tap-sinh-phat-trien-kinh-doanh-acc-hospitality-1135780","id":"1135780","epoch":1785518798,"date":"2026-07-31T17:26:38+00:00","company":"ACC Hospitality","company_logo":"","position":"Th\u00e1\u00bb\u00b1c T\u00e1\u00ba\u00adp Sinh Ph\u00c3\u00a1t Tri\u00e1\u00bb\u0083n Kinh Doanh","tags":["c"],"description":"T\u00c3\u00acm ki\u00e1\u00ba\u00bfm, ti\u00e1\u00ba\u00bfp c\u00e1\u00ba\u00adn v\u00c3\u00a0 m\u00e1\u00bb\u009f r\u00e1\u00bb\u0099ng t\u00e1\u00bb\u0087p \u00c4\u0091\u00e1\u00bb\u0091i t\u00c3\u00a1c kh\u00c3\u00a1ch s\u00e1\u00ba\u00a1n.<br><br>Gi\u00e1\u00bb\u009bi thi\u00e1\u00bb\u0087u s\u00e1\u00ba\u00a3n ph\u00e1\u00ba\u00a9m, d\u00e1\u00bb\u008bch v\u00e1\u00bb\u00a5 c\u00e1\u00bb\u00a7a c\u00c3\u00b4ng ty \u00c4\u0091\u00e1\u00ba\u00bfn v\u00e1\u00bb\u009bi \u00c4\u0091\u00e1\u00bb\u0091i t\u00c3\u00a1c.<br><br>Ph\u00e1\u00bb\u0091i h\u00e1\u00bb\u00a3p v\u00e1\u00bb\u009bi c\u00c3\u00a1c ban ng\u00c3\u00a0nh kh\u00c3\u00a1c \u00c4\u0091\u00e1\u00bb\u0083 ch\u00c4\u0083m s\u00c3\u00b3c v\u00c3\u00a0 cung c\u00e1\u00ba\u00a5p d\u00e1\u00bb\u008bch v\u00e1\u00bb\u00a5, s\u00e1\u00ba\u00a3n ph\u00e1\u00ba\u00a9m m\u00e1\u00bb\u0099t c\u00c3\u00a1ch t\u00e1\u00bb\u0091t nh\u00e1\u00ba\u00a5t.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **VOUCHSAFE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"District 4, District 4, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-thuc-tap-sinh-phat-trien-kinh-doanh-acc-hospitality-1135780","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-thuc-tap-sinh-phat-trien-kinh-doanh-acc-hospitality-1135780"},{"slug":"remote-range-keeper-black-amp-mcdonald-limited-1135751","id":"1135751","epoch":1785517912,"date":"2026-07-31T17:11:52+00:00","company":"Black &amp; McDonald Limited","company_logo":"","position":"Range Keeper","tags":["design","consulting","senior","ops","sales","golang","digital nomad","front end","infosec","education","marketing","dev","exec","recruiter"],"description":"LOCATION: Burwash Training Ranges<br><br>The Range keeper reports to the Project Manager and will provide Shooting Range services for the Military Outdoor Training Ranges located Burwash Ontario.<br><br>You must be suitably physically sound and adaptable enough to do moderate lifting and to walk over rough terrain, have experience\/knowledge in the operation of shooting ranges, have a general property maintenance background and be able to operate small-medium sized machinery\/tools such as tractors with various attachments (i.e. farm tractor, lawn mower, aerator, front-end bucket, snow blower) power hand mowers, trimmers, walk behind snow blower, plow truck, power saws and hand tools including but not limited to shovels, hammers, saws, rakes, telephones.<br><br>You will be required to work on a flexible schedule on weekdays, weekends and evenings according to range reservations\/ schedules as presented by the Company Office.<br><br>You must be a self-starter, demonstrate a good work ethic and provide superior customer service. You will need to display good communication in the English Language as well as inter-personal and organizational skills. Within your duties you will be expected to interface with DND\/Police\/civilian range users as well as assigned subcontractors.<br><br><strong>Key Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong>Your duties include<br><br>Scheduling<br><br><ul><li> Repair targets\/backings 1080 fig. 11 targets\/backings and 1080 targets\/backings for fig 12 at Winona Range as well as replacement of 24 figure 11 target frames and 48 target frames for figure 12.<\/li><li> Repairs include removing and replacing the paper target figures.<\/li><li> Provide flexible hours to accommodate the march in\/ march out process which includes occasional evening\/weekend activity<\/li><li> Oversee in and out inspections.<\/li><li> Regularly inspect all range property and infrastructure reporting work order needs to the Company office as required and conducting day\u00e2\u0080\u0093to-day operation and maintenance as required<\/li><li> With exercise directors (OIC Exercise) conduct in\/out inspections ensuring the ranges and buildings are properly returned as found by the users and March in\/out forms are signed by the Exercise representative<\/li><li> Reporting, recording all incidents, damages, causes and vandalism (including graffiti in the Butts)<\/li><li> Report malfunctioning installed equipment including kitchen and laundry equipment<\/li><li> Get Project Manager authority before calling in subcontractors;<\/li><li> Ensuring First Aid Fire Fighting equipment\/supplies are maintained and replenished.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Maintain Ranges\/infrastructure<br><br><ul><li> Walk the perimeter fence lines ensuring the fences are kept in good repair and growth is cut back to an acceptable level<\/li><li> Complete all grass cutting and snow removal and ice control operations with equipment provided iaw the performance standards provided by the Regional Manager<\/li><li> Prune trees, shrubs and plants as required for neat appearance and maintenance.<\/li><li> Build\/Repair target frames ensuring sufficient are on-hand at all times replacing<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Facilities\u00e2\u0080\u0099 Housekeeping<br><br><ul><li> Conduct janitorial services in all range buildings.<\/li><li> Conduct routine repairs paying particular attention to occupant safety, protection of occupants and property against further damage<\/li><li> Provide janitorial supplies as required to assist Range visitors;<\/li><li> Institute suitable waste disposal and materials recycling;<\/li><li> Take appropriate measures for the control of pests both indoors and outdoors;<\/li><li> Pick up litter and garbage as required.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>GENERAL REQUIREMNTS<br><br><ul><li> Must have a valid Ontario driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license and be prepared to operate Company vehicles\/equipment safely in the performance of their duties<\/li><li> Must work flexible hours according to Range reservations;<\/li><li> Must be prepared to wear and respond to calls<\/li><li> Will be required to pass a security clearance and adhere to the Company Code of ethics, Code of conduct and confidentiality agreements;<br><br><\/li><\/ul><em>The expected salary range for this role is determined in accordance with the union collective agreement<br><br><\/em><em>Black &amp; McDonald welcomes and encourages applications from persons with disabilities. Accommodations are available upon request for candidates taking part in all aspects of the recruitment and selection process.<br><br><\/em><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CONSUMMATE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Burwash, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-range-keeper-black-amp-mcdonald-limited-1135751","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-range-keeper-black-amp-mcdonald-limited-1135751"},{"slug":"remote-assistente-administrativo-rh-dp-samba-hospitality-group-1135843","id":"1135843","epoch":1785516252,"date":"2026-07-31T16:44:12+00:00","company":"Samba Hospitality Group","company_logo":"","position":"ASSISTENTE ADMINISTRATIVO RH DP","tags":[],"description":"Apoiar o Gerente Operacional nas rotinas administrativas de R&amp;S, Adm. Pessoal, SESMT e Ponto, garantindo que os processos definidos pelo CORPORATIVO e a legisla\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o trabalhista sejam cumpridas.<br><br>Manter a nuvem da unidade atualizada, com todas informa\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00b5es\/documentos relacionados aos subsistemas R&amp;S, Adm Pessoal, SESMT e etc, garantindo organiza\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o e disponibilidade das informa\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00b5es para o setor de G.EN.T.E<br><br>Fazer gest\u00c3\u00a3o mensal dos benef\u00c3\u00adcios da unidade, garantindo recebimento por parte dos colaboradores e melhor custo para a empresa.<br><br>Realizar processo admissional e demissional, conforme fluxogramas definido pelo CORPORATIVO, garantindo cumprimento da legisla\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o trabalhista.<br><br>Fazer a gest\u00c3\u00a3o do SESMT da unidade, no que se refere ao PPRA\/PCMSO\/LTCAT, exames e entregas de EPI's, para garantir a sa\u00c3\u00bade ocupacional do colaborador e cumprimento das NR's.<br><br>Solictar junto a contabilidade programa\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o de f\u00c3\u00a9rias e alinhar com lideran\u00c3\u00a7as de cada setor, garantindo o cumprimento da legisla\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o trabalhista.<br><br>Abastecer a planilha da folha de pagamento com as intercorr\u00c3\u00aancias mensais, enviando para a contabilidade, garantindo o correto pagamento de sal\u00c3\u00a1rio aos colaboradores.<br><br>Fazer gest\u00c3\u00a3o di\u00c3\u00a1ria do ponto dos colaboradores, atrav\u00c3\u00a9s do sistema, tratando as ocorr\u00c3\u00aancias para garantir coer\u00c3\u00aancia com a jornada de trabalho.<br><br>Garantir junto as lideran\u00c3\u00a7as do unidade, a realiza\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o da avalia\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o per\u00c3\u00adodo de experi\u00c3\u00aancia, enviando e recebendo formul\u00c3\u00a1rio, objetivando alinhamento entre lideran\u00c3\u00a7a e colaborador.<br><br><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **GRATIFIED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Rio de Janeiro e Regi\u00c3\u00a3o","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-assistente-administrativo-rh-dp-samba-hospitality-group-1135843","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-assistente-administrativo-rh-dp-samba-hospitality-group-1135843"},{"slug":"remote-other-areas-zegogo-corporation-1135758","id":"1135758","epoch":1785509403,"date":"2026-07-31T14:50:03+00:00","company":"Zegogo Corporation","company_logo":"","position":"Other areas","tags":["sys admin","recruiter","non tech","design","hr","infosec","teaching","game dev","testing","travel","accounting","finance","video","education","exec","marketing","telecom","legal","sales","medical","full time","part time","digital nomad"],"description":"Back Jobs Other areas<br><br><ul><li>0 km<\/li><li>2 km<\/li><li>5 km<\/li><li>10 km<\/li><li>15 km<\/li><li>30 km<\/li><li>50 km<\/li><li>75 km<\/li><li>100 km<\/li><li>Kid's clothing and accessories<\/li><ul><li>Kid's clothes<\/li><li>Kid's footwear<\/li><li>Baby strollers<\/li><li>Baby car seats<\/li><li>Kids's furniture<\/li><li>Toys<\/li><li>Kids's vehicles<\/li><li>Feeding Supplies<\/li><li>Back to school<\/li><li>Other children's products<\/li><\/ul><li>Property<\/li><ul><li>Apartments, rooms<\/li><li>Houses<\/li><li>Plots<\/li><li>Commercial property<\/li><li>Garages, parking<\/li><li>Offers from developers<\/li><\/ul><li>Vehicles<\/li><ul><li>Cars<\/li><li>Trucks<\/li><li>Buses<\/li><li>Motorcycle<\/li><li>Special machinery<\/li><li>Agricultural machinery<\/li><li>Water vehicles <\/li><li>Air vehicles <\/li><li>Trailers \/ motorhomes<\/li><li>Other vehicles<\/li><li>Car rental<\/li><\/ul><li>Business and services<\/li><ul><li>Construction \/ repair \/ cleaning<\/li><li>Financial services \/ Partnership<\/li><li>Transport service \/ rental vehicles<\/li><li>Advertising \/ printing \/ marketing \/ internet<\/li><li>Nannies \/ nurses <\/li><li>Raw materials<\/li><li>Beauty \/ healthcare<\/li><li>Equipment<\/li><li>Education \/ sport<\/li><li>Pet services<\/li><li>Selling a business<\/li><li>Entertainment \/ Art \/ Photo \/ Video<\/li><li>Tourism \/ immigration<\/li><li>Translation services \/ typing<\/li><li>Car and motorcycle services <\/li><li>Electrical repair and maintenance<\/li><li>Network marketing<\/li><li>Legal services<\/li><li>Rental goods<\/li><li>Other services<\/li><\/ul><li>Fashion &amp; style<\/li><ul><li>Clothing\/footwear<\/li><li>For the wedding<\/li><li>Watches<\/li><li>Accessories <\/li><li>Gifts<\/li><li>Beauty \/ healthcare<\/li><li>Fashion other<\/li><\/ul><li>Spare parts for transport<\/li><ul><li>Spare parts and accessories<\/li><li>Tires, rims and wheels<\/li><li>Spare parts for special\/agricultural machinery<\/li><li>Motorcycle parts and accessories<\/li><li>Other spare parts<\/li><\/ul><li>Hobbies, leisure and sport<\/li><ul><li>Antiques \/ collections<\/li><li>Musical instruments<\/li><li>Sport \/ leisure<\/li><li>Books \/ magazines<\/li><li>CD \/ DVD \/ records \/ cassettes<\/li><li>Tickets<\/li><li>Search for companions<\/li><li>Search groups \/ musicians<\/li><li>Other <\/li><\/ul><li>Jobs<\/li><ul><li>Retail \/ Sales \/ Purchases<\/li><li>Transport \/ Logistics<\/li><li>Construction <\/li><li>Telecommunications \/ connection<\/li><li>Bars \/ Restaurants<\/li><li>Jurisprudence and Accounting<\/li><li>Human Resource Management \/ HR<\/li><li>Security \/ safety<\/li><li>Household staff<\/li><li>Beauty \/ fitness \/ sport<\/li><li>Travel \/ leisure time \/ entertainment<\/li><li>Education<\/li><li>Culture \/ art<\/li><li>Medicine \/ pharmacy<\/li><li>IT \/ telecom \/ computers<\/li><li>Banking \/ finance \/ insurance<\/li><li>Property <\/li><li>Marketing \/ advertising \/ design<\/li><li>Manufacture \/ energy<\/li><li>Agriculture \/ agribusiness \/ forestry<\/li><li>Secretaries and administrative assistants<\/li><li>Career start \/ students<\/li><li>Service and life<\/li><li>Other areas<\/li><li>Work abroad<\/li><\/ul><li>Pets<\/li><ul><li>Free of charge (animals and breeding)<\/li><li>Dogs<\/li><li>Cats<\/li><li>Aquatic animals<\/li><li>Birds<\/li><li>Rodents<\/li><li>Reptiles<\/li><li>Farm animals<\/li><li>Other animals<\/li><li>Pet supplies<\/li><li>Breeding<\/li><li>Lost and found<\/li><\/ul><li>Free<\/li><li>Exchange<\/li><li>Rental of equipment and tools<\/li><li>House and garden<\/li><ul><li>Stationery \/ supplies<\/li><li>Furniture<\/li><li>Food \/ drinks<\/li><li>Garden supplies<\/li><li>Home accessories <\/li><li>Construction and repair<\/li><li>Tools<\/li><li>Indoor plants<\/li><li>Tableware \/ kitcheware<\/li><li>Garden tools<\/li><li>Household equipment \/ household chemicals<\/li><li>Other home products<\/li><\/ul><li>Restaurants<\/li><li>Dating<\/li><li>Electronics<\/li><ul><li>Games and gaming consoles<\/li><li>Tablets \/ebook readers and accessories <\/li><li>Laptops and accessories<\/li><li>Home appliances<\/li><li>Kitchen appliances<\/li><li>Climatic equipment<\/li><li>Personal care<\/li><li>Accessories and components<\/li><li>Other electronics<\/li><li>Phones &amp; accessories<\/li><li>Computers &amp; hardware<\/li><li>Photo \/ video<\/li><li>TV \/ video<\/li><li>Audio<br><\/li><\/ul><\/ul>All countries<br><br>Search in title and description With photo only<br><br>All Temporary job Permanent job<br><br><ul><li> All <\/li><li> Temporary job<\/li><li> Permanent job<br><br><\/li><\/ul>All Full-time Part-time<br><br><ul><li> All <\/li><li> Full-time<\/li><li> Part-time<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Jobs Looking for a job<br><br>Sort by Recent Low to high High to low<br><br>Place a banner<br><br>Banner request<br><br>Company name<br><br>Telephone<br><br>E-mail<br><br>Contact person<br><br>Message test<br><br>Attach file<br><br>Nothing found<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **TRACTION** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Northern Areas, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-other-areas-zegogo-corporation-1135758","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-other-areas-zegogo-corporation-1135758"},{"slug":"remote-product-engineer-superplane-1135739","id":"1135739","epoch":1785509293,"date":"2026-07-31T14:48:13+00:00","company":"SuperPlane","company_logo":"","position":"Product Engineer","tags":["golang","javascript","react","ai"],"description":"<h2>About SuperPlane<\/h2><p><a href=\"https:\/\/superplane.com\">SuperPlane<\/a> is an open source software factory engine: the system that lets AI agents build, test, and ship code while engineers focus on design and decisions. This is going to be how all software gets built, and we're building the engine underneath it.<\/p><h2>The Role<\/h2><p>We are hiring a product engineer to join the team and own meaningful projects end to end.<\/p><p>This is a remote role. We currently work across GMT+2 to GMT-3 and welcome candidates in that range.<\/p><p>At SuperPlane, we don't split engineering into frontend and backend. Everyone is a well-rounded builder who moves across the stack, makes product and technical calls, asks for help when needed, and delivers features from start to finish. You might spend one day building an API endpoint or workflow engine improvement, and the next day polishing a React surface that users touch every day.<\/p><p>We're looking for someone at a mid-level to senior level: you've shipped real products, you can work independently, and you're ready to grow fast in a high-trust, high-pace environment. You don't need to have done everything before, but you need to learn quickly and take ownership of what you build.<\/p><p><br \/><\/p><h2>What We Are Looking For<\/h2><ul><li><p>You are genuinely full-stack.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Your workflow is AI-driven and you know how to stay fast without getting sloppy.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You have strong backend experience in a systems-oriented language. While we use Go, we don't expect you to be an expert already, just to ramp up fast.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You have solid systems judgment. APIs, data models, reliability, and trade-offs matter to you.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You're comfortable with TypeScript and React -- the modern frontend stack.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You are comfortable with cloud-native tooling and modern software delivery.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You want ownership, not a narrow lane.<\/p><\/li><li><p>You want an early-stage company where the pace is high, the standards are high, and the upside is big.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><br \/><\/p><h2>How To Apply<\/h2><p>We care more about proof of work than polished applications, and we want to see how you show up in open source.<\/p><p>Before you apply, submit at least one pull request to superplanehq\/superplane. It can be small and it does not need to be merged.<\/p><p>When you apply, send your GitHub username and a link to your pull request. We verify both, and applications missing either field will not move forward.<\/p><p><br \/><\/p><h2>Why You'll Love Working at SuperPlane<\/h2><ul><li><p>Build a frontier product used by engineers across the globe.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Meaningful equity and real ownership.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Small team, fast feedback loops.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Remote role that lets you focus and create.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HEAL** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","salary_min":60000,"salary_max":90000,"apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-product-engineer-superplane-1135739","original":true,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-product-engineer-superplane-1135739"},{"slug":"remote-client-onboarding-manager-connecteam-1135743","id":"1135743","epoch":1785506901,"date":"2026-07-31T14:08:21+00:00","company":"Connecteam","company_logo":"","position":"Client Onboarding Manager","tags":["hr","technical","writer","customer support","exec","education","senior","marketing","sales","medical","full time","virtual assistant","finance","ops","recruiter","design","saas","sys admin","dev","payroll","golang","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>Who Connecteam is:<br><br><\/strong>Connecteam is the leading platform for managing deskless teams, trusted by over 80,000 businesses worldwide.<br><br>We built Connecteam for real operators - the people running shifts, jobs, and teams across stores and sites. The kind of work that doesn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t happen behind a desk, and doesn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t have time for messy spreadsheets, scattered group chats, or tools that don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t talk to each other.<br><br>Connecteam brings daily operations and team communication into one intuitive app - from hiring and scheduling to training, tasks, and day-to-day coordination. It gives teams the clarity and control to run the day, shift after shift, job after job.<br><br>Backed by $220M+ from Insight Partners, Stripes, and Tiger Global, Connecteam is rapidly expanding worldwide - empowering frontline teams to work smarter, stay connected, and operate with greater efficiency.<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>The Onboarding Manager guides new customers who come from a partnership, through the implementation of Connecteam, from initial handoff and kickoff through a successful payroll launch. This is a customer-facing, hands-on implementation role combining project management, system configuration, payroll-process understanding, customer training and cross-functional coordination.<br><br>The Onboarding Manager works closely with customers, in collaboration with the partner\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Implementation Managers and internal Connecteam teams to ensure employee data, time tracking, PTO, payroll rules and payroll system integrations are configured and validated correctly. The primary goal is to deliver a smooth onboarding experience while ensuring employees are paid accurately and on time.<br><br>Implementations are payroll-first and planned around the customer\u00e2\u0080\u0099s first clock-in date, payroll schedule and go-live timeline. Depending on account size and complexity, the Onboarding Manager may continue supporting the customer through the first one to three payroll cycles.<br><br>Success in this role requires more than technical knowledge. The Onboarding Manager must be highly perceptive, able to read people and situations quickly, and skilled at navigating complex interpersonal dynamics while maintaining trust across multiple internal and external teams.<br><br><strong>Key Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Own the customer onboarding process<\/li><ul><li>Manage a book of business of customers that came from the partnership, from internal handoff through go-live and initial payroll stabilization.<\/li><li>Build implementation plans around first clock-in, payroll periods, training requirements and payroll-processing deadlines.<\/li><li>Lead kickoff, setup, training and client\u00e2\u0080\u0099s payroll.<\/li><li>Maintain clear timelines, responsibilities, next steps, risks and customer communication throughout each project.<\/li><\/ul><li>Lead discovery and solution design<\/li><ul><li>Understand the customer\u00e2\u0080\u0099s workflows.<\/li><li>Translate business requirements into a practical Connecteam setup.<\/li><li>Identify complex requirements and suit the right solution with the design of the relevant setup.<\/li><\/ul><li>Configure integrations<\/li><ul><li>Configure relevant Connecteam account settings<\/li><li>Set up and manage the integration. <\/li><\/ul><li>Deliver training and manage stakeholders<\/li><ul><li>Train clients on Connecteam platform and integration process.<\/li><li>Train managers on time tracking and payroll workflows using Connecteam. <\/li><li>Adapt the training plan to customer size, structure and complexity while keeping sessions practical and process-focused.<\/li><li>Work closely with the assigned partner Implementation Manager.<\/li><li>Coordinate clearly across customers, partner, Sales, Support, Product, Integrations and leadership.<\/li><\/ul><li>Troubleshoot, escalate and document<\/li><ul><li>Investigate issues across the full workflow.<\/li><li>Determine issue owner and route it appropriately<\/li><li>Escalate payroll-impacting risks with clear documentation<\/li><li>Maintain accurate account records, architecture decisions, risks, next steps and handoff documentation.<br><\/li><\/ul><\/ul><strong>Experience &amp; Skills<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>2+ years of experience in implementation, onboarding, customer facing SaaS role with SMB &amp; Mid Market client sizes.<\/li><li>Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple customer implementations and priorities simultaneously.<\/li><li>Excellent communication, presentation, and training skills with the ability to explain technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.<\/li><li>Tech-savvy with the ability to quickly learn software, troubleshoot issues, and understand integrations and data flows.<\/li><li>Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and a customer-first approach when managing complex implementations.<\/li><li>Ability to build trusted relationships with customers, internal teams, and external partners in a fast-paced environment.<\/li><li>Strong problem-solving skills, sound judgment, and the ability to navigate ambiguity and changing customer needs.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Preferred Experience<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Experience with payroll, HRIS, workforce management, scheduling, time &amp; attendance, or employee management platforms.<\/li><li>Experience supporting payroll implementations, PEO environments, or multi-location\/multi-entity organizations.<\/li><li>Experience working in a partner-led or channel-based customer environment.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Benefits:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li><\/li><ul><li>Medical, dental, &amp; vision coverage<\/li><li>Paid time off for vacation, sick days<\/li><li>401k<br><\/li><\/ul><\/ul><strong>Salary: <\/strong>$90K<br><br><strong>We are accepting applications from employees working in the following states: Texas, New York, New Jersey, South Carolina, North Carolina, Colorado, Florida, Utah, and Georgia.<br><br><\/strong>Joining Connecteam Is The Smart Move:<br><br><ul><li>We build our people up. Every team member is treated as a long-term investment and we recognize the value in always nurturing and training them so they can go above and beyond in their skills and job duties.<\/li><li>We make an impact on our customer\u00e2\u0080\u0099s business. We are on a mission to provide managers of all business types and sizes with the tools they need to communicate, operate, engage, and run their deskless workforce. Our product offers them an effective and affordable solution to run their business.<\/li><li>We get the job done. Connecteam employees are passionate in executing their job duties so they can drive the company forward and provide real value to our customers. <\/li><li>We have fun! From weekly happy hours to holiday parties, we always enjoy each other\u00e2\u0080\u0099s company (and good food, of course). Connecteam is like one big, happy family!<\/li><li>Everyone is welcome. Connecteam is committed to building an encouraging, caring, and supportive environment. We share a responsibility to support our team and enrich their lives. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Together we will shape the future of work!<br><br><\/strong><strong>Our privacy policy<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **COURAGE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Brooklyn, Brooklyn, New York, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-client-onboarding-manager-connecteam-1135743","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-client-onboarding-manager-connecteam-1135743"},{"slug":"remote-entry-level-virtual-assistant-14-18-hour-filipino-contractors-1135742","id":"1135742","epoch":1785502007,"date":"2026-07-31T12:46:47+00:00","company":"Filipino Contractors","company_logo":"","position":"Entry Level Virtual Assistant $14 $18 hour","tags":["hr","technical","writer","customer support","exec","education","senior","marketing","sales","medical","full time","virtual assistant","finance","ops","recruiter"],"description":"<strong>Company Description<br><br><\/strong>We are a well-established Human resource and recruitment services firm located in Winter Garden, Florida, USA. Governed by the Florida Department Of State, USA, We focus on investment management and financial planning.<br><br><strong>Job Description<br><br><\/strong>We are looking for a highly organized and proactive <strong>Entry-Level Virtual Assistant<\/strong> to support our growing team. You will work directly with the leadership team to streamline daily operations and communicate with clients. No prior formal VA experience is required\u00e2\u0080\u0094we provide full training! If you are a quick learner with great communication skills, we want to hear from you. *** Please forward your application or resume to: atconsultingllcidaho@outlook.com ***<br><br><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Good computer skills and internet connection.<\/li><li>Familiarity with or a strong willingness to learn tools.<\/li><li>Exceptional organizational skills and high attention to detail.<\/li><li>Excellent written and verbal communication skills.<\/li><li>Ability to work independently and manage time effectively.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Additional Information<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Flexible, remote work environment.<\/li><li>Opportunities for skill-building, mentorship, and career growth.<\/li><li>Comprehensive training and onboarding.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>*** Please forward your application or resume to: atconsultingllcidaho@outlook.com ***<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **GAIETY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"North Miami Beach, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-entry-level-virtual-assistant-14-18-hour-filipino-contractors-1135742","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-entry-level-virtual-assistant-14-18-hour-filipino-contractors-1135742"},{"slug":"remote-phone-support-specialist-arabic-revolut-1135905","id":"1135905","epoch":1785496733,"date":"2026-07-31T11:18:53+00:00","company":"Revolut","company_logo":"","position":"Phone Support Specialist Arabic","tags":["data entry","infosec","education","customer support","dev","marketing","admin","microsoft","exec","content writing","ops","excel","digital nomad","project manager","supervisor","finance","legal","medical","speech","recruiter"],"description":"<p><strong>About the role<\/strong><\/p><p>Our Customer Support team is the first point of contact for millions around the world, delivering fast, thoughtful help when it matters most. They're the voice of our customers, working closely with product teams to improve experiences and keep wow-level service at the heart of Revolut.<\/p><p>We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking for an Arabic-speaking Support Specialist to take ownership of customer issues, think deeper to find solutions, and contribute to the way we support our customers every day.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>To support our 24\/7 coverage, this role may include night and weekend shifts, which are fully compensated.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Up to shape what's next in finance? Let's get in touch.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What you'll be doing<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Providing customers with a seamless experience to ensure confidence in using our features<\/li><li>Delivering outstanding customer support over the phone<\/li><li>Representing Revolut by ensuring professional and consistent communication with customers<\/li><li>Collaborating with international teams to resolve customer issues<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What you'll need<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>A bachelor's degree (must be able to provide at least a provisional certificate)<\/li><li>18+ months of customer service experience<\/li><li>Fluency in English (C1+ level)<\/li><li>Fluency in Arabic (native level)<\/li><li>Excellent verbal and written communication skills<\/li><li>The ability to explain complex issues in an easy and understandable manner<\/li><li>Great numeracy, analytical, and IT skills<\/li><li>Impeccable attention to detail<\/li><li>To be driven and self-motivated with a highly flexible team player attitude<\/li><li>An independent problem-solving approach<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><em>Building a global financial super app isn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t enough. Our Revoluters are a priority, and that\u00e2\u0080\u0099s why in 2021 we launched our inaugural D&amp;I Framework, designed to help us thrive and grow everyday. We're not just doing this because it's the right thing to do. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re doing it because we know that seeking out diverse talent and creating an inclusive workplace is the way to create exceptional, innovative products and services for our customers. That\u00e2\u0080\u0099s why we encourage applications from people with diverse backgrounds and experiences to join this multicultural, hard-working team.<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong><em>Important notice for candidates:<\/em><\/strong><\/p><p><em>Job scams are on the rise. Please keep these guidelines in mind when applying for any open roles.<\/em><\/p><p><em>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 <\/em><strong><em>Only apply through official Revolut channels.<\/em><\/strong><em> We don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t use any third-party services or platforms for our recruitment.<\/em><\/p><p><em>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 <\/em><strong><em>Always double-check the emails you receive.<\/em><\/strong><em> Make sure all communications are being done through official Revolut emails, with an @revolut.com domain.<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong><em>We won't ask for payment or personal financial information during the hiring process.<\/em><\/strong><em> If anyone does ask you for this, it\u00e2\u0080\u0099s a scam. Report it immediately.<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><em>By submitting this application, I confirm that all the information given by me in this application for employment and any additional documents attached hereto are true to the best of my knowledge and that I have not wilfully suppressed any material fact. I confirm I have disclosed if applicable any previous employment with Revolut. I accept that if any of the information given by me in this application is in any way false or incorrect, my application may be rejected, any offer of employment may be withdrawn or my employment with Revolut may be terminated summarily or I may be dismissed. By submitting this application, I agree that my personal data will be processed in accordance with Revolut's Candidate Privacy Notice<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **NOURISHMENT** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"\u00d8\u00af\u00d8\u00a8\u00d9\u008a, \u00d8\u00af\u00d8\u00a8\u00d9\u008a \u00d8\u00a7\u00d9\u0084\u00d8\u00a5\u00d9\u0085\u00d8\u00a7\u00d8\u00b1\u00d8\u00a7\u00d8\u00aa \u00d8\u00a7\u00d9\u0084\u00d8\u00b9\u00d8\u00b1\u00d8\u00a8\u00d9\u008a\u00d8\u00a9 \u00d8\u00a7\u00d9\u0084\u00d9\u0085\u00d8\u00aa\u00d8\u00ad\u00d8\u00af\u00d8\u00a9","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-phone-support-specialist-arabic-revolut-1135905","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-phone-support-specialist-arabic-revolut-1135905"},{"slug":"remote-join-praemium-expression-of-interest-praemium-1135757","id":"1135757","epoch":1785492467,"date":"2026-07-31T10:07:47+00:00","company":"Praemium","company_logo":"","position":"Join Praemium Expression of Interest","tags":["sys admin","recruiter","non tech"],"description":"<strong>We hire dynamically at Praemium!<br><br><\/strong>At Praemium, we use the Expression of Interest as a way of connecting with people that have an interest in working with us. Candidates simply submit their details to be matched to future role at Praemium.<br><br><strong>What\u00e2\u0080\u0099s an Expression of Interest?<br><br><\/strong>If we have no specific jobs advertising in the location and area you are interested in working in, you can submit an Expression of Interest, which contains information about you, your job preferences, and your availability. You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll then be added to our candidate pool, where you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be considered for opportunities and contacted if a job you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re matched to becomes available. No more scrolling our Careers website regularly to check for new jobs \u00e2\u0080\u0093 we\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll let you know if you match a job near you!<br><br>If you are matched to a job you'll be invited to check out the details and confirm you interest and availability for the job - you'll always have the choice to decline.<br><br><strong> Improving your \"matchability\"<br><br><\/strong>Our system matches candidates based on suitability for a specific job. To maximise your chances of being matched, we suggest when completing the Expression of Interest you consider each question carefully and include the broadest preferences based on what is relevant for you.<br><br><strong>Check back on Praemium Careers from time to time<br><br><\/strong>Finally, while we do use the Expression of Interest option, we still advertise roles our current opportunities and rely on this as a central recruitment source. So, it\u00e2\u0080\u0099s worth taking a look at our Careers website from time-to-time.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HAPPY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Melbourne, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-join-praemium-expression-of-interest-praemium-1135757","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-join-praemium-expression-of-interest-praemium-1135757"},{"slug":"remote-journalist-citywire-espana-1135763","id":"1135763","epoch":1785490712,"date":"2026-07-31T09:38:32+00:00","company":"Citywire Espa\u00c3\u00b1a","company_logo":"","position":"Journalist","tags":["dev","speech","finance","exec","ops","golang","digital nomad"],"description":"<p>We are looking for a Madrid-based Journalist to join the team behind Citywire Spain. This role is for a journalist who wants to go beyond press releases. You will cover the Spanish asset management and wealth management sectors, breaking exclusive news, interviewing key industry decision-makers, and producing original research across our daily news service.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be doing:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Contributing to our online daily news service by sourcing stories and interviewing key figures in the financial advice and wider investment space.<\/li><li>Breaking original and exclusive news that matters for advisers and the wider investment world.<\/li><li>Reporting on asset management operations, regulatory changes, banking, private wealth, and independent financial advisers.<\/li><li>Balancing daily news reporting with longer-term research projects tailored to publication deadlines.<\/li><li>Developing and maintaining a strong network of contacts across the financial services sector.<\/li><li>Managing article distribution across social platforms to engage our audience of financial professionals.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking for:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Language Skills: Fluent Spanish speaker; alongside professional proficiency in English.<\/li><li>Experience: Proven ability to write news stories and features.<\/li><li>Sector Interest: Curiosity about the financial sector and a desire to build expertise in wealth management, banking, and investments.<\/li><li>Strong Communication: Ability to build rapport with sources, ask the right questions, and explain complex subjects clearly.<\/li><li>Comfortable with Data: Comfortable using Big Data, AI tools, and specialised software to analyse market trends, extract key insights, and elevate your storytelling.<\/li><li>Proactive Approach: Self-starter mindset with the initiative to chase leads and uncover original stories, whilst sticking to deadlines.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Meet Citywire <\/strong><\/p><p>We cover - and connect - all sides of the $100 trillion global asset management industry - through our news, events and insights.<\/p><p>At Citywire, we uphold a culture rooted in <strong>honesty, integrity<\/strong>, and <strong>fairness<\/strong>, where every voice is valued and heard. Our culture promotes constructive dialogue and collaboration on a global scale.<\/p><p>Join the team at the Heart of Wealth.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><em>Citywire is an equal opportunities employer.<\/em><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EXHILARATE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Madrid, Madrid, Comunidad de Madrid, Espa\u00c3\u00b1a","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journalist-citywire-espana-1135763","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journalist-citywire-espana-1135763"},{"slug":"remote-journalist-citywire-spain-citywire-1135761","id":"1135761","epoch":1785490356,"date":"2026-07-31T09:32:36+00:00","company":"Citywire","company_logo":"","position":"Journalist Citywire Spain","tags":["dev","speech","finance","exec","ops","golang","digital nomad"],"description":"We are looking for a Madrid-based Journalist to join the team behind Citywire Spain. This role is for a journalist who wants to go beyond press releases. You will cover the Spanish asset management and wealth management sectors, breaking exclusive news, interviewing key industry decision-makers, and producing original research across our daily news service.<br><br><strong>What You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Be Doing<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Contributing to our online daily news service by sourcing stories and interviewing key figures in the financial advice and wider investment space.<\/li><li>Breaking original and exclusive news that matters for advisers and the wider investment world.\u00e2\u0080\u00af<\/li><li>Reporting on asset management operations, regulatory changes, banking, private wealth, and independent financial advisers.<\/li><li>Balancing daily news reporting with longer-term research projects tailored to publication deadlines.<\/li><li>Developing and maintaining a strong network of contacts across the financial services sector.<\/li><li>Managing article distribution across social platforms to engage our audience of financial professionals.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking for:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Language Skills: Native Spanish speaker; alongside professional proficiency in English.<\/li><li>Experience: Proven ability to write news stories and features.<\/li><li> Sector Interest: Curiosity about the financial sector and a desire to build expertise in wealth management, banking, and investments.<\/li><li>Strong Communication: Ability to build rapport with sources, ask the right questions, and explain complex subjects clearly.<\/li><li>Comfortable with Data: Comfortable using Big Data, AI tools, and specialised software to analyse market trends, extract key insights, and elevate your storytelling.<\/li><li>Proactive Approach: Self-starter mindset with the initiative to chase leads and uncover original stories, whilst sticking to deadlines.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Meet Citywire <br><br><\/strong>We cover - and connect - all sides of the $100 trillion global asset management industry - through our news, events and insights.<br><br>At Citywire, we uphold a culture rooted in <strong>honesty, integrity<\/strong>, and <strong>fairness<\/strong>, where every voice is valued and heard. Our culture promotes constructive dialogue and collaboration on a global scale.<br><br>Join the team at the Heart of Wealth.<br><br><em>Citywire is an equal opportunities employer.<\/em><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SKILLED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Madrid, Madrid, Comunidad de Madrid, Espa\u00c3\u00b1a","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journalist-citywire-spain-citywire-1135761","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journalist-citywire-spain-citywire-1135761"},{"slug":"remote-contents-crew-lead-first-onsite-property-restoration-1135871","id":"1135871","epoch":1785488749,"date":"2026-07-31T09:05:49+00:00","company":"First Onsite Property Restoration","company_logo":"","position":"Contents Crew Lead","tags":["education","customer support","content writing","medical","non tech","hr","infosec","supervisor","marketing","finance","exec","recruiter","full time","travel","sys admin","virtual assistant","technical","dev","golang","digital nomad","ops","math","microsoft","excel","sales","engineer","testing","mobile","c","junior","payroll","embedded","accounting","game dev","speech","ruby","design","transcribing"],"description":"If you enjoy hands-on work, learning advanced restoration techniques, and mentoring others, this is the role for you. As a <strong>Contents Crew Lead<\/strong> (Internally known as Contents Technician II), you'll play a key part in helping people recover what matters most. You'll take pride in restoring items affected by fire, water, and mold while guiding teammates, mastering specialized equipment, and making a real impact on every project.<br><br><strong>A DAY IN THE LIFE OF A CONTENTS CREW LEAD<br><br><\/strong>As a Contents Crew Lead, no two days are ever the same. One morning you might be restoring treasured family photos, and by afternoon you could be cleaning specialized equipment or mentoring a new team member. You roll up your sleeves and dive into each job with focus and pride, using advanced tools and cleaning systems to bring belongings back to life. You track and photograph contents, keep meticulous records, and make sure every item is handled with care. You troubleshoot, problem-solve, and stay one step ahead to keep projects on schedule. You take ownership of your work and lead by example, creating a positive, efficient, and safe environment for your team. Every day, your skill, energy, and attention to detail help turn chaos into calm for clients when they need it most.<br><br><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Minimum 1 year of experience in restoration, emergency services, or a related field<\/li><li>Strong knowledge of cleaning methods for fire, water, and mold restoration<\/li><li>Experience operating Ozone and Hydroxyl machines or similar restoration equipment<\/li><li>Excellent attention to detail with strong organizational and teamwork skills<\/li><li>Ability to guide and support Contents Technician I team members<\/li><li>Proficient in Microsoft Office Suite and comfortable using mobile devices and apps<\/li><li>Certifications required: Water Damage Restoration Technician (WRT), Fire and Smoke Restoration Technician (FSRT), and Odor Control Technician (OCT)<\/li><li>Additional certifications considered an asset: Commercial Carpet Cleaning (CCT), Carpet Repair and Reinstallation (RRT), Upholstery and Fabric Cleaning (UFT), and Applied Microbial Remediation (AMRT)<\/li><li>Valid driver's license and clean driving abstract<\/li><li>Must be able to participate in a rotating on-call schedule\u00e2\u0080\u00af\u00e2\u0080\u00af\u00e2\u0080\u00af<\/li><li>Ability to complete work activities which may include physical labour, material handling and lifting, climbing ladders, wearing a respirator, and working in tight spaces (attics, basements, and crawlspaces)<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Who We Are<br><br><\/strong>At First Onsite, the work you do every day makes a real impact. You'll help communities rebuild and families recover after unexpected events. We offer competitive pay, comprehensive health and dental benefits, and RRSP matching because we believe in taking care of our people. You'll have opportunities to learn, grow, and build a lasting career across Canada in a culture that values care, collaboration, and doing the right thing. If you thrive in a team environment and want to make a meaningful difference, we'd love to hear from you.<br><br><strong>Let's Rebuild Together<br><br><\/strong>Your next opportunity starts here. Apply today using our quick, three-minute, mobile-friendly application. <strong>Join First Onsite. Make a difference. Build your future.<br><br><\/strong>By submitting your application, you consent to the collection, use, disclosure, and storage of your personal information by FirstOnsite Restoration Limited operating as First Onsite Property Restoration (\"First Onsite\") for purposes related to your application for employment. This includes information gathered during the recruitment and interview process. Your personal information may be shared internally with relevant personnel involved in the hiring process.<br><br>First Onsite is committed to handling your personal information in accordance with applicable federal and provincial privacy laws, including the <strong>Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA)<\/strong>\u00e2\u0080\u00afand any other relevant privacy legislation in your province or territory. If you have questions about how your personal information is handled, or if you wish to request access to your information, please contact our HR Department.<br><br>Salary: $25.00 - $30.00 per hour<br><br><strong><em>Job Posted by ApplicantPro<\/em><\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **THRILL** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Kelowna, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-contents-crew-lead-first-onsite-property-restoration-1135871","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-contents-crew-lead-first-onsite-property-restoration-1135871"},{"slug":"remote-genai-engineer-ai-builder-ai-agent-associate-specialist-magic-compass-limited-1135735","id":"1135735","epoch":1785487608,"date":"2026-07-31T08:46:48+00:00","company":"Magic Compass Limited","company_logo":"","position":"GenAI Engineer AI Builder AI Agent Associate Specialist","tags":["ai","blockchain","machine learning","deep learning","artificial intelligence","neural networks","Claude","OpenClaw","Codex","AI Agent","OpenAI","Prompt Engineering","Risk Management","crypto","web3"],"description":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Employment Type:<\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"> Full-time Contractor, Remote<br \/>Working Hours: 9:00 AM \u00e2\u0080\u0093 6:00 PM <span>\u00c2\u00a0<\/span>Local Time <br \/><\/span><br \/>About the Role<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">We are looking for a proactive\u00c2\u00a0<\/span><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-size:14pt;line-height:115%;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">GenAI Engineer \/ AI Builder\/ AI Agent Associate \/ AI Application Specialist <\/span><\/strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">to design and build AI-powered workflows and AI Agents that enhance business productivity across multiple business functions.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">You will design, build, and maintain AI solutions that automate business processes, improve operational efficiency, and enable effective Human + AI collaboration across different business functions.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Your initial focus will be supporting our <u>AI and Risk Management team<\/u>. As our AI capabilities continue to grow, you will work with other business functions to build practical AI solutions that improve productivity and operational excellence.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">This role is ideal for someone who enjoys rapidly transforming business requirements into scalable AI applications and turning ideas into real business outcomes.<\/span><\/p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"3\" width=\"100%\" \/><\/div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Key Responsibilities<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">AI Agent &amp; Workflow Development<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Design, build, and maintain AI Agents for business operations.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Develop <\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"color:#2e3849;background:#FFFFFF;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">monitoring, logging, and observability for agent behaviors and safety rules.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Develop AI-powered workflows that automate repetitive business processes.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Translate business requirements into practical AI solutions.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Build scalable AI applications that improve productivity and operational efficiency.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Integrate AI solutions with internal systems and third-party platforms.<br \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Business AI Applications<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Develop AI solutions across different business functions, including Risk Management, Testing, Marketing, Operations and Customer Support.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Identify opportunities where AI can automate manual work, improve decision-making, and streamline business operations.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">AI Development<br \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Build AI applications using modern Large Language Models (LLMs).<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Design prompts, AI workflows, and multi-agent solutions for different business scenarios.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Develop solutions using RAG, MCP, Function Calling, Memory, and Tool Calling.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Integrate LLM APIs into internal platforms and automation pipelines.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Build AI workflows using both code-based and low-code\/no-code platforms where appropriate.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Continuously evaluate emerging AI technologies and recommend practical business applications.<strong> <\/strong><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Requirements<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0<strong>\u00c2\u00a0 <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">1\u00e2\u0080\u00933 years of experience building AI applications, AI Agents, or workflow automation solutions.<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Hands-on experience with leading AI models such as OpenAI (GPT), Openclaw, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Qwen, Llama, or similar LLMs.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Experience using modern AI development tools such as Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Genspark, <\/span><span lang=\"en-us\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">Manus, <\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">OpenHands, or similar AI-assisted development tools.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Familiarity with AI Agent frameworks, Agentic AI Concepts <\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"color:#2e3849;background:#FFFFFF;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">(planning, tool-using agents, retrieval-augmented generation) \u00e2\u0080\u0094 practical exposure or side projects acceptable.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Experience integrating AI solutions with APIs, third-party services, or internal business systems.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Basic programming skills in Python and familiarity with prompt engineering, AI workflow design, or RAG.<\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><br \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\"> \u00c2\u00a0 \u00c2\u00a0 \u00c2\u00a0 <span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Experience building multi-agent systems, workflow automation platforms and or deploying AI applications into production environments.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Experience in FinTech, Trading, Risk Management and or digital asset.<br \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" style=\"font-family:Symbol;\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\"><span>\u00c2\u00b7<span style=\"font:7pt 'Times New Roman';\">\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0\u00c2\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills, with a passion for learning and applying emerging AI technologies.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Why Join Us<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Fully remote working environment with your local working hours.<\/span><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Build AI solutions that solve real business problems.<\/span><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Work across multiple business functions and help shape the company's AI transformation.<\/span><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Work with the latest AI technologies, LLMs, AI Agents, workflow automation, and modern AI development tools.<\/span><\/li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span lang=\"en-sg\" xml:lang=\"en-sg\">Opportunity to build practical AI applications with direct business impact.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BENEFICIARY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","salary_min":10000,"salary_max":20000,"apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-genai-engineer-ai-builder-ai-agent-associate-specialist-magic-compass-limited-1135735","original":true,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-genai-engineer-ai-builder-ai-agent-associate-specialist-magic-compass-limited-1135735"},{"slug":"remote-permanent-jobs-new-zealand-apples-and-pears-1135747","id":"1135747","epoch":1785481361,"date":"2026-07-31T07:02:41+00:00","company":"New Zealand Apples and Pears","company_logo":"","position":"Permanent Jobs","tags":["education","golang","non tech"],"description":"<ul><li>Home <\/li><li> Careers &amp; Training <\/li><li> Permanent Jobs <br><br><\/li><\/ul>Permanent Jobs<br><br>Ready to take the leap into the world leading, innovative and exciting apple and pear industry.<br><br>Find a Permanent Job<br><br>If you are looking for an innovative and exciting apple and pear career.<br><br>Go to the GoHort Job Board for the latest positions and opportunities available.<br><br>Go to GoHort Job Board<br><br>Apple Careers<br><br>Check out these roles<br><br>Discover Apple and Pear Careers<br><br>Share this page<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **AMBITIOUS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show