\u00e4\u00b8\u008a\u00ef\u00bc","tags":["python"],"description":"\u00e8\u00af\u00a5\u00e8\u0081\u008c\u00e4\u00bd\u008d\u00e6\u009d\u00a5\u00e6\u00ba\u0090\u00e4\u00ba\u008e\u00e7\u008c\u008e\u00e8\u0081\u0098 \u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac\u00e6\u00ad\u00a3\u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e6\u0089\u0093\u00e9\u0080\u00a0\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e5\u00a5\u0097\u00e9\u009d\u00a2\u00e5\u0090\u0091\u00e6\u009c\u00aa\u00e6\u009d\u00a5\u00e7\u009a\u0084 AI + \u00e5\u00a4\u00a7\u00e6\u00a8\u00a1\u00e5\u009e\u008b + \u00e6\u0099\u00ba\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e4\u00bd\u0093\u00e5\u00ae\u009e\u00e6\u0088\u0098\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e7\u008e\u00b0\u00e9\u009d\u00a2\u00e5\u0090\u0091\u00e5\u0085\u00a8\u00e5\u009b\u00bd\u00e6\u008b\u009b\u00e5\u008b\u009f\u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e6\u00a0\u00a1\u00e7\u00a1\u0095\u00e5\u00a3\u00ab\/\u00e5\u008d\u009a\u00e5\u00a3\u00ab\u00e5\u0090\u008c\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e6\u008b\u0085\u00e4\u00bb\u00bb\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e8\u00ae\u00b2\u00e5\u00b8\u0088\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e5\u0085\u00b1\u00e5\u00bb\u00ba\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e6\u0095\u0099\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e6\u0094\u00af\u00e6\u008c\u0081\u00e3\u0080\u0082 \u00e5\u00a6\u0082\u00e6\u009e\u009c\u00e4\u00bd\u00a0\u00e5\u00af\u00b9 AI \u00e5\u0085\u0085\u00e6\u00bb\u00a1\u00e5\u00a5\u00bd\u00e5\u00a5\u0087\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e6\u0083\u00b3\u00e6\u008a\u008a\u00e6\u008a\u0080\u00e6\u009c\u00af\u00e5\u008f\u0098\u00e6\u0088\u0090\u00e5\u00bd\u00b1\u00e5\u0093\u008d\u00e5\u008a\u009b\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e8\u00bf\u0099\u00e4\u00bc\u009a\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e4\u00b8\u00aa\u00e5\u00be\u0088\u00e5\u00a5\u00bd\u00e7\u009a\u0084\u00e8\u00b5\u00b7\u00e7\u0082\u00b9\u00e3\u0080\u0082 \u00e6\u0089\u0080\u00e5\u00b1\u009e\u00e9\u0083\u00a8\u00e9\u0097\u00a8\u00ef\u00bc\u009a\u00e6\u0095\u00b0\u00e5\u00ad\u0097\u00e5\u008f\u008c\u00e7\u00a7\u00bb\u00e5\u008a\u00a8\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e5\u00bf\u0083 \u00e6\u008b\u009b\u00e5\u008b\u009f\u00e4\u00ba\u00ba\u00e6\u0095\u00b0\u00ef\u00bc\u009a5\u00e5\u0090\u008d<br><br>\u00e4\u00bd\u00a0\u00e5\u00b0\u0086\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00ef\u00bc\u009a - \u00e6\u008b\u0085\u00e4\u00bb\u00bb AI \/ \u00e5\u00a4\u00a7\u00e6\u00a8\u00a1\u00e5\u009e\u008b \/ \u00e6\u0099\u00ba\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e4\u00bd\u0093\u00e7\u009b\u00b8\u00e5\u0085\u00b3\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e7\u009a\u0084\u00e7\u00ba\u00bf\u00e4\u00b8\u008a\u00e8\u00ae\u00b2\u00e5\u00b8\u0088\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e8\u00b4\u009f\u00e8\u00b4\u00a3\u00e6\u0095\u0099\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e6\u0094\u00af\u00e6\u008c\u0081 - \u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e5\u0086\u0085\u00e5\u00ae\u00b9\u00e5\u0085\u00b1\u00e5\u00bb\u00ba\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u00a1\u0088\u00e4\u00be\u008b\u00e8\u00ae\u00be\u00e8\u00ae\u00a1\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u00ae\u009e\u00e6\u0093\u008d\u00e4\u00bc\u0098\u00e5\u008c\u0096\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e7\u00ad\u0094\u00e7\u0096\u0091\u00e4\u00bd\u0093\u00e7\u00b3\u00bb\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 - \u00e5\u00b8\u00a6\u00e9\u00a2\u0086\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e5\u0091\u0098\u00e5\u00ae\u008c\u00e6\u0088\u0090\u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae\u00e5\u00ae\u009e\u00e8\u00b7\u00b5\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e5\u00a6\u0082\u00ef\u00bc\u009aAI Agent\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e8\u0087\u00aa\u00e5\u008a\u00a8\u00e5\u008c\u0096\u00e5\u00b7\u00a5\u00e5\u0085\u00b7\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u00ba\u0094\u00e7\u0094\u00a8\u00e5\u00bc\u0080\u00e5\u008f\u0091\u00e7\u00ad\u0089\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 - \u00e6\u0089\u0093\u00e9\u0080\u00a0\u00e4\u00b8\u00aa\u00e4\u00ba\u00ba\u00e6\u008a\u0080\u00e6\u009c\u00af\u00e5\u00bd\u00b1\u00e5\u0093\u008d\u00e5\u008a\u009b\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u009c\u0089\u00e6\u009c\u00ba\u00e4\u00bc\u009a\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e5\u0085\u00ac\u00e5\u00bc\u0080\u00e5\u0088\u0086\u00e4\u00ba\u00ab\/\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e7\u00bd\u00b2\u00e5\u0090\u008d\u00ef\u00bc\u0089<br><br>\u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac\u00e5\u00b8\u008c\u00e6\u009c\u009b\u00e4\u00bd\u00a0\u00e5\u0085\u00b7\u00e5\u00a4\u0087\u00ef\u00bc\u009a - \u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e8\u00af\u00bb\u00e7\u00a1\u0095\u00e5\u00a3\u00ab \/ \u00e5\u008d\u009a\u00e5\u00a3\u00ab\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e5\u0085\u00b7\u00e5\u00a4\u0087\u00e8\u00ae\u00a1\u00e7\u00ae\u0097\u00e6\u009c\u00ba\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e8\u00bd\u00af\u00e4\u00bb\u00b6\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e7\u0094\u00b5\u00e5\u00ad\u0090\u00e4\u00bf\u00a1\u00e6\u0081\u00af\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e4\u00ba\u00ba\u00e5\u00b7\u00a5\u00e6\u0099\u00ba\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e8\u0087\u00aa\u00e5\u008a\u00a8\u00e5\u008c\u0096\u00e7\u00ad\u0089\u00e7\u009b\u00b8\u00e5\u0085\u00b3\u00e4\u00b8\u0093\u00e4\u00b8\u009a\u00e7\u00a1\u0095\u00e5\u00a3\u00ab\u00e5\u008f\u008a\u00e4\u00bb\u00a5\u00e4\u00b8\u008a\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e5\u008e\u0086\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e5\u0090\u00ab\u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e8\u00af\u00bb\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 - \u00e7\u0086\u009f\u00e6\u0082\u0089\u00e6\u0088\u0096\u00e6\u008e\u00a5\u00e8\u00a7\u00a6\u00e8\u00bf\u0087\u00e4\u00bb\u00a5\u00e4\u00b8\u008b\u00e4\u00bb\u00bb\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e6\u0096\u00b9\u00e5\u0090\u0091\u00ef\u00bc\u009a \u00e5\u00a4\u00a7\u00e8\u00af\u00ad\u00e8\u00a8\u0080\u00e6\u00a8\u00a1\u00e5\u009e\u008b\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e5\u00a6\u0082 GPT\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u00bc\u0080\u00e6\u00ba\u0090 LLM \u00e7\u00ad\u0089\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 AI Agent \/ LangChain \/ RAG \u00e7\u00ad\u0089\u00e6\u00a1\u0086\u00e6\u009e\u00b6 Python \/ \u00e6\u0095\u00b0\u00e6\u008d\u00ae\u00e5\u00a4\u0084\u00e7\u0090\u0086 \/ \u00e5\u0090\u008e\u00e7\u00ab\u00af\u00e5\u00bc\u0080\u00e5\u008f\u0091 - \u00e6\u009c\u0089\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e5\u00ae\u009a\u00e8\u00a1\u00a8\u00e8\u00be\u00be\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e5\u008a\u009b\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e6\u0084\u00bf\u00e6\u0084\u008f\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e5\u0088\u0086\u00e4\u00ba\u00ab\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e7\u00ad\u0094\u00e7\u0096\u0091 - \u00e6\u009c\u0089\u00e8\u00b4\u00a3\u00e4\u00bb\u00bb\u00e5\u00bf\u0083\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e6\u008c\u0089\u00e5\u0091\u00a8\u00e6\u009c\u009f\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u0097\u00b6\u00e9\u0097\u00b4\u00e7\u0081\u00b5\u00e6\u00b4\u00bb\u00ef\u00bc\u0089<br><br>\u00e6\u0094\u00b6\u00e7\u009b\u008a\u00e5\u009b\u009e\u00e6\u008a\u00a5\u00ef\u00bc\u009a - 0.8k \u00e2\u0080\u0093 2k \/ h\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u008c\u0089\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e6\u0088\u0096\u00e6\u00a8\u00a1\u00e5\u009d\u0097\u00e7\u00bb\u0093\u00e7\u00ae\u0097\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 - \u00e5\u008f\u00af\u00e8\u008e\u00b7\u00e5\u00be\u0097\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e5\u0085\u00b1\u00e5\u00bb\u00ba\u00e8\u00af\u0081\u00e6\u0098\u008e \/ \u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae\u00e7\u00bb\u008f\u00e5\u008e\u0086 - \u00e6\u00b7\u00b1\u00e5\u00ba\u00a6\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e AI \u00e5\u0089\u008d\u00e6\u00b2\u00bf\u00e5\u00ba\u0094\u00e7\u0094\u00a8\u00e8\u0090\u00bd\u00e5\u009c\u00b0\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u00af\u0094\u00e5\u008d\u0095\u00e7\u00ba\u00af\u00e5\u0086\u0099\u00e8\u00ae\u00ba\u00e6\u0096\u0087\u00e6\u009b\u00b4\u00e2\u0080\u009c\u00e6\u008e\u00a5\u00e5\u009c\u00b0\u00e6\u00b0\u0094\u00e2\u0080\u009d\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 - \u00e7\u00bb\u0093\u00e8\u00af\u0086\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e7\u00be\u00a4\u00e5\u0081\u009a AI \u00e7\u009a\u0084\u00e5\u0090\u008c\u00e9\u00a2\u0091\u00e4\u00bc\u0099\u00e4\u00bc\u00b4\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e5\u0090\u00ab\u00e8\u00a1\u008c\u00e4\u00b8\u009a\u00e4\u00bb\u008e\u00e4\u00b8\u009a\u00e8\u0080\u0085\u00ef\u00bc\u0089<br><br>\u00e5\u008a\u00a0\u00e5\u0088\u0086\u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e9\u009d\u009e\u00e5\u00bf\u0085\u00e9\u00a1\u00bb\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 1. \u00e6\u009c\u0089 AI \u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae\u00e7\u00bb\u008f\u00e9\u00aa\u008c \/ \u00e5\u00bc\u0080\u00e6\u00ba\u0090\u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e7\u00bb\u008f\u00e5\u008e\u0086 2. \u00e6\u009c\u0089\u00e6\u0095\u0099\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u008a\u00a9\u00e6\u0095\u0099\u00e6\u0088\u0096\u00e7\u00a4\u00be\u00e7\u00be\u00a4\u00e8\u00bf\u0090\u00e8\u0090\u00a5\u00e7\u00bb\u008f\u00e9\u00aa\u008c 3. \u00e6\u009c\u0089\u00e5\u0086\u0085\u00e5\u00ae\u00b9\u00e5\u0088\u009b\u00e4\u00bd\u009c\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e5\u008d\u009a\u00e5\u00ae\u00a2 \/ B\u00e7\u00ab\u0099 \/ \u00e5\u00b0\u008f\u00e7\u00ba\u00a2\u00e4\u00b9\u00a6\u00e7\u00ad\u0089\u00ef\u00bc\u0089<br><br>\u00e6\u008a\u00a5\u00e5\u0090\u008d\u00e6\u0096\u00b9\u00e5\u00bc\u008f\u00ef\u00bc\u009a\u00e7\u009b\u00b4\u00e6\u008e\u00a5\u00e6\u008a\u0095\u00e9\u0080\u0092\u00e6\u0088\u0096\u00e5\u008f\u0091\u00e9\u0080\u0081\u00e4\u00bb\u00a5\u00e4\u00b8\u008b\u00e4\u00bf\u00a1\u00e6\u0081\u00af\u00e8\u0087\u00b3\u00e6\u008c\u0087\u00e5\u00ae\u009a\u00e9\u0082\u00ae\u00e7\u00ae\u00b1 \u00e8\u00af\u00b7\u00e5\u008f\u0091\u00e9\u0080\u0081\u00e4\u00bb\u00a5\u00e4\u00b8\u008b\u00e4\u00bf\u00a1\u00e6\u0081\u00af\u00ef\u00bc\u009a \u00e5\u00ad\u00a6\u00e6\u00a0\u00a1 + \u00e4\u00b8\u0093\u00e4\u00b8\u009a + \u00e5\u00b9\u00b4\u00e7\u00ba\u00a7 \u00e6\u008a\u0080\u00e6\u009c\u00af\u00e6\u0096\u00b9\u00e5\u0090\u0091 \/ \u00e7\u009b\u00b8\u00e5\u0085\u00b3\u00e7\u00bb\u008f\u00e9\u00aa\u008c \u00e5\u008f\u00af\u00e6\u008a\u0095\u00e5\u0085\u00a5\u00e6\u0097\u00b6\u00e9\u0097\u00b4\u00ef\u00bc\u0088\u00e6\u00af\u008f\u00e5\u0091\u00a8\u00e5\u00a4\u00a7\u00e6\u00a6\u0082\u00e6\u0097\u00b6\u00e9\u0095\u00bf\u00ef\u00bc\u0089 \u00e7\u00ae\u0080\u00e5\u008d\u0095\u00e8\u00af\u00b4\u00e6\u0098\u008e\u00ef\u00bc\u009a\u00e4\u00b8\u00ba\u00e4\u00bb\u0080\u00e4\u00b9\u0088\u00e6\u0083\u00b3\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e8\u00bf\u0099\u00e4\u00b8\u00aa\u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae<br><br>\u00e5\u0085\u00b3\u00e4\u00ba\u008e\u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac | \u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac\u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e5\u0081\u009a\u00e4\u00bb\u0080\u00e4\u00b9\u0088<br><br>\u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac\u00e7\u009b\u00b8\u00e4\u00bf\u00a1\u00ef\u00bc\u009a AI \u00e4\u00b8\u008d\u00e5\u008f\u00aa\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e5\u00b7\u00a5\u00e5\u0085\u00b7\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e8\u0080\u008c\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e4\u00b8\u008b\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e4\u00bb\u00a3\u00e7\u0094\u009f\u00e4\u00ba\u00a7\u00e5\u008a\u009b\u00e5\u009f\u00ba\u00e7\u00a1\u0080\u00e8\u00ae\u00be\u00e6\u0096\u00bd\u00e3\u0080\u0082 \u00e8\u00bf\u0099\u00e4\u00b8\u00aa\u00e9\u00a1\u00b9\u00e7\u009b\u00ae\u00e4\u00b8\u008d\u00e4\u00bb\u0085\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e2\u0080\u009c\u00e5\u0081\u009a\u00e8\u00af\u00be\u00e7\u00a8\u008b\u00e2\u0080\u009d\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e6\u009b\u00b4\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e5\u009c\u00a8\u00e4\u00b8\u0080\u00e8\u00b5\u00b7\u00e6\u008e\u00a2\u00e7\u00b4\u00a2\u00ef\u00bc\u009a \u00e6\u0099\u00ae\u00e9\u0080\u009a\u00e4\u00ba\u00ba\u00e5\u00a6\u0082\u00e4\u00bd\u0095\u00e7\u0094\u00a8 AI \u00e6\u0094\u00be\u00e5\u00a4\u00a7\u00e8\u0083\u00bd\u00e5\u008a\u009b\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e7\u0094\u009a\u00e8\u0087\u00b3\u00e6\u0094\u00b9\u00e5\u008f\u0098\u00e8\u00b7\u00af\u00e5\u00be\u0084\u00e3\u0080\u0082<br><br>\u00e5\u00a6\u0082\u00e6\u009e\u009c\u00e4\u00bd\u00a0\u00e4\u00b8\u008d\u00e6\u0083\u00b3\u00e5\u008f\u00aa\u00e2\u0080\u009c\u00e5\u00ad\u00a6 AI\u00e2\u0080\u009d\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e8\u0080\u008c\u00e6\u0098\u00af\u00e6\u0083\u00b3\u00e7\u009c\u009f\u00e6\u00ad\u00a3\u00e5\u008f\u0082\u00e4\u00b8\u008e\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u00ae\u009e\u00e8\u00b7\u00b5\u00e3\u0080\u0081\u00e5\u0085\u00b1\u00e5\u00bb\u00ba\u00ef\u00bc\u008c\u00e6\u00ac\u00a2\u00e8\u00bf\u008e\u00e5\u008a\u00a0\u00e5\u0085\u00a5\u00e6\u0088\u0091\u00e4\u00bb\u00ac\u00e3\u0080\u0082<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FREE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"\u00e5\u00b9\u00bf\u00e5\u00b7\u009e, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/"},{"slug":"remote-executive-operations-amp-project-manager-viva-wellness-drip-1135744","id":"1135744","epoch":1785465050,"date":"2026-07-31T02:30:50+00:00","company":"Viva Wellness Drip","company_logo":"","position":"Executive Operations &amp; Project Manager","tags":["hr","technical","writer","customer support","exec","education","senior","marketing","sales","medical","full time","virtual assistant","finance","ops","recruiter","design","saas","sys admin","dev","payroll","golang","digital nomad","project manager","travel","microsoft","mobile","part time"],"description":"<p><strong>Executive Operations &amp; Project Manager<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Location:<\/strong> Los Angeles, CA (Hybrid)<\/p><p><strong>Job Type:<\/strong> Independent Contractor (1099)<\/p><p><strong>Hours:<\/strong> Approximately 10 Hours per Week to Start<\/p><p><strong>Compensation:<\/strong> $25\u00e2\u0080\u009335\/hour (Based on Experience)<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About Viva Wellness Drip<\/strong><\/p><p>Viva Wellness Drip is a rapidly growing concierge wellness company dedicated to delivering premium healthcare experiences directly to our clients. We specialize in mobile IV therapy, wellness injections, peptide programs, aesthetic treatments, concierge nursing, corporate wellness services, luxury hospitality partnerships, and wellness activations throughout the United States.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>As we continue expanding our services, partnerships, and operations, we're looking for an exceptionally organized, proactive, and resourceful Executive Operations &amp; Project Manager to work directly alongside our founders and help drive the company's next stage of growth.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This is an exciting opportunity to become one of the first operational leaders within a fast-growing company where you'll gain exposure to nearly every aspect of the business\u00e2\u0080\u0094from operations and project management to strategic initiatives, marketing, hiring, partnerships, and company-wide growth.<br><\/p><p><strong>Position Overview<\/strong><\/p><p>This is <strong>not<\/strong> a traditional Executive Assistant position.<\/p><p>We're looking for someone who enjoys bringing structure to a fast-moving business, solving problems before they arise, keeping projects organized, and ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>As our Executive Operations &amp; Project Manager, you'll serve as the operational right hand to our founders, helping coordinate priorities, manage projects, improve communication across departments, and keep multiple business initiatives moving forward simultaneously.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Every day will look different. One day you may be coordinating a new service launch, the next you may be helping onboard new contractors, organizing company documentation, following up on strategic partnerships, or helping prepare for a major corporate wellness event.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>If you're someone who thrives in an entrepreneurial environment, enjoys wearing multiple hats, and wants to grow alongside a rapidly expanding company, we'd love to hear from you.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Executive Operations<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Manage executive calendars, scheduling, and meeting coordination.<\/li><li>Organize weekly priorities and executive action items.<\/li><li>Track deadlines and ensure follow-through on key initiatives.<\/li><li>Prepare meeting agendas and document action items.<\/li><li>Coordinate executive travel and logistics when needed.<\/li><li>Assist with executive correspondence and internal communications.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Project Management<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Keep company projects organized and moving forward.<\/li><li>Coordinate timelines across multiple departments.<\/li><li>Follow up with vendors, contractors, partners, and internal team members.<\/li><li>Assist with launching new services, programs, and business initiatives.<\/li><li>Help identify operational bottlenecks and recommend solutions.<\/li><li>Ensure projects are completed accurately and on schedule.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Business Operations<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Organize company files, documents, and internal systems.<\/li><li>Maintain and update Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs).<\/li><li>Assist with contractor onboarding and administrative processes.<\/li><li>Help improve operational workflows and efficiencies.<\/li><li>Coordinate communication between departments.<\/li><li>Support day-to-day administrative and operational needs.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Cross-Functional Support<\/strong><\/p><p>Work closely with our founders and collaborate with departments including:<\/p><ul><li>Business Development<\/li><li>Marketing<\/li><li>Operations<\/li><li>Clinical Services<\/li><li>Dispatch &amp; Wellness Coordinators<\/li><li>Inventory Management<\/li><li>Events &amp; Corporate Wellness<\/li><\/ul><p>You'll help ensure projects remain aligned, organized, and progressing efficiently across the organization.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Qualifications:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Required<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Minimum 3 years of experience supporting executives, founders, or leadership teams.<\/li><li>Strong project management and organizational skills.<\/li><li>Excellent written and verbal communication.<\/li><li>Exceptional attention to detail.<\/li><li>Ability to prioritize multiple projects simultaneously.<\/li><li>High level of professionalism and discretion when handling confidential information.<\/li><li>Proficiency with Google Workspace and Microsoft Office.<\/li><li>Ability to work independently with minimal supervision.<\/li><li>Must be located within commuting distance of Los Angeles, California.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Preferred<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Experience working in a startup or high-growth company.<\/li><li>Healthcare, wellness, hospitality, or concierge service experience.<\/li><li>Experience creating or improving business systems and operational processes.<\/li><li>Familiarity with project management platforms such as Asana, ClickUp, Monday.com, Trello, or Notion.<\/li><li>Experience supporting multiple executives or departments.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What We're Looking For<\/strong><\/p><p>The ideal candidate is proactive, dependable, resourceful, and naturally takes ownership.<\/p><p>You're the type of person who notices problems before others do, enjoys creating organization from complexity, communicates professionally, and takes pride in helping a business operate more efficiently.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>You don't wait to be told what to do\u00e2\u0080\u0094you anticipate needs, solve problems, and help move the company forward.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Most importantly, you're excited about joining a fast-growing company where you'll have the opportunity to grow your responsibilities and make a meaningful impact.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Compensation &amp; Growth<\/strong><\/p><p>This position begins as a <strong>1099 Independent Contractor<\/strong> through an initial 90-day contract-to-hire engagement.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>The first 90 days are intended to ensure a strong mutual fit while providing an opportunity for both you and Viva Wellness Drip to build a successful long-term working relationship.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Following a successful engagement, there is significant opportunity for increased hours, expanded responsibilities, and transition into a long-term part-time or full-time role as the company continues to grow.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Why Join Viva Wellness Drip?<\/strong><\/p><p>At Viva Wellness Drip, you'll work directly alongside the founders of an ambitious and rapidly expanding concierge wellness company.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Your work will have a direct impact on how the company grows, scales, and operates. You'll help build systems, improve efficiency, support exciting new initiatives, and contribute to a company that's redefining how wellness services are delivered.<\/p><ul><li>If you're looking for a role where your ideas matter, your work has a meaningful impact, and your career can grow alongside an innovative company, we'd love to hear from you.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **VOUCH** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Los Angeles, Los Angeles, California, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-executive-operations-amp-project-manager-viva-wellness-drip-1135744","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-executive-operations-amp-project-manager-viva-wellness-drip-1135744"},{"slug":"remote-nanny-camp-hill-mini-connections-1135760","id":"1135760","epoch":1785464341,"date":"2026-07-31T02:19:01+00:00","company":"Mini Connections","company_logo":"","position":"Nanny Camp Hill","tags":["sys admin","recruiter","non tech","design","hr","infosec","teaching","game dev","testing","travel","accounting","finance","video","education","exec","marketing","telecom","legal","sales","medical","full time","part time","digital nomad","music"],"description":"<strong><strong>Full-time Nanny, Camp Hill (40-hours), Commence ASAP!<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><strong><strong>Hours:<\/strong><\/strong> Monday\u00e2\u0080\u0093Friday, approx. 40hrs per week (6am\u00e2\u0080\u00932pm) | Permanent Full-Time <em><em>(4-day week may be considered for the right candidate)<br><br><\/em><\/em><strong><strong>Salary:<\/strong><\/strong> From $70,000 + super + entitlements<br><br><strong><strong>Minis:<\/strong><\/strong> Two boys, 4 &amp; 2, with a baby girl due in November<br><br><strong><strong>Commence:<\/strong><\/strong> ASAP<br><br><strong>About Our Clients<br><br><\/strong>This warm and vibrant Camp Hill family are looking for an easy going and friendly Nanny to become a valued part of their home. Dad is a busy business owner, while Mum is a stay-at-home mum preparing to welcome their third mini later this year. They value integrity, accountability and kindness, and have created a positive, respectful home where open communication and mutual appreciation are at the heart of family life.<br><br>Their boys are active, curious and full of laughter, enjoying swimming lessons, music, park adventures and playing with monster trucks. The family embraces a healthy lifestyle with limited screen time and loves outdoor play and learning through everyday experiences.<br><br><strong><strong>Duties<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><ul><li>Sole charge of the minis when required<\/li><li>Planning fun, engaging outings and activities<\/li><li>Taking the minis to swimming, music and other social activities<\/li><li>Preparing healthy meals for the minis<\/li><li>Light household duties including kitchen tidying, dishes, rubbish and general wipe-downs<\/li><li>Driving the minis to activities using the family vehicle<\/li><li>Supporting the smooth running of the household during busy mornings<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong><strong>The perfect fit<br><br><\/strong><\/strong>You're reliable, adaptable and personable, with a genuine passion for supporting young families. You are known to be a nanny who is respectful and not overbearing and follows family routine whilst being confident working independently while respecting the family's routines and parenting style.<br><br>All you need is minimum 3-yrs professional childcare and or nanny experience, a valid Blue Card, police check, first aid\/CPR certification and a current driver's licence. Most importantly, you'll be someone who builds trust naturally, communicates openly and enjoys creating a calm, fun and nurturing environment where children can thrive.<br><br><strong><strong>What's in it for you?<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><ul><li>Become a genuinely valued and trusted member of a warm family<\/li><li>A supportive, respectful workplace where you'll be appreciated<\/li><li>Long-term, permanent employment providing stability and consistency<\/li><li>A nanny car for your job<\/li><li>Competitive salary plus superannuation and full entitlements<\/li><li>Opportunity to build meaningful relationships with three wonderful children as the family grows<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul>If you have always dreamed about becoming a professional nanny with a natural gift bonding with children, we'd love to hear from you!<br><br><strong><strong>Apply Now<br><br><\/strong><\/strong>Hit <strong><strong>Apply<\/strong><\/strong>, or send your updated resume and introduction outlining why you'd be the perfect fit to <strong><strong>hello@miniconnections.com.au<\/strong><\/strong>. Shortlisted applicants will be contacted.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ARDOR** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Camp Hill, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-nanny-camp-hill-mini-connections-1135760","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-nanny-camp-hill-mini-connections-1135760"},{"slug":"remote-1-ideas-impact-csr-ideas-1135732","id":"1135732","epoch":1785464114,"date":"2026-07-31T02:15:14+00:00","company":"CSR Ideas","company_logo":"","position":"1. IDEAS IMPACT","tags":["technical","full time","controller"],"description":"with your Google Account to continue to Google Forms. This account will be available to other Google apps in the browser.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PHENOMENAL** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"\u00e6\u00b5\u008f\u00e9\u0098\u00b3\u00e5\u00b8\u0082, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-1-ideas-impact-csr-ideas-1135732","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-1-ideas-impact-csr-ideas-1135732"},{"slug":"remote-regional-general-manager-airports-westjet-1135745","id":"1135745","epoch":1785462896,"date":"2026-07-31T01:54:56+00:00","company":"WestJet","company_logo":"","position":"Regional General Manager Airports","tags":["exec","infosec","customer support","testing","marketing","travel","finance","education","microsoft","mobile","senior","ops","excel","recruiter"],"description":"<strong>Why WestJet<br><br><\/strong>Since our story took off in 1996, WestJet has strived to enrich the lives of everyone in our world; a career with us is no exception. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re proud to be one of Canada\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most admired and respected corporate cultures and continuously aim for the highest standards of service and success.<br><br><strong>Join us, this is where your career story takes off.<br><br><\/strong>This position is eligible for remote work, within Canada, under our mobile workforce program.<br><br><strong>Regional General Manager, Airports<br><br><\/strong>As the Regional General Manager, you will provide strategic leadership and direction to deliver safe operations while driving excellence in operational performance and guest service through our contracted service partners across the designated region. Reporting directly to the Vice President of Airports, you will lead a team of Regional Managers and collaborate closely with internal and external stakeholders to maintain regulatory compliance, foster positive relationships, and ensure a consistent, high-quality guest experience across all airport touchpoints within the region.<br><br>This role requires an experienced leader who holds service partners accountable for delivering WestJet's operational and service standards while balancing the needs of our guests, our partners, and our business. You will coach and support service partners in developing and executing airport action plans that address performance gaps, strengthen safety, and improve the guest experience.<br><br>The Regional General Manager will provide strategic oversight of airport operations across the region by identifying emerging risks, monitoring operational performance, and ensuring consistent execution of WestJet's standards and priorities. Through strong partnerships with service providers and airport authorities, you will drive continuous improvement, enhance operational resilience, and ensure our airports consistently deliver safe, reliable operations and an exceptional guest experience.<br><br><strong>Key Deliverables Include<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Foster a Safety Above All culture with Regional Managers by ensuring service partners achieve safety targets, monitoring performance trends, and addressing operational risks.<\/li><li>Lead, coach, and develop a high-performing team of Regional Managers to deliver operational performance, guest satisfaction, employee engagement, and financial results.<\/li><li>Provide strategic oversight of airport operations, ensuring consistent execution of WestJet's operational and guest standards and priorities.<\/li><li>Deliver regional operational performance by achieving operational, guest experience, and financial objectives while driving continuous improvement through station action plans.<\/li><li>Provide governance through audits, operational reviews, and performance assessments to ensure adherence to standards, identify risks, and drive corrective actions.<\/li><li>Analyze operational performance and safety data to identify trends and risks, inform operational decision making, prioritize resources, and strengthen oversight across the region.<\/li><li>Serve as the senior escalation point for Regional Managers, providing leadership and decision support for complex operational, guest, commercial, safety, and irregular operations.<\/li><li>Partner with the Strategic Procurement team to develop service partner strategies, support partner selection, and ensure service partners deliver safe, high-performing, and cost-effective operations.<\/li><li>Build and maintain executive relationships with airport authorities, service partner leadership, government agencies, bargaining agents, and other key stakeholders.<\/li><li>Lead regional operational planning to ensure airports are resourced and operationally ready for seasonal demand, network growth, start-ups, restarts, service partner transitions, station closures, and other strategic initiatives.<\/li><li>Champion innovation and continuous improvement by leveraging data and implementing initiatives that enhance operational performance, the guest experience, employee engagement, and financial results.<\/li><li>Participate as a member of the Airports Leadership Team to establish departmental priorities, contribute to strategic direction, and lead the development and execution of departmental initiatives. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Experience And Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>3+ years Airports leadership experience required <\/li><li>Business leadership experience with a significant level of internal and external dependencies and relationships. <\/li><li>Possess strong business acumen to deliver departmental plans including budget. <\/li><li>Proven ability to multitask &amp; handle changing priorities. <\/li><li>Confident in presenting materials and reports to the next 2 levels. <\/li><li>Post-secondary education with a business application an asset. <\/li><li>Ability to manage multiple leaders and locations simultaneously. <\/li><li>Proficient in PC based applications, Microsoft Project, Word, Excel and Outlook. <\/li><li>Ability to travel &amp; spend time away for significant periods of time. <\/li><li>Project management skills considered an asset. <\/li><li>Knowledge of International regulations and guidelines (for example - TSA\/Civil Aviation, UK High Commission etc.) an asset. <\/li><li>Proven track record of effectively influencing leadership teams via handling partners and developing strong direct leadership teams. <\/li><li>IATA SGHA experience would be beneficial. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>The Benefits Of Being a WestJetter<br><br><\/strong>WestJet provides all WestJetters with a competitive total rewards package. On top of that, we offer:<br><br><ul><li>A fun and friendly culture with colleagues who work together to win<\/li><li>Travel privileges for you and your family, effective from your start date<\/li><li>Savings and Benefit programs that are flexible to meet your specific needs <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Think we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re a great fit? Apply now!<br><br><\/strong><strong>About WestJet Group Of Companies<br><br><\/strong>WestJet took to the skies in 1996 with just over 200 employees and three aircraft operating service to five destinations. Since then, WestJet has pioneered low-cost travel in Canada, cutting airfares in half, and increasing the flying population in Canada by more than 50 per cent. Since the Sunwing Airlines integration in 2025, more than 15,000 WestJetters support nearly 200 aircraft and connect guests to our global network of more than 100 destinations across North America, Central America, the Caribbean, Europe and Asia. The WestJet Group is a major Canadian employer and includes WestJet Airlines, WestJet Encore and Sunwing Vacations Group. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re Canada\u00e2\u0080\u0099s leading value airline and largest vacation provider, with a united purpose of providing affordable and accessible air and vacation travel to Canadians.<br><br><strong>Our safety promise<br><br><\/strong>At WestJet, the safety and security of our people and our guests is a core value and at the heart of what we do. Safety and security are shared responsibilities all team members are expected to use safe work practices to ensure their well-being and the safety of others. WestJet recognizes that the use of Alcohol and Drugs can adversely impact a safe work environment and the well-being of others including guests, suppliers and the public, as well as place WestJet's operations at risk. All roles that are identified as Safey-Sensitive are required to pass a Pre-Employment Alcohol and Drug Test as per WestJet's\u00e2\u0080\u00afAlcohol and Drug Policy.\u00e2\u0080\u00af<br><br><strong>Our commitment to diversity, equity and inclusion<br><br><\/strong>We embrace what makes each of us unique, and what makes us uniquely WestJet. We welcome diverse skills, experiences and backgrounds so if you're passionate about this role, we encourage you to apply \u00e2\u0080\u0093 even if you don't meet every qualification listed. WestJet is committed to inclusiveness, equity and accessibility throughout the selection process. If you require accommodation at any stage, please contact our Talent Acquisition team at talent@westjet.com.<br><br>We value the time and effort you put into your application. Our recruitment process is highly competitive and while every applicant will receive communication regarding their application status, only those selected to move forward will be contacted with next steps. If this role isn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t the right fit, we encourage you to explore future opportunities with us.<br><br><strong>About<br><br><\/strong><strong>For more information about everything WestJet, please visit westjet.com\/aboutus.<br><br><\/strong>If you wish to withdraw your application or request that your personal information be deleted, please contact us at talent@westjet.com.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **OVERTAKING** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Mississauga, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-regional-general-manager-airports-westjet-1135745","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-regional-general-manager-airports-westjet-1135745"},{"slug":"remote-rgeneral-production-dana-incorporated-1135713","id":"1135713","epoch":1785449416,"date":"2026-07-30T22:10:16+00:00","company":"Dana Incorporated","company_logo":"","position":"RGeneral Production","tags":["education","content writing","non tech"],"description":"<strong>Job Purpose<br><br><\/strong>Job Description Content for Job Profiles is a work in progress. If you need content to finalize this requisition for posting, please send a message to mydanahrplatform@dana.com.<br><br><strong>Job Duties And Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong>Job Description Content for Job Profiles is a work in progress. If you need content to finalize this requisition for posting, please send a message to mydanahrplatform@dana.com.<br><br><strong>Skills<br><br><\/strong><strong><strong>Education and Qualifications<\/strong><\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **JOY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Cambridge, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-rgeneral-production-dana-incorporated-1135713","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-rgeneral-production-dana-incorporated-1135713"},{"slug":"remote-future-job-test-flock-freight-1135715","id":"1135715","epoch":1785449168,"date":"2026-07-30T22:06:08+00:00","company":"Flock Freight","company_logo":"","position":"Future Job Test","tags":["testing","non tech"],"description":"This is a future job.<br><br>Equal Opportunity Employer<br><br>This employer is required to notify all applicants of their rights pursuant to federal employment laws. For further information, please review the Know Your Rights notice from the Department of Labor.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **THRIFTY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Encinitas, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-future-job-test-flock-freight-1135715","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-future-job-test-flock-freight-1135715"},{"slug":"remote-sales-development-representative-outbound-tremendous-1135741","id":"1135741","epoch":1785441386,"date":"2026-07-30T19:56:26+00:00","company":"Tremendous","company_logo":"","position":"Sales Development Representative Outbound","tags":["hr","technical","writer","customer support","exec","education","senior","marketing","sales","medical","full time"],"description":"Tremendous is the global platform built for businesses to send thousands of payouts to anyone, anywhere, for free. We're trusted by 20,000 organizations like Atlassian, MIT, and United Way to deliver gift cards and money to millions of recipients worldwide.<br><br>Our customers (researchers, marketers, HR teams, nonprofits, and platform businesses) rave about how fast and easy Tremendous is to use. Check out our ratings on G2.<br><br>Tremendous is profitable and growing without outside investors. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re a fully remote, high-documentation, low-meeting culture, which means more time for what matters in both your professional and personal life. The team agrees\u00e2\u0080\u0093 our employee NPS is in the high 80s.<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>As a Sales Development Representative, your primary responsibility will be to secure meetings with top prospective companies and individuals. You'll work closely with one paired Account Executive to generate meetings from their target account list. We encourage account development through outbound prospecting, social selling, networking, attending conferences and field marketing events, and any sales activity that would contribute to expanding the Tremendous brand. You will be the first line of engagement with prospective customers and will have an impact on Tremendous\u00e2\u0080\u0099 revenue growth and future success.<br><br><strong>What You'll Do<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Work primarily to bring in new deals through Outbound prospecting. <\/li><li>Collaborate with Account Executives, as well as members of our Marketing and Customer Success teams, to develop new strategies to build our sales pipeline and grow our business. <\/li><li>Use Outreach, LinkedIn, your own network, and other prospecting tools to research accounts, identify key contacts and craft targeted messaging. <\/li><li>Learn our technology and effectively communicate our value proposition. Work to understand their goals and challenges to better understand how we can help. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What You'll Bring<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>2-3 years of prior sales experience, ideally in a similar outbound or SDR role. <\/li><li>Clever and creative problem solving. We're small and emphasize output and iteration over a sales handbook set in stone. <\/li><li>Independence. We all work together to solve tough problems here at Tremendous, but taking pride in experimenting and finding your own answers is the best way to learn. <\/li><li>Collaboration. When our SDRs uncover new trends and tactics that work to set meetings, they share them with their teammates so everyone can benefit. <\/li><li>Ability to thrive with a well-set quota. We want our goals to be fair and achievable. You should find these goals alongside your team and with your manager and use them as a benchmark for success. <\/li><li>Ambition. Ambition isn't a dirty word at Tremendous. We're a team of achievers collaborating on a fast-growing product and that means personal growth in both role and responsibility as well as tons of personal upside for you. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What's Cool About The Role<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>You'll work at a company growing quickly yet sustainably. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re profitable with plenty more opportunity ahead. That\u00e2\u0080\u0099s good news for your career growth. <\/li><li>Competitive pay and equity. Base salary for this role: $65,000 - $70,000 plus commission. <\/li><li>Real benefits. 100% covered health (US), unlimited PTO, 12-16 weeks paid parental leave. <\/li><li>Fully remote. Work from anywhere in the Americas. <\/li><li>Great culture. Read more about how we work in our public handbook. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Location<br><br><\/strong>This role is remote-first and you can work wherever you want in the Americas. That said, we have a preference for SDRs based in the Austin or New York areas. There may be opportunities to train and collaborate together in person throughout the year.<br><br>Compensation Range: $65K - $70K<br><br><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STRONGEST** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"New York, New York, New York, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sales-development-representative-outbound-tremendous-1135741","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sales-development-representative-outbound-tremendous-1135741"},{"slug":"remote-admissions-advisor-masterclass-executive-masterclass-1135740","id":"1135740","epoch":1785439092,"date":"2026-07-30T19:18:12+00:00","company":"MasterClass","company_logo":"","position":"Admissions Advisor MasterClass Executive","tags":["hr","technical","writer","customer support","exec","education","senior","marketing","sales","medical","full time"],"description":"<p><strong>Who we are:<\/strong><\/p><p>MasterClass is <em>the <\/em>platform where the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s best come together so anyone, anywhere, can access and be inspired by their knowledge and stories. We put you in the room with the creators, thinkers, makers and leaders who have changed the world, so that you can change yours.<\/p><p>MasterClass Executive is our selective, cohort-based program for senior professionals learning to lead in the AI era, taught by world-class operators and academics in collaboration with the University of Chicago Booth School of Business and OpenAI.<em> <\/em>Admission is competitive: applications are reviewed individually, and spots in each cohort are limited.<\/p><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>About the Role:<\/strong><\/p><p>We're hiring an Admissions Advisor as a temporary, full-time employee to support our next enrollment cycle. You'll spend most of your day on the phone and in the inbox with applicants and admitted candidates \u00e2\u0080\u0094 answering questions about the program experience, helping them weigh the value of enrolling, and guiding them from admission to enrollment ahead of cohort deadlines. You'll also support employer-sponsored enrollment: equipping candidates to make the case to their company and responding to inquiries from managers, HR, and L&amp;D teams.<\/p><p>This is a high-volume, goal-driven role during our busiest enrollment windows. The ideal candidate is a natural on the phone \u00e2\u0080\u0094 consultative, warm, and credible with senior professionals \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and genuinely fluent in both AI and the business-education landscape. You know what programs like ours cost, what the alternatives promise, and how to have an honest conversation about fit and value.<\/p><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>\u00c2\u00a0What You Will Do:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Own a high volume of admissions calls \u00e2\u0080\u0094 scheduled consultations and proactive outreach with applicants and admitted candidates \u00e2\u0080\u0094 answering questions about the curriculum, live sessions, AI Labs, in-person intensive, time commitment, and cohort experience<\/li><li>Help prospective enrollees evaluate the program's value: speak confidently and accurately to outcomes, program fees, and payment options, and position MasterClass Executive honestly against the alternatives candidates are weighing (executive education, MBA programs, certificates, and cohort-based courses)<\/li><li>Guide admitted candidates from decision to enrollment with timely phone and email follow-up through each enrollment window, identifying and removing blockers before deadlines<\/li><li>Run point on employer-sponsorship communications: respond to sponsorship inquiries, provide candidates with materials to secure company support (manager emails, ROI summaries, program overviews), and flag multi-enrollee company interest to our partnerships team<\/li><li>Manage your pipeline with clean notes and reliable follow-through; meet daily and weekly contact and response-time goals<\/li><li>Log the questions, objections, and sponsorship themes you hear and share them weekly with the admissions and marketing teams to sharpen FAQs, call guides, and email copy<\/li><li>Provide surge coverage during peak moments: post-webinar follow-up, enrollment-deadline outreach, and inbox support<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>About You:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>3+ years in admissions or enrollment advising, inside sales, account management, or another phone-forward consultative role \u00e2\u0080\u0094 executive education, higher ed, edtech, or premium consumer experience is a plus<\/li><li>Genuinely energized by phone time: you listen first, handle objections without a hard sell, and are comfortable with 20\u00e2\u0080\u009330+ meaningful conversations a day<\/li><li>A strong writer who can run a high-volume inbox with responses that are crisp, warm, and never read like a template<\/li><li>Conversant in AI: you follow the space, use the tools yourself, and can speak credibly with senior professionals about how AI is changing their work (no technical background required)<\/li><li>Comfortable with ambiguity and able to navigate uncertainty<\/li><li>Fluent in the business-education landscape \u00e2\u0080\u0094 executive education, online MBAs, certificates, and cohort-based programs \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and how buyers compare them<\/li><li>Organized and self-directed: strong CRM hygiene, pipeline discipline, and comfort being measured against clear goals<\/li><li>Adaptable in a fast-moving environment where call guides, offers, and priorities evolve week to week<\/li><li>Available across U.S. time zones, including some early-evening hours when candidates are most reachable<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>Employment Details:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Temporary, full-time employment via our staffing partner TCW Global with an anticipated initial assignment of approximately one month; MasterClass may extend the assignment in its discretion based on cohort needs and business demand<\/li><li>Employment is at will; nothing in this posting guarantees employment for any specific period or any extension of the assignment<\/li><li>Remote (U.S.)<\/li><li>Temporary, Full-time, ~40 hours\/week, nonexempt (overtime eligible)<\/li><li>Pay: $28\/hour base pay, plus eligibility for variable incentive pay, subject to terms of a written incentive plan provided at the time of hire (with estimated total on-target earnings of up to $12,000 monthly on target earnings, inclusive of base pay)<\/li><li>Benefits: The selected candidate will be employed through our third-party staffing partner, TargetCW, and is not eligible for MasterClass employee benefits (including health insurance, paid time off, and retirement plans). Sick leave and other benefits required by applicable law will be managed directly by TargetCW.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>At MasterClass, we believe we put our best work forward when our employees bring together ideas that are diverse in thought. We are proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, genetic information, veteran status, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state or local law. In addition, MasterClass will provide reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities.\u00c2\u00a0 If you have a disability or special need, we would like to know how we can better accommodate you.<\/strong><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HUMBLE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"San Francisco, San Francisco, California, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-admissions-advisor-masterclass-executive-masterclass-1135740","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-admissions-advisor-masterclass-executive-masterclass-1135740"},{"slug":"remote-cleaner-beklane-ltd-1135733","id":"1135733","epoch":1785434716,"date":"2026-07-30T18:05:16+00:00","company":"Beklane Ltd","company_logo":"","position":"Cleaner","tags":["hr","travel","non tech"],"description":"<strong>Description: <\/strong>we need someone who is proactive willing to travel within country. pay is attractive fvhdbjxnsm gdjbzsk hdvbxskm gcjhbdxks gdchxj<br><br><strong>Job Category: <\/strong>cleaning service<br><br><strong>Job Type: <\/strong>Full Time<br><br><strong>Job Location: <\/strong>Northampton<br><br><strong>Salary: <\/strong>\u00c2\u00a320000-\u00c2\u00a330000<br><br><strong>Department: <\/strong>Hr<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **AFFORD** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Northampton, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cleaner-beklane-ltd-1135733","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cleaner-beklane-ltd-1135733"},{"slug":"remote-people-and-culture-manager-casa-tres-events-1135719","id":"1135719","epoch":1785430270,"date":"2026-07-30T16:51:10+00:00","company":"Casa Tr\u00c3\u00a8s Events","company_logo":"","position":"People and Culture Manager","tags":["macos","education","speech","content writing","non tech","hr","teaching","exec","design","technical","marketing","travel","payroll","ops","recruiter","full time","digital nomad"],"description":"<span>People &amp; Culture Manager<\/span><p><strong>CASA TR\u00c3\u0088S \u00c2\u00b7 BARCELONA \u00c2\u00b7 FULL-TIME \u00c2\u00b7 ON-SITE<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><span>Casa Tr\u00c3\u00a8s is a cultural house, not an event supplier. Since 2018 we have designed, built and executed luxury events across Barcelona, Monaco and worldwide \u00e2\u0080\u0094 240+ productions in 11+ countries for brands including Red Bull, Maserati and Dom P\u00c3\u00a9rignon. Official partner of the Circuit de Barcelona-Catalunya F1 Weekend, staging for 300,000+ attendees.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><span>The house is growing fast. Last year alone: 33 events, 11 countries. Growth at this pace is built on people \u00e2\u0080\u0094 the team that specifies every element, and the crews that make the night run itself. We are opening our first People &amp; Culture Manager role to build the structure that growth demands, without losing what makes this place a home.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><em>Casa<\/em><span> means home. That has always applied to our guests. Your job is to make sure it applies, permanently, to our team.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><span>The role<\/span><p><span>You will own people end to end at Casa Tr\u00c3\u00a8s \u00e2\u0080\u0094 from the first conversation with a candidate to the way the team feels on the Monday after a build week. You report directly to the founders and work from our Barcelona office in Poble Nou.<br><\/span><\/p><span>01 \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Talent &amp; hiring<\/span><ul><li><span>Own recruitment across production, creative and operations: brief, source, interview, close.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Build the talent pipeline for a house that produces across 11+ countries \u00e2\u0080\u0094 including the freelance crews, technicians and specialists our productions depend on.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Design onboarding that gets new people from signed contract to confident on-site, quickly.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>02 \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Culture &amp; experience<\/span><ul><li><span>Protect and shape the culture as the team grows: rituals, communication, the standard of hospitality we extend inward, not just outward.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Own the employee experience through the realities of event production \u00e2\u0080\u0094 intense build weeks, travel, seasonal peaks \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and design recovery and balance into the calendar.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Plan the internal moments: team gatherings, reviews of the season, the way wins are marked.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>03 \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Development &amp; performance<\/span><ul><li><span>Build a simple, honest performance framework: clear expectations, regular feedback, real conversations.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Map growth paths so people can see their next role inside the house.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Identify training needs across production, technical and client-facing teams, and organise the learning to meet them.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>04 \u00e2\u0080\u0094 HR operations &amp; compliance<\/span><ul><li><span>Run the HR foundations: contracts, payroll coordination, holidays, absence, records.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ensure compliance with Spanish employment law, and coordinate with advisors on cross-border work in Monaco, France and beyond.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Own the policies \u00e2\u0080\u0094 written once, written clearly \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and the tools and processes that keep people operations running without friction.<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>Who we are looking for<\/span><ul><li><span>[3\u00e2\u0080\u00935+] years in HR, people operations or a generalist people role \u00e2\u0080\u0094 ideally in events, hospitality, agency or another fast-moving, project-based environment.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Working knowledge of Spanish employment law and HR administration.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Fluent English and Spanish. French is a plus \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Monaco is our second address.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Comfortable being the first dedicated people person: building structure from scratch, hands-on, without a playbook.<\/span><\/li><li><span>High discretion, warmth and judgement. You will handle the human side of a house built on hospitality.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>What we offer<\/span><ul><li><span>A first-of-its-kind role with direct line to the founders, and the mandate to build the people function of a growing international house.<\/span><\/li><li><span>A seat in Poble Nou, Barcelona \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and a front-row view of productions from the Monaco Grand Prix to the F1 Weekend at Circuit de Barcelona-Catalunya.<\/span><\/li><li>Competitive<span> package<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><span>To apply<\/span><p><span>Send a short note and your CV to <\/span>piers@casatres.es<span> \u00e2\u0080\u0094 tell us one thing about how a team should feel, and why.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ENTHUSE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Barcelona, Barcelona, Catalu\u00c3\u00b1a, Espa\u00c3\u00b1a","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-people-and-culture-manager-casa-tres-events-1135719","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-people-and-culture-manager-casa-tres-events-1135719"},{"slug":"remote-associate-events-social-amp-influencer-marketing-society-18-1135695","id":"1135695","epoch":1785430247,"date":"2026-07-30T16:50:47+00:00","company":"Society 18","company_logo":"","position":"Associate Events Social &amp; Influencer Marketing","tags":["design","music","customer support","travel","video","exec","content writing","ops","marketing","ads","digital nomad"],"description":"<p><strong>POSITION OVERVIEW:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Society 18 is seeking a highly organized, creative, and proactive Associate of Events, Social &amp; Influencer Marketing to support the agency's creator partnerships, experiential marketing initiatives, social media presence, and day-to-day operations.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This role is ideal for someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, loves bringing ideas to life, enjoys wearing multiple hats, and is passionate about influencer marketing, social media, events, and creator culture. The Associate will work cross-functionally across events, social media, talent, partnerships, and operations while helping execute high-impact campaigns and experiences for creators and brand partners.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>KEY RESPONSIBILITIES:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Social Media Marketing &amp; Content Creation<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Manage day-to-day content planning for Society 18's Instagram and LinkedIn channels.<\/li><li>Develop monthly content calendars aligned with agency campaigns, partnerships, creator announcements, and events.<\/li><li>Write engaging social media copy, captions, and assist with music selection for short-form content.<\/li><li>Design graphics in Canva, including creator announcements, milestone graphics, birthday posts, event promotions, partnership assets, and press announcements.<\/li><li>Film and edit Instagram Reels, creator spotlights, event recap videos, and partnership content using CapCut.<\/li><li>Maintain Instagram feed planning and overall visual consistency.<\/li><li>Schedule and publish content across social media platforms.<\/li><li>Publish Instagram Stories daily.<\/li><li>Engage with creators, brand partners, and community members through comments and direct messages.<\/li><li>Maintain creator posting trackers to ensure balanced representation across agency channels.<\/li><li>Develop quarterly newsletters and email marketing campaigns in Flodesk.<\/li><li>Create LinkedIn content highlighting agency partnerships, company milestones, leadership updates, and industry news.<\/li><li>Build and maintain creator pages on the Society 18 website.<\/li><li>Update creator biographies, follower counts, categories, and roster information as needed.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Event Production &amp; Experiential Marketing<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Assist with planning and executing creator dinners, networking mixers, brand activations, gifting experiences, industry events, and experiential campaigns from concept through post-event reporting.<\/li><li>Develop and maintain event production documents, including run-of-show schedules, timelines, itineraries, outreach trackers, and production checklists.<\/li><li>Research, source, and coordinate event venues, restaurants, and vendor partners.<\/li><li>Build and maintain agency venues and preferred vendor databases.<\/li><li>Coordinate pricing, proposals, availability, contracts, and logistics with vendors.<\/li><li>Support sponsorship outreach and assist in preparing partnership proposals and presentations.<\/li><li>Manage creator invitations, RSVPs, guest lists, and attendee communications using CreatorIQ, Partiful, Airtable, and Google Sheets.<\/li><li>Coordinate gifting logistics, product shipments, and vendor deliveries for events.<\/li><li>Prepare Independent Contractor Agreements (ICAs), NDAs, vendor agreements, and supporting documentation.<\/li><li>Organize event assets, contracts, invoices, presentations, production documents, and creative files in Dropbox.<\/li><li>Provide on-site event support, including setup, vendor management, guest check-in, production coordination, and event breakdown.<\/li><li>Capture behind-the-scenes photo and video content for real-time social media coverage.<\/li><li>Create post-event recap presentations in Canva and track creator coverage using Archive.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Influencer Marketing &amp; Brand Partnerships<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Pitch creators for brand activations, networking events, creator trips, fashion weeks, festivals, and industry experiences, including ESSENCE Festival, New York Fashion Week, Coachella, and other cultural moments.<\/li><li>Support creator onboarding by updating internal databases, website profiles, onboarding materials, and social media assets.<\/li><li>Assist with proactive creator pitching for paid brand partnerships.<\/li><li>Support talent scouting initiatives and maintain the agency's talent scouting database.<\/li><li>Research new creators, emerging trends, and partnership opportunities.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Executive &amp; Administrative Operations<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Coordinate meetings, calendars, and scheduling with creators, brands, vendors, and internal team members.<\/li><li>Prepare meeting agendas, capture notes, and distribute follow-up action items.<\/li><li>Maintain internal databases, presentations, production trackers, reporting dashboards, and operational documents.<\/li><li>Research and source brand contacts across beauty, fashion, travel, hospitality, wellness, food &amp; beverage, and lifestyle industries using Apollo, Airtable, LinkedIn, and additional research tools.<\/li><li>Support day-to-day agency operations and assist with special projects as assigned.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>QUALIFICATIONS:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li>Bachelor's degree in Marketing, Communications, Public Relations, Event Management, Business, or a related field (or equivalent experience).<\/li><li>1\u00e2\u0080\u00933 years of experience in influencer marketing, social media, events, talent management, PR, or a related field.<\/li><li>Exceptional organizational skills with strong attention to detail.<\/li><li>Excellent written and verbal communication skills.<\/li><li>Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.<\/li><li>Strong creative eye for branding, design, and social content.<\/li><li>Comfortable working both independently and collaboratively.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>WHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>The ideal candidate is creative, resourceful, highly organized, and excited to help build meaningful experiences for creators and brand partners. They enjoy bringing ideas to life, solving problems, collaborating across teams, and staying on top of emerging social and cultural trends. They are equally comfortable planning an event, editing a Reel, coordinating logistics, mentoring interns, or supporting creator partnerships\u00e2\u0080\u0094always with a positive attitude and strong attention to detail.<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CUTENESS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Los Angeles Metropolitan Area","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-associate-events-social-amp-influencer-marketing-society-18-1135695","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-associate-events-social-amp-influencer-marketing-society-18-1135695"},{"slug":"remote-data-analyst-sparksoft-corporation-1135698","id":"1135698","epoch":1785429079,"date":"2026-07-30T16:31:19+00:00","company":"Sparksoft Corporation","company_logo":"","position":"Data Analyst","tags":["design","music","customer support","travel","video","exec","content writing","ops","marketing","ads","digital nomad","hr","dev","consulting","technical","testing","payroll","education","virtual assistant","sales","medical","full time","analyst","infosec","python","java","scala","data science","excel","stats"],"description":"Join us at Sparksoft, where we're not just another tech company\u00e2\u0080\u0094we're a catalyst for change. Our mission isn't just to offer IT solutions; it's to revolutionize the way you work. Here, passion isn't just a buzzword; it's the fuel behind groundbreaking ideas and transformative technologies. We serve a wide range of government clients, delivering impact that's felt across the nation.<br><br>Our true strength lies in our people. They're the problem-solvers and innovators consistently delivering extraordinary outcomes. With Sparksoft, you're not stepping into a routine job; you're joining a team committed to innovation and excellence. Our innovation extends beyond just delivering projects. Through our specialized Innovation Centers, we continuously refine our methods, ensuring we remain industry leaders.<br><br>We are Sparksoft!<br><br><strong>ROLE &amp; RESPONSIBILITIES: <br><br><\/strong>The Data Analyst will be part of a team supporting all phases of the design, development and implementation of a program supporting CMS. Will participate in design sessions, report on project progress, and identify potential risks and issues. The Data Analyst will also be responsible for providing technical direction and guidance to support the data warehouse application process for multiple stakeholders and continuous process improvement in managing and processing data efficiently. Responsible for analyzing and interpreting complex data sets and queries to assist in decision-making. The analyst will have experience with data validation to support regular and ad hoc data requests.<br><br><ul><li>Assists users in analyzing and interpreting complex data sets and queries to assist in decision-making<\/li><li>Evaluates data anomalies to ensure data quality<\/li><li>Performs ad hoc data analysis for predictive analytics and fraud analytics using machine learning <\/li><li>Provides guidance for Development and O&amp;M database engineers<\/li><li>Experience with big data platform and building data-driven applications using Scala, Python and Java <\/li><li>Supports the program in the collection, validation, and reporting of metrics<\/li><li>Provide data collection, verification, and analysis for reporting<\/li><li>Analyze, evaluate, and recommend processes to best support customer programs<\/li><li>Advanced Excel expertise required including use of pivot tables, formulas, conditional formatting, etc.<\/li><li>Review and understand artifacts related to data ingestion and transformation as it applies to data validation and analysis<\/li><li>Provide quality assurance support using tools like Excel, SharePoint, Power BI, and Tableau<\/li><li>Streamlines internal processes focusing on organization support using tools like Excel, SharePoint, Power BI, and Tableau<\/li><li>Performs ad hoc data analysis to support programmatic questions and stakeholder requests<\/li><li>Works as part of a project team to determine project requirements, goals, implementation, and schedules<\/li><li>May provide training for internal users and customer stakeholders<\/li><li>Knowledge and experience with healthcare IT<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>REQUIRED EXPERIENCE: <br><br><\/strong><ul><li>5-8 years of experience in the development and implementation of large, complex, data-centric systems<\/li><li>3 years of experience using data management and visualization tools such as SQL, Tableau, Qlik, R, Python, SAS Viya, or Power BI<\/li><li>Must have ability to define and document testing criteria and scenarios<\/li><li>Must have analytical skills to compare and reconcile the expected versus real test results<\/li><li>Must be able to effectively communicate with technical teams<\/li><li>Excellent communication, problem solving, and customer service skills<\/li><li>Candidates must be able to obtain and maintain a Public Trust clearance. <\/li><li>Candidates must have lived in the United States 3 out of the past 5 years. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>PREFERRED EXPERIENCE:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Assess\/evaluate to deliver timely data analysis, and data solutions against client requirements<\/li><li>Ensure customer satisfaction through follow-up, client responsiveness, and thorough communication<\/li><li>Ability to manage multiple clients and projects\/tasks simultaneously<\/li><li>Experience with CMS preferred.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>EDUCATION &amp; CERTIFICATIONS:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Bachelor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s degree<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>WHAT WE OFFER: <br><br><\/strong>At Sparksoft, we know that people do their best work when they feel supported, inspired, and connected. That\u00e2\u0080\u0099s why we\u00e2\u0080\u0099ve built a workplace that balances comprehensive benefits with a culture of collaboration and innovation. From flexible time off to professional growth opportunities, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re committed to helping you thrive both inside and outside of work. When you join Sparksoft, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll enjoy:<br><br><ul><li>Competitive compensation and a 401(k) with employer contributions to help you plan for the future<\/li><li>Flexible paid time off and hybrid ways of working that support true work-life balance<\/li><li>Comprehensive health coverage\u00e2\u0080\u0094including medical, dental, vision, life, and disability insurance<\/li><li>A curated in-office experience designed to foster community, team connections, and innovation<\/li><li>Opportunities to give back through Sparksoft Cares, including annual company-wide fundraising events<\/li><li>Training and development programs that build new skills and prepare you for leadership roles<\/li><li>A collaborative, transparent, and fun culture\u00e2\u0080\u0094recognized as a Great Place to Work\u00c2\u00ae<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Accessibility and Accommodations:<\/strong> Sparksoft Corporation is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. If you require accommodations during the application or interview process, please contact us at Sparksoft.Accommodations@sparksoftcorp.com or call 410-424-7700. Requests are reviewed and fulfilled on a case-by-case basis.<br><br><strong>Security Notice: <\/strong>Your privacy and data security are important to us. Sparksoft Corporation will never request sensitive personal information via email. If you receive any suspicious communication claiming to be from Sparksoft, please report it immediately to our security team at abuse@sparksoftcorp.com.<br><br><strong>Artificial Intelligence (AI) Policy:<\/strong> While Sparksoft recognizes the value of artificial intelligence in the workplace, our hiring process is designed to assess each candidate\u00e2\u0080\u0099s individual skills, judgment, and problem-solving abilities. To maintain the integrity of this process, the use of AI tools at any stage of the application or interview is strictly prohibited. Violations of this policy may result in disqualification from consideration.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BECKONS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Columbia, Columbia, Maryland, United States","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-data-analyst-sparksoft-corporation-1135698","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-data-analyst-sparksoft-corporation-1135698"},{"slug":"remote-lead-generator-representaciones-del-caribe-1135815","id":"1135815","epoch":1785428260,"date":"2026-07-30T16:17:40+00:00","company":"Representaciones del caribe","company_logo":"","position":"lead Generator","tags":["exec","customer support","legal","accounting","sys admin","finance","microsoft","ops","excel","product manager","music","game dev","technical","dev","marketing","devops","engineer","digital nomad","supervisor","c","speech","video","seo","content writing","design","education","golang","testing","admin","full time","full stack","architecture","cloud","backend"],"description":"<p><strong>Descripci\u00c3\u00b3n de la empresa<\/strong> <strong>Representaciones del Caribe<\/strong> es una empresa especializada en convertir la intenci\u00c3\u00b3n de expansi\u00c3\u00b3n de marcas globales en una presencia real en el mercado del Caribe. Nos enfocamos en marcas internacionales de footwear, outdoor y lifestyle, ofreciendo una operaci\u00c3\u00b3n integrada con m\u00c3\u00a1s de 15 marcas en distribuci\u00c3\u00b3n contractual. Gestionamos la infraestructura comercial, log\u00c3\u00adstica y de activaci\u00c3\u00b3n en retail que a una marca le llevar\u00c3\u00ada a\u00c3\u00b1os construir por su cuenta. Contamos con log\u00c3\u00adstica multi-hub y almacenamiento estrat\u00c3\u00a9gico en Panam\u00c3\u00a1, y Rep\u00c3\u00bablica Dominicana, lo que permite un servicio \u00c3\u00a1gil y consistente. Trabajamos con responsables de expansi\u00c3\u00b3n regional y due\u00c3\u00b1os de marca que buscan crecer en el Caribe sin tener que montar una operaci\u00c3\u00b3n local desde cero.<\/p><p><strong>Descripci\u00c3\u00b3n del puesto<\/strong> En el puesto de Lead Generator en Representaciones del Caribe, te encargar\u00c3\u00a1s de identificar y calificar oportunidades de negocio para nuestras marcas en el mercado del Internacional. En tu d\u00c3\u00ada a d\u00c3\u00ada, contactar\u00c3\u00a1s potenciales clientes B2B, recopilar\u00c3\u00a1s informaci\u00c3\u00b3n clave sobre sus necesidades y registrar\u00c3\u00a1s todos los datos en las herramientas internas de CRM. Tambi\u00c3\u00a9n colaborar\u00c3\u00a1s con el equipo comercial para agendar reuniones, dar seguimiento a leads generados en campa\u00c3\u00b1as y apoyar en la preparaci\u00c3\u00b3n de propuestas. Este es un puesto a tiempo completo, presencial y ubicado en Punta Cana, donde trabajar\u00c3\u00a1s en estrecha colaboraci\u00c3\u00b3n con equipos de ventas, marketing y log\u00c3\u00adstica.<\/p><p><strong>Requisitos<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Aptitudes en prospecci\u00c3\u00b3n comercial, generaci\u00c3\u00b3n de leads y manejo de bases de datos de clientes.<\/li><li>Dominio total del Ingles, oral y escrito.<\/li><li>&lt; Experiencia en uso de herramientas CRM, gesti\u00c3\u00b3n pipeline ventas y seguimiento oportunidades.<\/li><li>Capacidad de comunicaci\u00c3\u00b3n oral y escrita clara, orientaci\u00c3\u00b3n a resultados y habilidades de negociaci\u00c3\u00b3n b\u00c3\u00a1sicas.<\/li><li>Nivel alto de organizaci\u00c3\u00b3n, atenci\u00c3\u00b3n al detalle y manejo eficiente del tiempo en entornos din\u00c3\u00a1micos.<\/li><li>Valorable experiencia previa en sectores retail, footwear, outdoor o lifestyle, as\u00c3\u00ad como conocimiento de mercados del Caribe.<\/li><li>Formaci\u00c3\u00b3n relacionada con comercio, marketing, administraci\u00c3\u00b3n de empresas o campos afines.<\/li><li>Manejo fluido de herramientas ofim\u00c3\u00a1ticas.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **IRREPROACHABLE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Punta Cana, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-lead-generator-representaciones-del-caribe-1135815","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-lead-generator-representaciones-del-caribe-1135815"},{"slug":"remote-growth-strategist-lyric-1135681","id":"1135681","epoch":1785427220,"date":"2026-07-30T16:00:20+00:00","company":"Lyric","company_logo":"","position":"Growth Strategist","tags":["marketing","design","embedded","technical","strategy","customer support","dev","travel","finance","exec","content writing","senior","ops","sales","golang","digital nomad"],"description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong><u>About the Company<\/u><\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Why We Built Lyric:<\/strong> Supply chains are more critical and complex than ever. Every day, large enterprises navigate trillions of possible decisions that could impact the bottom line. Powerful algorithms and AI can address these problems, yet most organizations struggle to leverage supply chain AI at scale. The current SCM technologies are either rigid, limited-scope point solutions or custom solutions built in-house, which demand immense expertise and investment.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">That is\u00e2\u0080\u00a6until now.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Enter Lyric<\/strong>: Lyric is an enterprise AI platform built specifically for supply chains, offering the best of both worlds:<\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Out-of-the-box AI solutions<\/strong> for optimizing networks, allocating inventory, scheduling routes, planning fulfillment capacity, promising orders, propagating demand, building predictions, analyzing scenarios, and more, <em><strong>plus<\/strong><\/em><\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>A platform-first approach<\/strong> that empowers both business and technical users with end-to-end product composability, leveraging no-code tools, their own code, or even forking our code to build and refine supply chain decision intelligence<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">With Lyric, enterprises no longer have to choose between flexibility and speed, they get both.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>The Mission:<\/strong> We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re building a new era in supply chain with the team best equipped to lead it. With over 20 years at the intersection of supply chain and algorithms, we developed a deep conviction that global supply chains needed something like Lyric. Since our inception in December 2021, that conviction has been validated time and time again.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Today, a growing number of Fortune 500 companies, including Smurfit WestRock, Est\u00c3\u00a9e Lauder, Coca-Cola, and more, are innovating on their own terms with Lyric. We can\u00e2\u0080\u0099t wait to see what our customers, both current and future, are empowered to build with us next. Come build with us!<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re hiring Growth Strategists: high-agency, client-facing professionals who will be the tip of the spear for Lyric\u00e2\u0080\u0099s go-to-market approach. This is not a traditional business development role. You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be embedded with senior sales leaders and cross-functional teams, opening new accounts while building real expertise in the enterprise GTM motion.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This role is designed for driven early-career professionals or post-MBA candidates looking to break into a high-growth startup. You don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t need enterprise AI or supply chain experience, just the curiosity and work ethic to learn it fast.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00c2\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>What You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Do<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Identify, research, and develop new account opportunities across target verticals<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct outbound prospecting through multi-channel campaigns (email, phone, LinkedIn, events)<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Shadow senior AEs and GTM leaders on client meetings and demos to build domain fluency and selling skills<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Help prepare demo environments, RFP responses, and opportunity materials for active deals<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Join opportunity teams to support key pursuit strategy and client engagement<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to broader GTM activities: market research, competitive intelligence, event support, and content collaboration<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Develop a point of view on target accounts and industries that sharpens the team\u00e2\u0080\u0099s overall strategy<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Who You Are<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Early career (2+ years of professional experience) or post-MBA candidate looking to pivot into enterprise AI technology<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Exceptional communicator; polished, articulate, and comfortable in client-facing settings<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">High agency: you take ownership, follow through, and don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t wait to be told what to do<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Intellectually curious with a hunger to learn about supply chain, technology, and enterprise sales<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong researcher; you can quickly synthesize complex information and present it clearly<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Resourceful with tools and technology. You're the kind of person who finds the right shortcut or AI-powered workflow to 10x your output before anyone asks you to<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Collaborative and team-oriented; comfortable in a fast-moving, ambiguous environment<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00c2\u00a0<\/div><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Why This Role<\/strong><\/p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Career path into AE, pre-sales, solution design, revenue operations, or other GTM roles<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Direct mentorship from experienced Revenue leadership, VPs of Sales, and AEs. You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll learn by doing alongside the best<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">You'll be helping define a new category, enterprise AI for supply chain, at a company where the playbook is still being written but the customer base already includes some of the largest, most complex enterprises in the world.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Join at a pivotal stage where your contributions are visible, and your growth trajectory is steep<\/p><\/li><\/ul><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00c2\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>Even if you don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t meet 100% of the qualifications, we recommend applying to the role!<\/em><\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00c2\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location:<\/strong> Remote - Spain, Italy, Portugal. Some travel required.<\/p><div style=\"min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">\u00c2\u00a0<\/div><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Compensation:<\/strong> We provide a competitive mix of salary, commissions, local benefits, and equity, designed to reward both your impact and growth. <\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SURVIVAL** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-growth-strategist-lyric-1135681","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-growth-strategist-lyric-1135681"},{"slug":"remote-ai-trainer-freelance-data-annotator-mindrift-data-annotation-1135680","id":"1135680","epoch":1785427214,"date":"2026-07-30T16:00:14+00:00","company":"Mindrift - Data annotation","company_logo":"","position":"AI Trainer Freelance Data Annotator","tags":["education","data annotation","content writing","part time","non tech"],"description":"<p>Please submit your resume in English and indicate your level of English.<br \/><br \/>At Toloka, we connect smart, curious people from around the world with freelance online tasks that train and improve artificial intelligence. <\/p><p>What we do<\/p><p>The Toloka Annotators connects individuals with Generative AI projects from leading tech innovators. Our mission is to unlock the full potential of AI by involving real people from around the world in the development process.<\/p><p>About the Role<\/p><p>Annotation is what helps AI make sense of the world. As an annotator, you may be invited to take part in\u00c2\u00a0online projects such as rating AI-generated content, evaluating factual accuracy, or comparing responses - when projects are available. <\/p><p>Responsibilities: <\/p><ul><li>Carefully review provided data (text, images, or videos) <\/li><li>Label or classify content based on project guidelines <\/li><li>Identify and flag factually incorrect, sensitive, inappropriate, or unclear material <\/li><\/ul><p>Important note: This is project-based work. Tasks are available\u00c2\u00a0only when projects are active. You may be invited to one or more projects depending on your profile and current opportunities.<\/p><p>Each project has its own compensation level based on scope and expertise required. On this project, AI trainers earn up to $17 per hour equivalent.<\/p>\n<ul><li>Bachelor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s degree in any discipline<\/li><li>Minimum 1 year of experience in any professional role<\/li><li>Advanced level of English (C1 or higher), both written and spoken<\/li><li>Logical thinking, fact-checking and reasoning abilities <\/li><li>Strong attention to detail and ability to understand and follow complex instructions <\/li><li>Strong communication skills, including the ability to ask clarifying questions when needed <\/li><li>Genuine interest in technology and artificial intelligence<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>Why this freelance opportunity might be a great fit for you? <\/p><ul><li>Take part in a part-time, remote, freelance project that fits around your primary professional or academic commitments.<\/li><li>Work on advanced AI projects and gain valuable experience that enhances your portfolio.<\/li><li>Influence how future AI models understand and communicate in your field of expertise.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ATTRACTIVE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ai-trainer-freelance-data-annotator-mindrift-data-annotation-1135680","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ai-trainer-freelance-data-annotator-mindrift-data-annotation-1135680"},{"slug":"remote-administrative-assistant-viable-medical-solutions-1135697","id":"1135697","epoch":1785427166,"date":"2026-07-30T15:59:26+00:00","company":"Viable Medical Solutions","company_logo":"","position":"Administrative Assistant","tags":["design","music","customer support","travel","video","exec","content writing","ops","marketing","ads","digital nomad","hr","dev","consulting","technical","testing","payroll","education","virtual assistant","sales","medical","full time"],"description":"<p><strong>Company Description<\/strong> Viable Medical Solutions is an independent medical device sales organization specializing in Orthopedic, Sports Medicine, and Post-Operative Orthopedic solutions across Florida. The company focuses on bringing innovative and cost-effective medical products to market for healthcare providers. Its solutions are designed to support higher patient satisfaction, better clinical outcomes, and an improved overall care experience. Team members contribute to advancing medical technologies that positively impact patients and healthcare professionals throughout the region.<\/p><p><strong>Role Description<\/strong> The Administrative Assistant role is a full-time, remote position providing administrative support to ensure efficient daily operations. Responsibilities include managing calendars, scheduling meetings, organizing files, and handling clerical tasks such as data entry, document preparation, and record maintenance. The role involves answering and directing phone calls, responding to emails, and supporting executive leadership with administrative needs. The Administrative Assistant will also coordinate communication between internal teams, assist with preparation of reports, and maintain accurate documentation to support the company\u00e2\u0080\u0099s sales and service activities.<\/p><p><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><p> <\/p><ul><li>Candidates should possess strong Administrative Assistance and Clerical Skills, including organizing documents, managing schedules, and handling data entry.<\/li><li>Candidates should possess excellent Phone Etiquette and Communication skills, including professional telephone handling and clear written and verbal communication.<\/li><li>Candidates should possess Executive Administrative Assistance capabilities, such as supporting leadership with meeting coordination, travel arrangements, and confidential information management.<\/li><li>Candidates should possess proficiency with office software (e.g., word processing, spreadsheets, email, and calendar tools) and basic database or CRM usage.<\/li><li>Candidates should possess strong attention to detail, time management, and the ability to prioritize tasks in a remote work environment.<\/li><li>Relevant experience in healthcare, medical device, or sales support settings is beneficial.<\/li><li>A high school diploma or equivalent is required; additional education in business administration or a related field is a plus.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CONVENIENTLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Greater Orlando","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-administrative-assistant-viable-medical-solutions-1135697","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-administrative-assistant-viable-medical-solutions-1135697"},{"slug":"remote-spontaneous-application-staffbase-1135907","id":"1135907","epoch":1785425649,"date":"2026-07-30T15:34:09+00:00","company":"Staffbase","company_logo":"","position":"Spontaneous Application","tags":["full time","marketing","non tech"],"description":"<strong>About Staffbase<br><br><\/strong>We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first <strong>AI-native Employee Experience Platform<\/strong>. Our<strong> industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels<\/strong> - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.<br><br>Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis\u00e2\u0080\u0093St.\u00e2\u0080\u00afPaul, our diverse team of 750+ employees supports 2,000+ customers\u00e2\u0080\u0094reaching over 16.4 million employees\u00e2\u0080\u0094in transforming their employee experience.<br><br>We are proud to be a <strong>Unicorn<\/strong> company\u00e2\u0080\u0094privately valued at over $1 billion\u00e2\u0080\u0094demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we're shaping the future of workplace communication.<br><br><strong>About Staffbase<br><br><\/strong>We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first <strong>AI-native Employee Experience Platform<\/strong>. Our<strong> industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels<\/strong> \u00e2\u0080\u0093 intranet, employee app and email solutions \u00e2\u0080\u0093 create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.<br><br>Headquartered in <strong>Chemnitz<\/strong>, Germany and <strong>New York City<\/strong>, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, and Minneapolis\u00e2\u0080\u0093St.\u00e2\u0080\u00afPaul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 2,000+ customers \u00e2\u0080\u0093 reaching over 16.4 million employees \u00e2\u0080\u0093 in transforming their employee experience.<br><br>We are proud to be a <strong>Unicorn<\/strong> company \u00e2\u0080\u0093 privately valued at over $1 billion \u00e2\u0080\u0093 demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry.<br><br>Together, we're shaping the future of workplace communication.<br><br>You can't find the right fit for you?<br><br>No worries! We love a good general application. Share your CV with us and tell us what you're looking for and what you'll bring to Staffbase.<br><br><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ECSTATICALLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"New York, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-spontaneous-application-staffbase-1135907","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-spontaneous-application-staffbase-1135907"},{"slug":"remote-mes-padget-electronics-private-limited-dixon-1135730","id":"1135730","epoch":1785424333,"date":"2026-07-30T15:12:13+00:00","company":"PADGET ELECTRONICS Private Limited (DIXON)","company_logo":"","position":"Mes","tags":["technical","full time","controller"],"description":"mes<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **RIGHTEOUS** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Noida, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-mes-padget-electronics-private-limited-dixon-1135730","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-mes-padget-electronics-private-limited-dixon-1135730"},{"slug":"remote-lot-attendant-clutch-1135842","id":"1135842","epoch":1785423139,"date":"2026-07-30T14:52:19+00:00","company":"Clutch","company_logo":"","position":"Lot Attendant","tags":["game dev","customer support","marketing","medical","full time","non tech"],"description":"<strong>About Clutch<br><br><\/strong>We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re on a mission to reinvent the way people buy, sell, and own cars. Are you game?<br><br>Clutch is Canada\u00e2\u0080\u0099s largest online used car retailer, delivering a seamless, hassle-free car-buying experience to drivers everywhere. Customers can browse hundreds of cars from the comfort of their home, get the right one delivered to their door, and enjoy peace of mind with our 10-Day Money-Back Guarantee\u00e2\u0080\u00a6 and that\u00e2\u0080\u0099s just the beginning.<br><br>Named five years in a row to the Globe &amp; Mail\u00e2\u0080\u0099s list of the Top Growing Companies in Canada and also awarded spots on Deloitte\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Technology Fast 50\u00e2\u0084\u00a2 and Fast 500\u00e2\u0084\u00a2 lists, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking to add curious, hard-working, and driven individuals to our growing team.<br><br>Headquartered in Toronto, Clutch was founded in 2017 and currently services Ontario, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, British Columbia, and Prince Edward Island. Clutch is backed by a number of world-class investors, including D1 Capital, Canaan, Real Ventures, BrandProject, and Upper90. To learn more, visit clutch.ca.<br><br><strong>What You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Do<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Vehicle Detailing: Clean, detail, and prepare vehicles so they are showroom-ready for resale.<\/li><li>Lot Organization: Maintain a clean, safe, and organized vehicle lot.<\/li><li>Vehicle Shuttling: Safely transport vehicles between Clutch pop-up locations and reconditioning partners.<\/li><li>Team Support: Assist with inspections, shop tasks, and keeping workspaces clean and efficient.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re Looking For<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Positive attitude with a strong work ethic<\/li><li>Confident and outgoing personality with a willingness to learn and improve<\/li><li>Team player who is willing to take on additional responsibilities when needed<\/li><li>High school diploma or equivalent<\/li><li>Valid British Columbia driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license with a clean driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s abstract<\/li><li>Comfortable driving manual transmission vehicles<\/li><li>Reliable transportation to and from work<\/li><li>Ability to work on-site at 210 12th Street, New Westminster<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Why You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Love Working at Clutch<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Autonomy &amp; ownership \u00e2\u0080\u0093 opportunity to build your process and influence the company workforce and at every level.<\/li><li>Help shape the future of car buying and selling in Canada by leading a critical part of our customer experience.<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll have a broad and direct ownership over [Field of work] during a phase of rapid growth.<\/li><li>We are dedicated to attracting and retaining top talent with top-of-market compensation packages.<\/li><li>Above market health &amp; dental benefits.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Employment Type<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>New, Full-Time<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Compensation &amp; Benefits<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Salary range: $20\/hour<\/li><li>Benefits: Comprehensive benefits plans include healthcare, dental care, vision care, prescriptions, life insurance and dependent coverage; start from day 1. <\/li><li>Pay decisions reflect objective criteria: skills, performance, market benchmarking, responsibilities and working conditions.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Clutch is committed to fostering an inclusive workplace where all individuals have an opportunity to succeed. If you require accommodation at any stage of the interview process, please email talent@clutch.ca<em>.<\/em><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PRUDENCE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"New Westminster, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-lot-attendant-clutch-1135842","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-lot-attendant-clutch-1135842"},{"slug":"remote-a-book-of-your-own-techwhirl-1135683","id":"1135683","epoch":1785421186,"date":"2026-07-30T14:19:46+00:00","company":"TechWhirl","company_logo":"","position":"A Book of Your Own","tags":["education","analyst","finance","content writing","excel","golang","non tech","consulting","technical","writer","testing"],"description":"<em><strong>Editor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Note:<\/strong> The following piece, by the late, great Herman Holtz, was to appear as part of Herman\u00e2\u0080\u0099s \u00e2\u0080\u009cHindsights &amp; Insights\u00e2\u0080\u009d column. It is <\/em><em>part of our collection of \u00e2\u0080\u009cclassics\u00e2\u0080\u009d\u00e2\u0080\u0093articles that stand the test of time no matter how many technologies come and go.<\/em> <em>Published with permission.<br><br><\/em>It seems, from what I read every day on the TECHWR-L list, that it isn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t at all easy for most people to break into a beginning tech writing job. Of course, that kind of Catch 22\u00e2\u0080\u0093you need a job to get the experience you need to qualify for the job\u00e2\u0080\u0093is far from unknown, especially in the high-tech working world. It\u00e2\u0080\u0099s why prospective employers want to see clips and other evidence that you can write reasonably well, whether it is technical or not, before they will consider you.<br><br>I was a tech writer long before I wrote my first book, although I had to jump through some difficult hoops to land my first tech writing job (a series of six tests on technology); however, a great deal of my work later, especially my consulting jobs, came about as a result of my books and the reputation they bestowed on me. Being published between covers brings you respect almost as quickly and surely as becoming known as a millionaire business owner does. Even now, it happens. A reader who owns a small business in Baltimore hired me recently to do some consulting with him, after reading one of my books published a few years ago. The gentleman had read several books on the subject of proposal writing and contracting, and he decided that my book reflected the kind of thinking he needed, although it was one of my most slender volumes.<br><br>It is really not that difficult to turn out your first book if you select a subject that you are reasonably familiar with (and so can research efficiently) and plan ahead with a solid and well-thought-out outline. Remember that what you write does not have to be a thick tome. My books have generally run to about 275 to 500 pages, but I have also written my share of books that printed out to fewer than 200 pages.<br><br>There Are Many Ways To Get Ideas For Books, And The More You Concentrate On The Need, The More New Ideas You Will Get. Here Are Just a Few Tips<br><br><strong>Start reading the periodicals that deal with the subject<\/strong> Probably they will be trade journals and may touch only lightly on the subject, but that is fine. But, how much is there to say about the subject? Is it useful detail\u00e2\u0080\u0093that is, does a lightly-covered detail justify a book of its own? The book of mine I referred to here is a small book that presents sharply-focused abstracts on what I think to be the most important topics about proposal writing\u00e2\u0080\u0093a subject on which I have written more than one large, detailed book. The little book referred to here is virtually the opposite of expanding an article or two into a book.<br><br><strong>Browse libraries and book stores for current books on the subject<\/strong> Would you go about writing a book on the subject entirely differently? Would it be a better book? How? Why? Read books that devote a chapter to the subject. How about developing that chapter into a full book of its own?<br><br><strong>Think about what that information might mean to readers and to which readers<\/strong> Will it help someone start or improve their business? Improve their position in some way? Make it easier to learn a given subject?<br><br><strong>Think about the need for the information<\/strong> Is the subject a very popular one? Is it on how to be a better golfer, for example? Hard to lose with any good book on golf. The same for many other subjects. There is never an end to new books about the Civil War, even if you call it The War Between the States. But if you want your first book (I hope that it will be only your first) to help your business career, it is best to choose a serious business subject or other how-to book.<br><br>Finally, remember that you don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t have to write the book in a day. Do a few pages each day, and you will be surprised at how soon you have a book.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LIKE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Four Paths, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-a-book-of-your-own-techwhirl-1135683","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-a-book-of-your-own-techwhirl-1135683"},{"slug":"remote-this-is-your-dream-job-techwhirl-1135682","id":"1135682","epoch":1785421156,"date":"2026-07-30T14:19:16+00:00","company":"TechWhirl","company_logo":"","position":"This IS Your Dream Job","tags":["education","analyst","finance","content writing","excel","golang","non tech"],"description":"Here are two questions to ask yourself: 1) when are you most content? (Not \u00e2\u0080\u0098happy\u00e2\u0080\u0099 per se, since happy moments are fleeting. 2) Does contentment ever happen for you during the workday?<br><br>The average American worker spends 2080 hours per year on paid work. Over 30 years, that adds up to 62,400 hours. That\u00e2\u0080\u0099s a LOT of time to spend doing something you don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t like doing.<br><br>Research also shows that people will change careers at least 7 times during their lifetime. However, career changes aren\u00e2\u0080\u0099t always drastic \u00e2\u0080\u0093 you can change the focus of your daily work activity without changing jobs. Sometimes incremental shifts\u00e2\u0080\u0094small changes in what you do and how you do it\u00e2\u0080\u0094are the best and most satisfying way to land that dream job<br><br>The key is to concentrate on ways to shift paid job duties into activities that give you that feeling of contentment.<br><br>Grab a Sheet Of Paper And a Pencil\u00e2\u0080\u0094or Open Up Your Favorite Word Processor And Work Through The Following Steps To Come Up With Your Own Action Plan To Realize Your Dream Job<br><br>STEP 1: Think about your current job \u00e2\u0080\u0093 make a list of the tasks that comprise your job. Highlight the ones you most enjoy performing in your job. Note the ones you can\u00e2\u0080\u0099t stand<br><br>STEP 2: Make a list of activities you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ve done in the past that you are most proud of, and that you got the most satisfaction from. These can come from previous jobs, volunteer activities, school work, or hobbies. If you loved laying out the college newspaper, but hated the organizational aspects such as chasing people down to get their content in on time, then that tells you something about the types of activities that work for you.<br><br>STEP 3: Envision your ideal job \u00e2\u0080\u0093 and list the tasks that it would encompass. What basic skills involved in your ideal job could start working on today? This could be something simple \u00e2\u0080\u0093 if your ideal job is to be in charge of all written communication for your organization, an area you could start working on immediately is your writing skills. Even if your current writing skills are pretty good, there is always room to work towards a higher level of achievement.<br><br>STEP 4: Now take the list of tasks and activities from steps 1 &amp; 2 above, along with the list of skills from step 3, and group them into functions related to your job that you could concentrate on. (For example, if you are a financial analyst, but you find the grind of financial reports tedious, but you love creating charts and graphs and putting together presentations that visually demonstrate trends \u00e2\u0080\u0093 your tasks and activities list could include \u00e2\u0080\u0098creating graphs &amp; charts\u00e2\u0080\u0099, and one skill that could be on your list is \u00e2\u0080\u0098<em>Enhance MS Excel charting &amp; graphing skills\u00e2\u0080\u0099<\/em>.<br><br>STEP 5: Conduct some research into the training available out there that would help you to enhance the skills you outlined in step 3. This could involve a number of options \u00e2\u0080\u0093 anything from volunteering with an organization in a capacity where you could practice your skills, to taking webinars, intensive workshops, certificate programs, or working toward a degree.<br><br>STEP 6: Using the information you gathered in step 5 above, get started with the training program(s) that will meet your individual needs. Remember that you can start small and fine-tune your training plan as you go along. You can also mix and match various training components \u00e2\u0080\u0093 it doesn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t have to be a straight path, as long as it gets you to where you want to go. Get involved with online forums and interest groups that will help you learn more about the latest techniques in your area of interest. As you spend more time learning and practicing, your skills will improve.<br><br>Never underestimate the value of volunteering without asking for additional compensation\u00e2\u0080\u00a6your boss and superiors will be impressed that you are interested enough to take on a project without asking for something in return. Showcase your best efforts by volunteering to work on projects that will give you a chance to demonstrate your expertise.<br><br>Land Mines to Avoid<br><br>Being your own worst enemy \u00e2\u0080\u0093 downplaying your talents won\u00e2\u0080\u0099t get you noticed or into consideration for that great new project. Toot your own horn and let others know that you are good at xyz (in the example above, creating charts and graphs). Just as important, offer to help others with that task \u00e2\u0080\u0093 soon you will become the resident expert, the one that others turn to for help and advice on this topic<br><br>Being finished with learning \u00e2\u0080\u0093 remember learning doesn\u00e2\u0080\u0099t stop because you have that framed diploma. Keep taking courses, attending seminars and staying in touch with others in your field so that you stay at the leading edge of knowledge and practice in your area of interest<br><br>Getting stuck in a rut \u00e2\u0080\u0093 Sometimes it seems easier to lay low and just plod along. But you can\u00e2\u0080\u0099t stay still \u00e2\u0080\u0093 keep looking for new opportunities to apply your talents and showcase them in new and interesting ways.<br><br>Decide what you like (and what you don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t), do your homework, work hard at new opportunities and advertise the results\u00e2\u0080\u0094before you know it, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be living your dream job.<br><br><em>Contributor: Julie Clarke, Vancouver Island University (www.pr.viu.ca\/techcomm)<\/em><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **OVERTURE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Four Paths, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-this-is-your-dream-job-techwhirl-1135682","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-this-is-your-dream-job-techwhirl-1135682"},{"slug":"remote-next-steps-corporate-travel-specialists-1135724","id":"1135724","epoch":1785420286,"date":"2026-07-30T14:04:46+00:00","company":"Corporate Travel Specialists","company_logo":"","position":"Next Steps","tags":["travel","exec"],"description":"Join Corporate Travel Specialists for a career as individual as you are. For more information about joining us please complete the form below and we will have your local state-based business partnership manager get in touch with you.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ENDEAR** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Stepps, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-next-steps-corporate-travel-specialists-1135724","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-next-steps-corporate-travel-specialists-1135724"},{"slug":"remote-koparka-bujak-maszyny-1135729","id":"1135729","epoch":1785419246,"date":"2026-07-30T13:47:26+00:00","company":"Bujak Maszyny","company_logo":"","position":"Koparka","tags":["technical","full time","controller"],"description":"Szybko\u00c5\u009b\u00c4\u0087 i doskona\u00c5\u0082a dok\u00c5\u0082adno\u00c5\u009b\u00c4\u0087 pionowa to cechy, kt\u00c3\u00b3re uzyskuje si\u00c4\u0099 dzi\u00c4\u0099ki temu wytrzyma\u00c5\u0082emu hydraulicznemu \u00c5\u009bwidrowi o wysokim momencie obrotowym.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LOVELY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Bankura, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-koparka-bujak-maszyny-1135729","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-koparka-bujak-maszyny-1135729"},{"slug":"remote-site-operation-jakson-group-1135727","id":"1135727","epoch":1785414264,"date":"2026-07-30T12:24:24+00:00","company":"JAKSON Group","company_logo":"","position":"Site Operation","tags":["technical","full time"],"description":"<strong>Job Requirements<br><br><\/strong>For the Site Operation position, strong technical skills are essential for success in this full-time role. Candidates should possess a solid foundation in technical skills to effectively carry out the responsibilities of the job.<br><br><strong>Work Experience<br><br><\/strong>technical operation and maintenance<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **RESTRUCTURED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Roorkee, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-site-operation-jakson-group-1135727","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-site-operation-jakson-group-1135727"},{"slug":"remote-accounts-assistant-cube-construction-group-ltd-1135829","id":"1135829","epoch":1785411995,"date":"2026-07-30T11:46:35+00:00","company":"CUBE Construction Group Ltd.","company_logo":"","position":"Accounts Assistant","tags":["exec","customer support","legal","accounting","sys admin","finance","microsoft","ops","excel","product manager","music","game dev","technical","dev","marketing","devops","engineer","digital nomad","supervisor","c","speech","video","seo","content writing","design","education","golang","testing","admin","full time","full stack","architecture","cloud","backend","coordinator","sales","salesforce","python","sql","postgres","senior","junior","recruiter","virtual assistant","payroll"],"description":"<p>About the Role<\/p><p>CUBE Construction Group Ltd is seeking a detail-oriented and reliable <strong>Accounts Assistant<\/strong> to support the day to day financial operations of our growing construction business.<\/p><p>This role is critical to ensuring that our accounting processes remain accurate, organized, and efficient, supporting multiple projects running simultaneously.<\/p><p>We are looking for someone who is structured, proactive, and takes ownership of their work.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Key Responsibilities<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 process and verify supplier invoices<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 assist with accounts payable and receivable<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 prepare and issue client invoices<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 record and post payments accurately<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 assist with weekly payroll processing and payroll journals<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 reconcile bank transactions and petty cash<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 maintain accurate financial records and filing systems<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 assist with month-end reporting and financial tasks<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 generate reports as required by management<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>What We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re Looking For<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 BSc Degree in Accounting<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 minimum 3 years\u00e2\u0080\u0099 experience in a similar role<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 working knowledge of QuickBooks and Microsoft Excel<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 strong attention to detail and accuracy<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 ability to meet deadlines and manage multiple tasks<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 strong organizational and communication skills<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This Role Requires Someone Who<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 takes responsibility for accuracy and timelines<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 works efficiently without constant supervision<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 is organized and methodical<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 can operate in a fast-paced environment<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Why Join CUBE<\/p><p>We are building a<strong> structured, high-performance construction company <\/strong>with strong systems and processes.<\/p><p>You will be part of a team that values:<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 accountability<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 efficiency<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 growth<\/p><p>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 professionalism<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>How to Apply<\/p><p>Send your CV along with a short note explaining:<\/p><p><strong>\u00e2\u0080\u009cHow you ensure accuracy when handling financial data.\u00e2\u0080\u009d<\/strong><\/p><p>jobs@cubeconstructiongroup.com<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ENTHUSIAST** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Bridgetown, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-accounts-assistant-cube-construction-group-ltd-1135829","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-accounts-assistant-cube-construction-group-ltd-1135829"},{"slug":"remote-current-vacancies-donnington-group-1135678","id":"1135678","epoch":1785406321,"date":"2026-07-30T10:12:01+00:00","company":"Donnington Group","company_logo":"","position":"Current Vacancies","tags":[],"description":"We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking for thoughtful innovators, self-starters and those who truly believe they can make a difference to someone else\u00e2\u0080\u0099s day. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re interested in people who have that magic ingredient that truly connects us to our guests and to each other by making our working experience more enjoyable and ultimately rewarding.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FASHIONABLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Swift Current, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-current-vacancies-donnington-group-1135678","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-current-vacancies-donnington-group-1135678"},{"slug":"remote-vacancy-marmend-1135725","id":"1135725","epoch":1785404840,"date":"2026-07-30T09:47:20+00:00","company":"Marmend","company_logo":"","position":"Vacancy","tags":["travel","exec","full time"],"description":"Kyiv, Ukraine Full-Time On-site<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>asdf<br><br>Benefits &amp; perks<br><br><ul><li>asfwer<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Skills<br><br><\/strong>\u00e2\u009c\u0093 vim<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BELIEVEABLE** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Kyiv, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-vacancy-marmend-1135725","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-vacancy-marmend-1135725"},{"slug":"remote-junior-ui-ux-designer-marmend-1135902","id":"1135902","epoch":1785404799,"date":"2026-07-30T09:46:39+00:00","company":"Marmend","company_logo":"","position":"Junior UI UX Designer","tags":["design","sys admin","designer","exec","junior","ops","part time","digital nomad"],"description":"\u00e2\u0082\u00ac4\u00e2\u0080\u00935 \/ hour (gross)<br><br>Junior UI\/UX Designer<br><br>Tallinn, Estonia Part-Time Remote<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>Marmend is a young and ambitious startup building a centralized platform for business management and employee engagement. We offer an intuitive solution suitable for companies of all sizes \u00e2\u0080\u0094 from small businesses to large corporations. Our goal is to simplify business processes and make hiring more efficient by bringing all the necessary tools together in one place. We aim to reduce complexity, offering a transparent pricing model and a streamlined system without unnecessary features, so companies can focus on what matters most. In the future, we plan to expand the platform, making it easier for companies and job seekers to connect, speeding up the hiring process. If you're excited about creating an innovative product that transforms the way businesses manage their operations and teams, join us! Be a part of the future of technology.<br><br>Benefits &amp; perks<br><br><ul><li>Gaining experience in a dynamic startup environment<\/li><li>Contributing to an exciting and innovative project<\/li><li>Collaborating with a highly coordinated and cohesive team<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Skills<br><br><\/strong>\u00e2\u009c\u0093 Adobe \u00e2\u009c\u0093 Adobe \u00e2\u009c\u0093 Figma \u00e2\u009c\u0093 Figma<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PLAYFUL** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Tallinn, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-junior-ui-ux-designer-marmend-1135902","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-junior-ui-ux-designer-marmend-1135902"},{"slug":"remote-freelance-illustrator-marmend-1135764","id":"1135764","epoch":1785404789,"date":"2026-07-30T09:46:29+00:00","company":"Marmend","company_logo":"","position":"Freelance Illustrator","tags":["dev","speech","finance","exec","ops","golang","digital nomad","illustrator"],"description":"Kyiv, Ukraine Freelance Remote<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong><strong>Marmend<\/strong> \u00e2\u0080\u0094 \u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bb\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b4\u00d0\u00b0 \u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00b1\u00d1\u0096\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00b0 \u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00bf\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bd\u00d1\u0096\u00d1\u008f, \u00d1\u0089\u00d0\u00be \u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00be\u00d1\u0080\u00d1\u008e\u00d1\u0094 \u00d0\u00bf\u00d0\u00bb\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0082\u00d1\u0084\u00d0\u00be\u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00bc\u00d1\u0083 \u00d0\u00b4\u00d0\u00bb\u00d1\u008f \u00d1\u0083\u00d0\u00bf\u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00bb\u00d1\u0096\u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00bd\u00d1\u008f \u00d0\u00b1\u00d1\u0096\u00d0\u00b7\u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00b5\u00d1\u0081\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bc \u00d1\u0096 \u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00b7\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0094\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b4\u00d1\u0096\u00d1\u0097 \u00d0\u00b7 \u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00b4\u00d0\u00be\u00d1\u008e. \u00d0\u00a8\u00d1\u0083\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0094\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00be \u00d1\u0096\u00d0\u00bb\u00d1\u008e\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0082\u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00be\u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00b0, \u00d1\u008f\u00d0\u00ba\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b9 \u00d0\u00b4\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bf\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b6\u00d0\u00b5 \u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bc \u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b7\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00b8\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00b8 \u00d0\u00b2\u00d1\u0096\u00d0\u00b7\u00d1\u0083\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bb\u00d1\u008c\u00d0\u00bd\u00d1\u0083 \u00d0\u00bc\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b2\u00d1\u0083 \u00d0\u00bf\u00d1\u0080\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b4\u00d1\u0083\u00d0\u00ba\u00d1\u0082\u00d1\u0083.<br><br>Benefits &amp; perks<br><br><ul><li>\u00d0\u00a2\u00d0\u00b5\u00d1\u0081\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00b5 \u00d0\u00b7\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00b2\u00d0\u00b4\u00d0\u00b0\u00d0\u00bd\u00d0\u00bd\u00d1\u008f \u00d0\u00b7 \u00d0\u00be\u00d0\u00bf\u00d0\u00bb\u00d0\u00b0\u00d1\u0082\u00d0\u00be\u00d1\u008e<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Skills<br><br><\/strong>\u00e2\u009c\u0093 Illustration<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **MESMERIZED** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Kyiv, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-freelance-illustrator-marmend-1135764","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-freelance-illustrator-marmend-1135764"},{"slug":"remote-supply-chain-amp-operations-specialist-miss-amara-1135691","id":"1135691","epoch":1785404772,"date":"2026-07-30T09:46:12+00:00","company":"Miss Amara","company_logo":"","position":"Supply Chain &amp; Operations Specialist","tags":["virtual assistant","coordinator","customer support","marketing","ops","medical","non tech","dev","video","cloud","microsoft","exec","digital nomad","design","education","content writing","sales","full time","part time","c sharp","react","hr","sys admin","infosec","python","teaching","technical","testing","web dev","scrum","javascript","java","c","c plus plus","css","html","git","angular","node","node.js","senior","engineer","internship","excel","stats","recruiter","finance","game dev","golang","ecommerce"],"description":"<strong>Supply Chain &amp; Operations Specialist - Join Us at Miss Amara!<br><br><\/strong>If you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re a natural problem-solver who loves keeping things moving in a fast-paced e-commerce world, this role is for you.<br><br>As our Supply Chain &amp; Operations Specialist, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be the driving force ensuring our DTC and B2B orders are delivered smoothly and on time. By tackling fulfillment bottlenecks with your amazing attention to detail, you'll directly protect our brand trust and keep our customers smiling!<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be the heart of our daily outbound operations! You will coordinate dispatch, manage inventory and returns, and keep our logistics dashboards up to date.<br><br>Working closely with our logistics partners and CX team, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll ensure everything flows beautifully. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099d love for you to bring fresh ideas! You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll have the freedom to spot process gaps, streamline manual tasks, and help us scale our operations as we grow.<br><br><strong>Key Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Order Management: Process and manage DTC and B2B orders across all channels, ensuring accurate statuses and seamless fulfillment across our systems.<\/li><li> Logistics Coordination: Work directly with warehouse teams and freight carriers to manage dispatch and swiftly resolve any booking issues or pickup delays.<\/li><li> Issue Resolution: Act as the primary go-to for Operations escalations, communicating directly with marketplaces to resolve order issues, delays, and fulfillment bottlenecks.<\/li><li> Inventory &amp; Returns: Handle day-to-day inventory tasks, including returns, stock adjustments, and reconciliations in collaboration with our Ops and CX teams.<\/li><li> Stock Integrity: Monitor inventory levels closely, proactively flagging any discrepancies or stock mismatches between Cin7, the WMS, and our marketplace channels.<\/li><li> Inbound Support: Provide secondary backup for inbound logistics, assisting with shipping bookings and pre-shipment supplier coordination when needed.<\/li><li> Process Improvement: Identify operational gaps and implement fresh efficiencies to streamline daily tasks, bringing proactive solutions to recurring issues.<\/li><li> Projects &amp; SOPs: Help document Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) and support the rollout, process mapping, and testing of new tools and supply chain improvements.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>What Will Help You Succeed You'll Likely Bring<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Previous experience in a fast-paced e-commerce business, specifically dealing with order management, administrative tasks, data entry, and document management.<\/li><li>Strong organizational skills and meticulous attention to detail.<\/li><li>Excellent written and spoken English communication skills.<\/li><li>The ability to work independently while collaborating seamlessly with cross-functional teams and partnering with a diverse group of people.<\/li><li>A proactive approach to completing tasks, solving problems, and leading initiatives.<\/li><li>Proficiency in using Google Sheets and Microsoft Office.<\/li><li>Experience with Cin7, MS Excel, and Gmail is a strong advantage. General experience with any order management system, freight booking platforms, or supplier\/vendor platforms is highly beneficial.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>About Us<br><br><\/strong>At Miss Amara, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re reimagining the rug-buying experience through bold innovation, industry-first tech, and a customer-obsessed mindset. Since launching in 2014, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099ve grown fast, earning national recognition including AFR Fast 100 (2022), Best Retail Marketing and Best Medium Online Retailer at the National Retail Awards (2023), and Best Online Retail Marketing at the Australia Post ORIA Awards (2023). With free returns, free styling advice, and cutting-edge virtual tools, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re changing the game, and loving every minute of it.<br><br><strong>We care <\/strong>about people (our team, our customers, our partners, our manufacturers), the environment, what we sell, and how we sell it. <strong>Be transparent <\/strong>in our communication and always share a true picture of our business.<br><br><strong>Keep it simple <\/strong>in our systems, processes, and customer experience.<br><br><strong>Fast. Test. Learn. Adapt. <\/strong>to make quick, informed decisions and stay ahead.<br><br><strong>Best in Class <\/strong>in delivering an exceptional, uncomplicated journey to buying your dream rug online.<br><br>If this sounds like your kind of role, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099d love to hear from you! Apply now and let\u00e2\u0080\u0099s create something amazing together.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FERVIDLY** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Metro Manila","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-supply-chain-amp-operations-specialist-miss-amara-1135691","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-supply-chain-amp-operations-specialist-miss-amara-1135691"},{"slug":"remote-trafic-filmtheater-cinecenter-1135731","id":"1135731","epoch":1785403590,"date":"2026-07-30T09:26:30+00:00","company":"Filmtheater Cinecenter","company_logo":"","position":"Trafic","tags":["technical","full time","controller"],"description":"Regie<br><br>Jacques Tati<br><br>Cast<br><br>Jacques Tati, Maria Kimberly, Marcel Fraval, Honor\u00c3\u00a9 Bostel<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STURDIER** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Namkum, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-trafic-filmtheater-cinecenter-1135731","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-trafic-filmtheater-cinecenter-1135731"},{"slug":"remote-other-atoms-amp-space-1135667","id":"1135667","epoch":1785400241,"date":"2026-07-30T08:30:41+00:00","company":"Atoms &amp; Space","company_logo":"","position":"Other","tags":[],"description":"A London and New York based studio focused on strategic clarity and creative systems that drive real-world outcomes, founded on the belief that brands should be built for today's landscape. From targeted strategic solutions to full brand architecture and creative platforms, we craft cohesive systems designed to scale across the entire customer journey. Sofia exists to cut through complexity and bring ambitious brands into sharper focus.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LIKES** and tag RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwMToyODA6NTI4MTpkNzUwOmU5YTQ6YjViMTpmZDQwOjUzY2M=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Content, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-other-atoms-amp-space-1135667","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-other-atoms-amp-space-1135667"},{"slug":"remote-growth-marketer-clanx-1135656","id":"1135656","epoch":1785398430,"date":"2026-07-30T08:00:30+00:00","company":"CLANX","company_logo":"","position":"Growth Marketer","tags":["marketing","design","exec","recruiter","travel","finance","admin","content writing","digital nomad"],"description":"<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Overview<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nola is building the AI-native account for the next decade \u00e2\u0080\u0094 a stablecoin bank account with intelligence supporting every action. We're looking for a Founding Marketer to own growth, narrative, distribution, content, and experimentation from day one.<\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Company Details<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The ultra-wealthy have always had a private banker, a wealth manager, and a concierge running their financial life. Everyone else got an app and a PDF statement. Nola is that team for everyone \u00e2\u0080\u0094 a stablecoin bank account with intelligence supporting every action. It moves your money globally in seconds, earns high yield on your USD savings, and runs the admin of your life around it: the subscriptions, the travel, the eSIMs, the bookings, all the things you shouldn't have to do yourself.<\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Stablecoins, AI agents, and on-chain yield finally work \u00e2\u0080\u0094 all at the same time, for the first time. Whoever builds the AI-native account in this window owns where money moves through for the next decade.<\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Website: <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/nola.money\">https:\/\/nola.money<\/a><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p>3+ years of experience as a growth marketer in the B2C domain.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Experience taking a product or company from 0 to 1.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Worked at an early-stage startup and driven growth from zero to meaningful user adoption.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Built a public profile through a podcast, YouTube channel, newsletter, Twitter\/X audience, Substack, meme page, or similar.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Strong understanding of GTM without brand recognition, large budgets, or existing playbooks.<\/p><\/li><li><p>AI-native mindset with experience building agents, content pipelines, research workflows, automation systems, or outbound engines.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Ability to write, ship, and iterate quickly.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Currently working at a b2c startup.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Strong content creation and storytelling skills.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p>Own everything that brings users to Nola and keeps them there \u00e2\u0080\u0094 the narrative, the channels, the launch sequence, the founder content, the lifecycle, the experiments.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Define and execute the company narrative.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Build and scale acquisition channels.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Design and execute launch strategies.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Drive founder-led content initiatives.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Own lifecycle marketing and retention programs.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Run growth experiments across channels.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Build agents and automations to increase marketing leverage.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Create and ship content at high velocity.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Solve growth challenges with no predefined playbook.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Drive user growth and engagement across the funnel.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Job Details<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Remote<\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Interview Process<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p>Recruiter Screen<\/p><\/li><li><p>Founder Conversation<\/p><\/li><li><p>Marketing Strategy Round<\/p><\/li><li><p>Assignment Round<\/p><\/li><li><p>Final Founder Round<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"min-height: 1.7em;\"><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Important Note<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">ClanX is a recruitment partner, helping Nola hire a Founding Marketer.<\/p><br>